<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Laakkossiinka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Laakkossiinkaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Laakkosiinkaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lak.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Laakkossiinkaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichcho</para>
  <para style="ip">Kunni laakkossiinki Maxaaf kula'neeki raagi; Isa'eeliki ardi Siinaxxe koobanaa'ni ke'e me'eexxe yannanaa'ni ke'ise Mageni insa'ne'a uwwo'a kako aage'e addachchiiseemmake bogixxa boroti darexxa gabala shinqaaqico'ni hedhdheeka shoole tomme woggaka raaga kulaan. Konne Maxaafiki summi raaguuwi iimidarre saxxe leellita'neexxa kuta leelisha'neen; kunninna Isra'eelito Siinaxxa koobba waalde kexxe me'iteba edidare; ittani mitte ila uduma Yordaanosike galaaniba'ni boroti daree'ni Mo'abike bogani Muusse arda laakko'exxa leellishshaani. Lamiinge ardiinke laakkossi giddo Isra'eelito Kannanike bogixxa bita'i darexxe gabala kaddeexxa Qaadesi barinne gennee'naatemani; kado male'e ookkone darree'ni addetike bogiba'a e'ya dandeennebaan; kaddolenna ookkonne boonchike qariqara'n heddo wogga ofolleehchi uduma Yordaanosike galaanibaa'ni boroti darre'ni hedhdheeke bogiba'a me'ine; gamisi ardi ookkonni he'no'a mudhdhinaa wodda; gateemmaki ardi kinni Yordaanoosika galaanna fofeexxi Kannanike bogiba'a me'o'a qophpheefffate. Lakkossiinki Mxaaf heddo yanna rakko insa'ne'ni geltaa wodda sodaata'ni adde gophati; Magenoke'ninna insa'nee akeeko'a Magen insa'ne'a fileeke Muusse'ni jallatammake ardike ragaan. Ardi gophphaalessakenna ajajemabaake kadoolenna midde Mageni insa'nee kubbisa'n hedhdhemmaxxa raagi leellisha'neeni; iittani Muuse mitte mitte yanna ossunte afa gophoolenna; jabaxxa adde afeemmaxxeenna Magenokanna arda ifikee addatenshati erigaatemeeke kadeexxa leellishaan.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Isra'eelito Siinaxxe koobanaa'ni me'ate qophpheeffatteexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-9:23">1:1—9:23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Siretika gosa gosak ardiinka laakkosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-4:49">1:1—4:49</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Gargaritti hedheeka seesuwwanna gadumuwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 5:1-8:26">5:1—8:26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Langaka sa'atika ayyaana <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 9:1-23">9:1-23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Siinaxxe koobanaa'ni Mo'abike bogiba'a <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 10:1-21:35">10:1—21:35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mo'abike boga'ni kaddeexxa yaanuwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-32:42">22:1—32:42</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gibtse'ni Mo'abi qico'ni me'inexxa me'a harumaqicinni <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 33:1-49">33:1-49</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yordaanosika galaana foonfeba edigama uwwemeeka seeruwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 33:50-36:13">33:50—36:13</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ardiinka Laakkossa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelik ardi Gibtse'n fuleexxe langaxxe woggake, langake agenjixxe taakkaxxe barra'n Siinaxxe qilla gammoojje giddo, afenshatike duunkaani giddo Muusee hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />«Labballo mitti mittingika summa ganati borreesitina'n Isira'eelika arda duuchcha isixxe gosa gosanaa'ninna isike mini mini hado'n lakko'i. <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />Atinna Aarooni Isira'eeli giddo hedheeka lame tomme wogganna yookaan iimi ga'ma hedheeka labballo, duule lola dande'aaka mitte mittenga isike qorbi qorba'n laakko'we. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Mitte mitte gosati mininaa'ni mitti mitti ifike min hadik sooreessi ha'nonni welti hedheexxi ha'noo gargarowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Ha'no'o gargaaraake mannik summi konnechchin butti'a hedheeken.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 1:5" />
  <para style="li" vid="NUM 1:5">Roobelike gosatike mininaa'n, Sediyoorik beltti Elitsuur;<verse eid="NUM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Simoonikenaa'n</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NUM 1:6">Suurisedayik belti Selemi'eeli,<verse eid="NUM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />Yihudakenaa'n</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NUM 1:7">Aminadaabik belti Ne'asoon;<verse eid="NUM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />Yisakoorinaa'n, Tsi'aarik belti Naatina'eeli;<verse eid="NUM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />Zabilonikena'n, Helonik belti Eli'aabi;<verse eid="NUM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Yooseefixxa labbaxxa oose:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:10">Efireemi darree'n Amihuudik belti Elishaama'i;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:10">Minaase darree'n Fidasuurik beltti Gemali'eeli;<verse eid="NUM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Biiniyaamikenaa'n, Gadeyoonik belti Abidaani;<verse eid="NUM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Daanikena'n, Amisadayik belti Ahi'eezer;<verse eid="NUM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Aseerikenaa'n, Ekiraanik belti Faagu'eeli;<verse eid="NUM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Gaadikennaa'ni, Degu'elik belti Elisaafi;<verse eid="NUM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Nefitaaleemik, Enaanik belti Ahiira'i.»<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Kunni aridakenaa'n filemeeke, ifi ifixxe gosati minike edi annuwwa kada wodda insa'nenna Isira'eelixxe gosake akeekisanjuwwamman.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Muusenna Aarooni konnee insa'neek summi borreessemeeka manna aa'neexxi, <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />langake agenjixxe taakkaxxe barra'n, arda duuchcha ye'ne mitteba bukki assineexxi labballo gosa gosati mine mini'ninna insa'neeke mini mini hado'n lame tomme woggakanna yookaan eettene iimidarre hedheeka mitti mittingika summa borreessine. <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e ajajemmashshanni Muuse Siinaxxe qiilla Gammoojje giddo arda laakko'e.<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Isira'eelika angafa Roobelixxe hortenaa'n duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak laballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosatike mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitti mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />Roobelixxe hortenaa'n lakko'emeek shoole tommenna jaane kumanna onde dhibbaman.<verse eid="NUM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Simoonixxe hortenaa'n, duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak labballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosatike mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />Simoonixxe hortenaa'n lakkoo'emeek onde tommenna sallane kumanna sase dhibbamman.<verse eid="NUM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Gaadixxe hortenaa'n duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak labballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosati mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />Gaadixxe hortenaa'n laakko'emeek shoole tommenna onde kumanna jaane dhibbanna onde tommemman.<verse eid="NUM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Yihudaxxe hortenaa'n duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak labballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosati mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />Yihudaxxe hortenaa'n laakko'eemeek torbaane tommenna shoole kumanna jaane dhibbaman.<verse eid="NUM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Yisakoorixxe hortenaa'n: duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak labballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosati mine'ninna, ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />Yisakoorixxxe hortenaa'n laakko'emeek onde tommenna shoole kumanna shoole dhibbamman.<verse eid="NUM 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Zabilonixxi hortenaa'n: duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxaa woggak labballi duuchchi, ifi ifike gosati mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />Zabilonixxe hortenaa'n laakko'emeek onde tommenna torbaane kumanna shoole dhibbamman.<verse eid="NUM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Yooseefixxi labbaxxi oose, Efireemixxe horte darrenaa'n duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak labballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosati mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />Efireemike gosati mininaa'n laakko'emeek shoole tomme kumanna onde dhibbamman.<verse eid="NUM 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Minaasexxe hortenaa'n duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak labballi duuchchi ifii fike gosati mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />Minaasexxe hortenaa'n lakko'emeek sase tommenna lame kumanna lame dhibbaman.<verse eid="NUM 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Biiniyaamixxe hortenaa'n duule lola dande'aak lame tomme wogga kinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak labballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosatike mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />Biniyaamixxe hortenaa'n lakko'emeek sase tommenna onde kumanna shoole dhibbamman.<verse eid="NUM 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Daanixxe hortenaa'n duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak labballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosatike mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreeseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />Daanixxe hortenaa'n laakko'emeek jaane tommenna lame kumanna torbaane dhibbamman.<verse eid="NUM 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Aseerixxe hortenaa'n duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxe woggak labballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosatike mine'ninna ifii ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />Aseerixxe hortenaa'n laakko'emeek shoole tommenna mitte kumanna onde dhibbamman.<verse eid="NUM 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Nefitaaleemixxe hortenaa'n duule lola dande'aak lame tomme woggakinna ookkonechchi iima hexxeexxaa woggak labballi duuchchi ifi ifike gosatike mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n borreessememmashshanni mitte mittingik summi borreesseme. <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />Nefitaalemixxe hortenaa'n laakko'emeek onde tommenna sase kumanna shoole dhibbamman.<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Kunni Muusenna Aarooni, mitti mitting ifi ifike mini hadixxe tukke kade'emak tommenna lami Isira'eelik akeekisanjuwwi laakkoo'eemmake labballomman. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Konne qicinni Isira'eelik labballi wogga insa'neexxinna lame tommenna eettene iimidarre kadeek Isira'eelike sannachchinni duula dande'aak duuchchi ifi ifike mini hadi hadishshanni laakko'emme. <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />Duuchchingik laakkos mitteba jaane dhibanna sase kumanna onde dhibbanna onde tommeman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:1-51">Lak. 26:1-51</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Leewwik gosati mini minik haduwwi kinni wele gosati mininni welti laakko'emeemmabaan. <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />Tinninna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />«Leewwika gosati mine laakkottoxxe'e yookaan laakkossa insa'neekanna wele Isira'eelike laakkosi giddo e'yishshoxxe'e. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />Erttenexxa bado Leewwito galduma Kakotike Taabotikanna isi giddo hedheeke mi'uwwa duuchcha'n iittanni tennenni welti afendaaxxi heene yaanuwwa hana yaane uuddaake assi; insa'ne Taabotiinke gldumika Fooqaanna isi giddo hedheeka mi'uwwa duuchcha ba'e'nowwaal; isi giddonna ergatemmowwaal; ifi ifika duunkaani dowwe isixxe'n oltinowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Taaotinke galdumik duunkaan welebaa ke'aaxxa yanna Leewwito isoo goshshaan; mare geyaake booncho'ninna isoo ottaan; weli manji isibaa shiqoole kinni shiyemowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Isira'eelik manninna ifi ifike qorbinni ifi ifixxe kaanbe'n ifi ifika duunkaana ifi ifike baandiri bira oltaan. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Yaane kinni Isira'eelike orga'n aare ibbabaashsha Leewwito ifi ifika duunkaana Kakotike Taabotixxe galdumixxe dowwe'n oltowwaal. Galduma Kakotike Taabotixxi yaane uuddaak Leewaawwootaken.»<verse eid="NUM 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Tennexxee Isira'eeliki ardinna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'n hiyyemmaxxa duuchcha asse.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kaambe Giddo Gosa Gosati Minike Ardixxa Baka Abixxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'ninna Aarooni'n hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />Isira'eelik ardi kaambe giddo afenshatike duukaanixxe dowwe'n shiixxo qico bayyateexxi offo'laan; offo'laqicinna mitti mitting ifi ifike qorbike beesisi baandir hundanna ifi ifike gosati mini hundan.<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />Boroti darree'n arsho fuldamabaa'n Yihudak qorbi ifi ifike sanachchuwwinni ifi ifike bandiri hunda offo'laan; Yihudake ardik akeekisanji Aminadaabike belto Ne'asooniten. <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />Isike qorbike sannachchik laakkossi torbaane tommenna shoole kumanna jaane dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Insa'nenaa'n aaneexxi Yisaakoorike gosati mini offo'laan; Yisaakoorike gosati minik akeekisanjinna Tsi'aarike belto Naatina'eelite kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />Isike qorbik sannachchi laakkosi onde tommenna shoole kumanna shoole dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Zabilonixxe gosati mini itti aanaan; Zabilonike gosatike minik akeekisanjinna Helonike belto Eli'aabitemman. <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />Isike qorbike sannachchi laakkosi onde tommenna torbaane kumanna shoole dhibban. <verse eid="NUM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Duuchching mitteba Yihudaxxe Kaambe'n ifi ifike qorba'n laakko'eemeeke sannachchik laakkossi dhibbanna saddeeta tommenna jaane kumanna shoole dhibban. Insa'ne edinsee fullaan.<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />Bita'i darree'n Robelixxe kaambek qorbi ifi ifike bandiri hunda offo'laan; Roobelike ardik akeekisanjinna Sediyoorik belto, Elitsuurte kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />Isike qorbike sannachchik laakkosi shoole tommenna jaane kumanna onde dhibban. <verse eid="NUM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Insa'ne'n aaneexxi Simoonik gosatik mine ofo'laan; Simoonike ardike akeekisanjinna Suurisedayike belto, Selemi'eeliten. <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />Isike qorbike sannachchi laakkosi onde tommenna salane kumanna sase dhibban. <verse eid="NUM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Ookkeechchi uduma Gaadike gosaki mini hadi itti aanaan; Gaadike ardik akeekisanji De'uuliki belto, Elisaafiten. <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />Isike qorbike sannachchik laakkosi shoole tommenna onde kumanna jaane dhibbanna onde tommen. <verse eid="NUM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Duuchchiing mitteba Roobelixxe Kaambe'n ifi ifike qorba'n laakko'emeeke mannik laakkosi dhibbanna onde tommenna mitte kumanna shoole dhibbanna onde tommen. Insa'ne itti aanne fullaan.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Leewwito afenshatika duunkaana axxeexxi oddote'n me'itaan. Mitti mittingi kaambe giddo offo'lema qicinni ifi ifike bandir hunda me'aan.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />Dhidhimi darree'n Efireemixxe kaambek qorbik sannachchi ifi ifike bandiri hunda offo'laan; Efiremike ardik akeekisanji Amihuudik belto, Elishaama'ite kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />Isike qorbike sannachchi laakkosi shoole tomme kumanna onde dhibban.<verse eid="NUM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Insa'nenaa'n itti aanaak Minaaseke gosati mine kadaan. Minaaseke ardik akeekisanji Fidadasuurike belto, Gemali'eelite. <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />Isike qorbike sannachchi laakkosi sase tommenna lame kumanna lame dhibban. <verse eid="NUM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Biiniyaamik gosatik mini itti aanaan. Binyamike ardki akeekisanjinna Gadeyoonike belto, Abidaanite kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />Isike qorbike sannachchi laakkosi sase tommenna onde kumanna shoole dhibban. <verse eid="NUM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Duuchchiing mitteba Efireemixxe kaambe'n ifi ifike qorba'n laakko'emeeke labballik laakkossi dhibbanna saddeeta kumanna dhibbaken. Insa'ne sakkaba fullaan.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />Middi darree'n Daanixxe kaambek qorbi ifi ifike bandiri hunda offo'laan; Daanike ardik akeekisanjinna Amisadayike belto Ahi'eezerite kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />Isike qorbike sannachchik laakkossi jaane tommenna lame kumanna torbaane dhibban. <verse eid="NUM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Aseerik gosati mini insa'ne'n itti aaneexxi offo'laan. Asserike ardik akeekisanjinna Ekiraanike belto, Faagi'eelite kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />Isike qorbike sannachchi laakkossi shoole tommenna mitte kumanna onde dhibban. <verse eid="NUM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Nefitaalemike gosati mini itti aanaan; Nefiitaalmike ardik akeekisanji Eenaanike belto Ahiira'ite kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />Isike qorbike sannachchi laakkossi onde tommenna sase kumanna shoole dhibban. <verse eid="NUM 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Duuchching mitteba Daanixxe kaambe'n ifi ifike qorba'n laakko'emeeke labballik laakkossi dhibbanna onde tommenna torbaane kumanna jaane dhibban. Insa'ne baandira ifiki hunda he'neexxi udu'mine fullaan. <verse eid="NUM 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Kunni ifi ifike mini hado'ninna ifi ifike qorba'ni laakko'eemeke Isira'eelike ardan. Kaambe giddo ifi ifike qorba'n laakko'eemeek duuchching jaane dhibbanna sase kumanna onde dhibbanna onde tommeman. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Kaddo malee Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse'e ajajemmashshanni, Leewwito wele Isira'eelike ardinni welti laakko'endebaan.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Tennexxee Isira'eelik ardi Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse'e ajajemmashshanni duuchchiinxa asse; tinninna insa'ne kaambe giddo ifi ifike baandiri hunda ofollan, ifi ifike gosatike mininninna ifi ifike mini hadinni me'inaamman.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Leewwito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Siinaxxe Kooba'n Muusenni haaso'e wodda Aaroonixxenna Muusexxe ilake daalixxi jirte konnechchi butta hexxeeshshaten.<verse eid="NUM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Aaroonixxe labbaxxe oosek summi angafi Naadabi, weletiki Abihu, Ali'aazaarinna Itamaariten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:60">Lak. 26:60</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Insa'ne qeesummati ergatemmo'a gargar foyyeme'e qeesete kadatee'e hariirendeexxe Aaroonixxe labbaxxe oosemman. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Yaane kinni Naadabinna Abihu Siinaxxe qiilla gammoje'n seeriinxe kaddebaaxxe giira'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottii'a tolcha tolchineemmaxxee ookkonni isi edo renne. Insa'ne labbaxxa oose afagonpheemmaxxee Ali'aazaarinna Itamaari calli anni insa'neek Aarooni lubbo hedhemmaka baro qeesummati ergattemma'nemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lew. 10:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 26:61">Lak. 26:61</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />«Leewwika gosati mine iyyedaggetexxi qeessichcho Aaroonii'i gargaraashsha isi edo shiqisi. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Insa'ne afenshatike duunkaana'n Taabotinke galdumixxa huje hunja'n isi'anna origi duuchchi'a hasissaaxxa ergatensha ergatemmuun. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Insa'ne Taabotinke galdumixxa huje hunja'ninna Isira'eelik ardi'a ergatema hasissammaxxa duuchchanna ergatemma'n duunkaaniinka mi'a duuchcha heqqinuun. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Leewwito Aarooni'anna labbaxxee isixxe oose'a uwwi. Insa'ne Isira'eelike ardinaa'n foyyemmeexxi isi'a uwweme'eeken. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Qeesummati ergatemmo'a Aarooninna isixxa oose qeesoonsi weli ayyinna Taabotiinke galdumibaa shiqoole shiyemuun.»<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />«Angafake kadeexxi ileemaake Isira'eelike labbake duuchchixxa bado Leewwito Isira'eelike ardi giddii'n adhdheenen. Tennexxee Leewwito anxenni, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />angafake kadeek duuchchi anke kademmaxxee Gibtseke boga'n angafake kadeeka duuchcha shiyyenexxa yaanna manjo horekenaa'n hooneenna Isira'eeli giddika angafa ani ifi'a gargar fo'weennen anke kaduun. Ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Fula. 13:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse Siinaxxe qiilla gammoojje giddo hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />«Leewwito ifi ifike mini hado'ninna ifi ifike gosati minii'n laakko'i; ilemeexxi mitte agenjo geyeekanna yookaan ookko iimi darre hedheeka labbaka duuchcha lakko'i» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Tennexxee Muuse Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hiyyichchi isoo ajajemmashshann insa'nee laakko'e. <verse eid="NUM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Leewwixxe labbaxxe oosek summi Gershoon, Qe'aatinna Meraariten. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Gershoonixxe horetexxe oosek summi Loobeninna Semi'iten. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Qe'aatixxi horte Imbireem, Yisi'aar, Kebirooninna Uuzi'eeliten. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Meraarixxi horte Mohoolinna Muusiten. Yoona Leewwito hundaaye ifi ifixxike mini hado'n laakko'endaa wodda konneeraten.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Liibinitotixxinna Seme'itotixxi hundaaye Gershoonitotixxe hundaayyenaa'niten; insa'ne Gershoonixxe hortemman. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Insa'nenaa'n mitte agenjonna ookko iimi darre hexxeexxa wogga kadeexxi laakko'emeek labbak duuchching torbaane kumanna onde dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Gershoonitotixxi horte duunkaani uduma dhidhimi darre'n offolduun. <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Gershoonitotixxe hortek mini mini hadduwwik akeekisanji La'eelike belto Elisaafite kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Afenshatike duunkaani giddo Gershoonito uuddaaxxi yaane Taabotinka galdumanna duunkaana, duunkaanika buyyisanjuwwa, afenshatixxe duunkaanixxe huuddummeka seemmatika golo, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />Ba'liniika huudummetika seemmatika golo, Taabotinke galdumika duunkaananna tolchimalcho gollaaka hulatike ba'linnika golo, ookkone golixxa wodaruwwanna iittanni konnechchuwwinni welti abidendeexxa la'o uwwaachcho duuchcha heqqate kaddaan. <verse eid="NUM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Imbireemitotixxi, Yisi'aartotixxi, Kebiroonitotixxinna Uuzi'eelitotixxi hundaayye Qe'aatiten; insa'ne Qe'aatixxe hortemman. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Mitte agenjikinna ookko iimi darre hexxeexxe woggak duuchchinge labbakik laakkosi saddeeta kumanna jaane dhibba kadeexxi Qe'aatitotixxe huje woyyitte bakka heqqatemman. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Qe'atotixxi horte ofoldaabi Taabotii galdumike duunkaana bita'i darre'nite kadduun. <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Qe'aatixxe gosak mini mini haduwwik sooreessi Uzi'eelike belto, Elitsafaanite kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Insa'ne Taabota, beera torbaane dhankoka xassa, tolchimalchuwwa, woyyitte bakkaka mi'uwwa, seemmatika golonna konnechchuwwinni welti abidendeexxa la'o uwwaachcho duuchcha heqqinaan.<verse eid="NUM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Leewwitotiki umi sooreessi qeesichcho Aaroonike belto Ali'aazaaritemman; isinna woyyitte bakka'n ergatemo'a baallome'emake manni duuchchike galchallomman.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Moholatotixxinna Musayawitotixxi hundaayye Meraaritotixxe hundaayenaa'niten. Insa'ne Meraarixxe hortemman. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Insa'nenaa'n mitte agenjonna ookko iimi darre hexxeexxa wogga kadeexxi laakko'eemeek labbak duuchching jaane kumanna lame dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Meraartotixxe gosat mini hadik sooreessi Suurike belto Abi'eeltemman. Meraaritotinna afenshatike duunkaaninaa'n middi darre'n ofoldowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Meraaritonna Taabotii galdumike duunkaanika mikikilisanjuwwa, isika danqarsanjuwwa isika utuphuwwanna isika utuphuwwika lekkisanjuwwa, Taabotiinke galdumika miya duuchchanna konnechchuwwinni welti abidendeexxa la'o uwwaachcho duuchcha heqqatee baalloome'emman. <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />Iittanni baxxetixxe doweka utuphuwwa lekisanjuwwa isingenninni welti, isixxe kaasowwaninna isexxe wodaruwwanni welti heqqinaamman.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Muuse, Aarooninna Aaroonixxa labbaxxi oose Taabotiike galdumike duunkanaa'n boroti darre'n arsho fuldamma darre'n duunkaani edi darre ofollaan; insa'nenna Isira'eelike ardixxe tukke kandeexxi woyyitte bakka heqqatee baalloommaan. Woyyitte bakkabaa shiqaak huuni weli manji kinni shiyemowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Mitte agenjikinna ookko iimi darre hexxeexxe woggak Muusenna Aarooni Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajajinni gosa gosatike mine'n laakkooneexxe labbaxxe Leewwitoki laakkossi mitteba lame tommenna lame kumamman.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse hiyyeeb qici, «Angafa kade'e ilemeeke mitte agenjonna ookko iima hexxeexxe woggaka Isira'eelika labballo duuchcha laakkoottettexxi summi summinni borreessi. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Angafa kadde ilendeexxe Isira'eelitotixxe oose duuchchixxa bado Leewwito, iittanni edise ilemeeke Isira'eelitotike hori duuchchixxa bado leewwototika hore ani'a aadhi; ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottan.» <verse eid="NUM 3:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Tennexxee Muuse Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isoo ajajemmashshanni Isira'eelitotike angafake kade ilemeeka duuchcha laakko'e. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Mitte agenjonna ookko iimi darre hexxeexxe wogga kadeexxi summi summinni borreeseme'emmake angafa labballuwwik laakkossi mitteba lame tommenna lame kumanna lame dhibbanna torbaane tommenna sasekemman.<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />«Angafake kadde ilendeexxe Isira'eelitotixxe oose duuchchixxa bado Leewwito iittanni edise ilemeeke Isira'elitotike hori duuchchixxa bado leewwitotika hore ani'a aadhi; Leewwito anxe kadduun; ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottan. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Laakkossi insa'neek Leewwitotike laakkossinaa'n lame dhibbanna torbaane tommenna sasik caaleeka Isira'eelitotika angafa woddota'a, <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />mitti mittinge angafixxee ha'urre jaane tomme giraama birretika sibljo woyyichchi Galmixxe kiiloxxe qixxe'n aaxxatton. <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />Gatteexxa Isira'eelito wodatee konne maalaqa Aarooni'ninna isixxe oosse'n uwwi.» <verse eid="NUM 3:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Muusenna angafa ilemeeka Isira'eelika labballo wodatika maallaqa laakkosik Leewwito caalemake Isira'eelike labballonaa'ni aadhe. <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />Isira'eelitotike angaffuwwinaa'n woyyitte bakkaxxe kiiloxxe qixxe'n tommenna onde kiilonna gamisa bukki asse. <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />Muusenna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti isoo ajajeshshanni ookkonee wodatika maallaqa Aarooni'ninnaa isixxe labbaxxe oose'n uwwe.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Qee'atito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse'ninna Aarooni'n hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />«Leewwixxe oosenaa'n Qe'aatito insa'nekee mini mini hado'ninna insa'nekee gosa gosati mine'n laakko'i. <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />Afenshatike duunkaani giddixxa huje ergatemo'a dagaaka sase tomme wogganaa'n onde tomme wogga hedheeka labballo duuchcha laakko'i.<verse eid="NUM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />«Afenshatike duunkaani giddo Qe'aatotixxi huje hara woyyichcha mi'a heqqaten. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Ardi kaanbe golsheexxi ke'aa wodda Aarooninna isixxi labbaxxi oose afenshatike duunkaani giddi'a e'yineexxi golleemmaka seemmatika golo dirrinseexxi isinni Kakotika Taabota mirqinowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma hallisemeeke ama'atike goginni isoo bunqeexxi iimatixxe bifaxxa seemmanna itti hana buyyinuun; isoo dunkammaxxa murguwwanna isexxe bakka bakka'ninni e'yinshuun.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />«Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a worqeti hujemeeke mi'uwwaara kunninna tolchendeexxi daabbo shiqqammak beeri hana iimatixxe bifaxxa seemma buyyineexxi itti hananna sibiljiinxa qore, saanuwwa, mooqquwwa, buuduwwanna ha'watike tolchik maqorqooruwwa iittani duuchchiinxa yanna ookkoo'n gophendammabaaxxi daabbo itti hana hexxuun. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Konneechchuwwa duuchcha diimmoxxe seemmanni bunqeexxi hallisemeeka hephphaka goga hana lenbe bunquun; isixxa dukatixxa murguwwanna isexxe bakka bakka'ninni e'yinshuun.<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />«Iimixxe bifaxxa seemmanna aa'neexxi torbaane dhankoke xassika offo'limalcho isike xassuwwinninni welti, xassuwwiinka xolsanjuwwa isinge offo'limalchuwwinninni welti, iittanni tenne la'o'n hossaaxxe zayiteka mi'uwwa duuchchanna isenni bunquun. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Torbaane dhankoke xassika offo'limachonna isinni welti afendeexxa la'o uwwaaka mi'uwwa duuchcha hallisemeeke ama'atike gogike buyyisanjinni mirqati dukisanjiinxe be'co hana ugginuun.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma worqetike tolchimalchi hana iimixxe bifaxxa seemma farri assineexxi ise hananna hallisemeeka ama'atika goga lenbe buyyati isoo dukatixxa murguwwanna iseenxe bakka bakka'ninni e'yinshuun.<verse eid="NUM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />«Iittanni woyyitte bakkaxxe ergatensha'a la'o uwwaaka mi'a duuchcha aa'neexxi iimatixxe bifaxxe seemmanni mirqine'e itti hananna hallisemeeka ama'atika goga lenbe buyyati dukisanjiinxe beco hana ugginuun.<verse eid="NUM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />«Sageettotike sibiljike Tolchimalchi hanii'n bululo hoyyineexxi isi hananna dhiiletixxe bifaxa seemma farri assinuun. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Tolchimalchoke'e la'o uuwwaaka mi'a duuchcha giiratixxa laanguwwa, otisanjo qallasumuwwa, faafasunjuwakanna hubbiqqichcha saanuwwa isi hananna uggurruun; isi hana ama'atike gogika buyyisanjo buyyinseexxi dunkisanjo murguwwanna isenxe bakka bakka'inni e'yinshuun.<verse eid="NUM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />«Aarooninna isixxi labbaxxi oose woyyitte bakkanna iseka woyyichcha mi'a duuchcha bunqe ke'neechchi uduma, manni kaambetenaa'n ke'oo'aa qophpheeffatammaxxa yanna Qe'aatito dukko'a daggowwaal; rennabaashsha kinni insa'ne konnee woyyichcha mi'a tunqoqqe'e; tennexxee afenshatik duunkaani giddo hedheeka mi'a dukkaaxxi Qe'aatitoten.<verse eid="NUM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />«Qeesichcho Aaroonik belti Ali'aazaar xassiinxe zayitexxi, fishshammake hixaanixxi, duuchchi wodda shiqammake midhatike tolchixxinna hariirtetixxe zayitexxi yaane isoo uudduun; iittanni Taabotiinka galdumanna isi giddo hedheechcho duuchcha, galmakanna isike mi'inninni welti heqquun.»<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muusenna Aaroonii'i hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />«Qee'aatitotixxi gosa Leewwixxenaa'n gargar foyendeexxi galaafatendaashsha assitinoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Hara woyyichcha mi'ibaa shinqaa wodda hedhoti he'naashshate malee rennabaashsha ha'no insa'nee assitinaa qici, Aarooninna isixxi labbaxxi oose woyyitte bakka giddi'a e'yineexxi mitte mittinga manjo huje hunje'n dhaanbuun; maa hujaaxxanna ege'nishuun. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Yaane kinni Qe'aatito woyyichcha mi'a heenoxxe yanna'anna midde uuddo'a e'yitoqe'e; e'yinoole rennaan.»<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gediisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />«Gershoonito insa'neke mini mini hado'ninna gosatike ancha ancha'n laakko'i. <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />Afenshatike duunkaani giddo ergatemmo'a dangaashsha, sase tomme woggaa'n onde tomme wogga qico'n hedheeka labballo duuchcha laakko'i.<verse eid="NUM 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />«Gershoonitotixxi hujetixxinna dukatixxi ergatensha konnechchinni butti'a hexxeeshshaten: <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />Insa'ne Taabotinke galdumika goluwwa, afenshatika duunkaanna isika buyyisanjonna isi hana buyyemeeka hallisemeeka ama'atika goga, afenshatike duunkaanixxe huddummeka seemmatika goluwwa, dunkuun. <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />Iittanni Taabotiinke galdumixxe'ninna isike tolchimalchixxe dowwe'n hedheeka isixxe huddummeka goluwwa, isixxe huddummexxe hulaka goluwwa, wodaruwwanna tenne ergatensha'a kadaaka mi'uwwa duuchcha dunkuun. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Gershoonitotixxi ergatensha dukatixxenna kaddo'o wele huje duuchcha, Aaroonixxenna isixxe labbaxxe oosexxe akeette hunda kadduun. Dukiyyo hasissaachcho duuchcha dunko'a deette insa'ne'n uutatton. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Yoona Gershoonitotixxe gosaxxi ergatensha afenshatike duunkaani giddo tenneten; huje insa'neexxi Aaroonika belto qeesichcho Itamaarixxe akeette hunda kadduun.<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meeraarito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />«Meraarito insa'neke gosa gosati mine'ninnna insa'neke mini mini haddo'n, <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />afenshatike duunkaani giddixxa huje ergatemo'a dagaaka sase tomme wogganaa'n onde tomme wogga qico'n hedheeka labballo duuchcha laakko'i. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Insa'ne afenshatike duunkaani giddo ergatemma wodda hunjaaxxi huje: Taabotiinke galdumixxa gubanuwwa, isika danqarsanjuwwa, utuphphuwwanna isika lekkisanjuwwa, <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />iittanni baxxetixxe dowwe'n hedheeka utuphuwwa isi isike lekkisanjuwwinni welti, kaasuwwa, wodaruwwa iittanni konnchuwwinni welti abidendeexxa la'o uwwaachcho duuchchanna wele hooneenna tennee ergatensha'a hasisaaka mi'uwwa duuchcha dunkuun; mitti mitting manji ba'edhaakaa mi'a gargari hiisitineexxi iso'n dhaabbe. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Yoonna Meraarito afenshatike duunkaani giddo, Aaroonika belto qeesichcho Itamaarixxe akeette hunda he'neexxi hunjaaxxi huje tenneten.»<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leewwixxe Gosati Minika Laakkossa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Muuse, Aarooninna ardink akeekisanjuwwi Qe'aatito gosati mine mine'n laakkone. <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />Afenshatike duunkaani giddixxa huje ergatemo'a dageek sase tomme wogganaa'n onde tomme wogga qico'n hedheek labballi duuchchi, <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />ifi ifke gosati mene'n laakko'emeek, lame kumanna torbaane dhibbanna onde tommemman. <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Kunni Qe'aatito duuchchinaa'n afenshatike duunkaani giddo argatemmammake manni duuchchike laakkossan. Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse darree'n ajajemmashshsanni Muusenna Aarooni konnee manna laakkonne.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Gershoonito ifike gosatike mine'n ifi ifike mini hado'n laakko'enddeemman. <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />Afenshatike duunkaani giddixxa huje ergatemo'a dageeke sase tomme wogganaa'n onde tomme wogga qico'n hedheek labballi duuchchi, <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />ifi ifke gosati mine mine'ninna ifi ifike mini hado'n laakko'emmaak duuchchi lame kumanna jaane dhibbanna sase tommemman. <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Kunni Gershoonitotenaa'n afenshatike duunkaani giddo ergatemaammake mannike duuchchiinge laakkossan. Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajemmashshanni Muusenna Aarooni konnee manna laakkonne.<verse eid="NUM 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Meraarito ifike gosati mine'n ifi ifike mini haddo'n laakko'enddeemman. <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />Afenshatike duunkaani giddixxa huje ergatemmo'a dageeka sase tomme wogganaa'n onde tomme wogga qico'n hedheek labballi duuchchi, <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />ifi ifike gosati mine'n laakko'emeek sase kumanna lame dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Kunni Meraartotike laakkossan; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse darree'ni insa'ne'n uwwemmake ajajishanni Muusenna Aarooni insa'nee laakkonne.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Tennexxee Muuse, Aarooninna Isira'eelik akeekisanjuwwi Leewwito gosati mini mini hado'n laakkonne. <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />Sase tomme wogganaa'n onde tomme wogga qico'n hedheek afenshatike duunkaani giddo ergatenshatixxa huje hujo'anna mi'a duko'a dageemmake <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />mannik laakkossi saddeeta kumanna onde dhibbanna saddeeta tommemman.<verse eid="NUM 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse darree'n uwwemake ajajishshanni mitti mitting ergatenshatixxe'ninna mi'a dukkatixxe huje'n dhaabeme.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 4:49">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse ajajemmashshanni laakko'emme.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Battoomakenaa'n Kaambetixxa Ca'a Hiyya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />«Gogiinka tare sa'aaka dhukkuba afeeka, yookaan labballiinke bisonaa'n shamini fulaaka yookaan rensha tuqiyyoti aadatishsha batto'eeka manjo duuchcha kaambe giddii'n fulchinaashsha Isira'eelito ajaji. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Labbakenna kadi meyyaxxa fulchi; Ani oddote'n galannoxxa ifixxa kaambe battoosinabaashsha kanbe giddii'n fulchi» <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Isira'eelik ardinna tenneenni asse; mannakanna kaambe giddii'n fulche. Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse ajajemashanni asse.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balleesatixxa Mura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:1-7">Lew. 6:1-7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />«Isira'eelike arda'n hitattoo qici, ‹Labba meyyak manji hoone orinninna mitte manjo balleessa tennenaa'n kexxeexxinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a addatema gopheeke kadoole ikki manji balleesanjoken; <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />hujeexxa cubbonna faaci'wowaal; hujemmaxxe balleessa'anna wo'ma mura, murendemmaxxe mura hana onde anga'n mitte anga lebeexxi balleessa geltemmake manji'a mura woxowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Balleesa geltemak iikki manji reyoole, mura isi'a aadhaak isik shiqik fir hedhagophoole kinni iitti mura Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe kaddamaxxee ookkone manjixxa cubbo biratike tolchi'a shiqammake gedhebiinke korbeesinni welti qeesichchokee uwwendowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Isira'eelik ardi iyyedagaaxxi woyyitte uwwa duuchcha uwwa eettenee aadhammake qeesichchixxe kaddaan. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Mitte mittinge manjixxi woyyitte uwwa umo ifi ifikinxenni; yaane kinni isi qeesichchokee uwwaaxxi uwwa qeesichiinxe kaddaan.› »<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aro'i I'nataaxxa Aruwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muusee'e, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />«Isira'eelik arda'n hitattoo qici: ‹Aro'o affeexxi mitte manjichcho yaadik wele labballiba'a higati ifike aro'i'a affeemmaxxa xuurameessumma xe'isheexxi, <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />wele labbalinni welti diiphphoole, tinninna illeti isee afeek manji hedhagopheemmaxxe'e iseke aro'inaa'n shoondoolenna, dhuga'a kulaak hedha gophamaxxee isexxi battooma farri hitteexxi leella gophphoole, <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />isek aro'o'n hinaaffetik yaadi galee'naa ise kinni batotteexxe kadde afendoole yookaan aro'o iseke'n hinaaffetik yaadi galena'a ise kinni battoottebaaxxe kadde afendoole, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />iikki manji eettene ifixxa are qeesichchibaa iyyedagowwaal; isexxeenna mitte kiilo so'inxa bulle uwwa iyyedagowwaal; tinni hinaafetee shiqqeexxi midhatixxi uwwa balleessa qalli assitaaxxe qallixxe uwwa kaddeemmaxxee iitti hana zayite dhangalaassoqqe'e hixaanakanna itti woroqe'e.<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />« ‹Qeesichchikinna manjichcho eettene iyyedageexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo urritaashsha assowaal. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma qeesichchi woyyichcha wode'e odolchote'n cosseexxi, Taabotii galdumike duunkaani giddii'n buttii'n shiixxoka buttina aadheexxi wodi'i giddo worowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Qeesichchikinna eettene manjichcho Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo uurritaashsha asseechchi uduma iseka umonna tikaan; hinaaffe qalli assitaaxxa midhatixxa uwwanna anga abiddaashsha assaan; Qeesichchikinna badino iyyedagaaka wode'e anga abidowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduuma qeesichchi, isee hiyya'n kakachisaa qici, «Aro'o atika affeenni hexxe'e wele labballinni dhiiphagophphe'e, ifinna battoossagophphpootole kunni badino iyydagaakke qararaake wodi'ixxi badino atee miitabaan. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Yaane kinni aro'o affeenni hexxe'e wele labballinni diiphphe battoottootole» <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />qeesichchikinna eetene manjichcho hiyye badinotixxa kako kakachisaa qici, «Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti tafa atika xuuxxati godoba atika bokossati arda atikixxe oddo'n badinotixxenna kakotixxe atee assowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />Kunni badino ate'n iyyedagaak wodi'i ha'witatto wodda atee godoba bokosso'o; tafa atikanna xuuxo'o.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 5:22">« ‹Manjichchotinna, «Hmiin. Hamiin» hitaan.<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />« ‹Okonnechchi uduuma qeesichchikinna konne'e badinotika hiyyichchuwwa borreesatike bidir hana borreessuun; ookkonechi udumi'a borrotanna qaraaranjo wodi'inni anshe balleessuun. <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />Badino idagammaka wode'enna eettene manjichcho'n ha'wisaan; woddi'ikinna godobi'a sa'eechchi uduma manjichchote'n qaraarto elagonphe geessisaan. <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />Qeesichchi hinaafete'e shiqqeexxe midhatixxa uwwa manjichotixxe anganaa'n aadheexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo dorseexxi tolchmalchiiba idagowaal. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Okonechchi uduma qallitixxe midhatixxe uwwanaa'n mitte qeerro kaddaaxxa aadheexxi tolchimalchi hana gubowwaal. Okonechchi uduma mannjichcho ookkonee wode'e ha'witaashsha assowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Manjichchotinna ifi battoossite aro'o ifike'ninna addatema gophpheexxe kaddoole konne badino idagammaka wode'e ha'witaa wodda godobi'a sa'eexxi qaraarto elagonphe, godoba ise'e bokossaan; tafa iseka xuuxaan; arda ifikixxe oddo'inna ise'e badinendeexxe kaddaan. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Kaddomale manjichcho battoottebaaxxenna ci'mendebaaxxe kaddoole balleessa affebaaxxe kaddaan; oosetanna ildaan.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29-30" />« ‹Yoonna mitte manjichcho aro'o affeenni hexxe'e welik hosse ifi battoossitoole, yookaan mitti manji are ifixxa hi'naafee'naa'a hinaaffetik yaadi iso'n galoole tenne yaanek seeri konnechchinni butti'a hedheeken: qeesichchi eettenee manjichcho Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo uurtaashsha asseexxi konnechchi iimidarre kulemeek seeruwwi duuchchi ise'n muuxemaashsha assaan. <verse eid="NUM 5:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Aro'o isekinna balleessa afebaake kadaan; manjichcho kinni ifixxe balleessaxxe buutoxxe'e hira alfiftaan› » hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Naazircho Kadatika Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />«Isira'eelika arda'n hitattoo qici, ‹Manji mitti meyyaxxi yookaan labbaki Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a gargar ifi foyeexxi Naazircho kado'a werreega werreegoole, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />Isi woyinetixxe bookanaa'ninna wele machchossaake ha'winaa'n ifi lagowaal; woyinetika yookaan wele machchoossaake ha'wo majajaaka ha'woqe'e; iitttanni woyinetixxa bookanna ha'woqqe'e; woyinetika tishanna kadi bageeka ittoqqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:15">Luq. 1:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Naazirchummatixxee yanna duuchcha woyinetike daalixxa gumma yokiin gummatixxa quncenna midde ittoqe'e.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />«‹Ifi gargar foyeexxi wereegeexxa yanna duuchcha haado umo isika tuqqoqe'e; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ifi gargar foyemmaxxi yanna muuxendaa qico'n woyyichchake kadowwaal umokanna nossedhowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Ifi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a gargar foyemmaxxe yanna duuchcha'n renshiibaa shiqoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />Ifi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a gargar foyatik beesis ifike umike ordichcho'n hedhemmaxxee isik anni yookaan ama, dayyi isik yookaan dayyo rertoole rensha insa'neeka tuqeexxi ifi battoossoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Isi ifi gargar foyeexxe yanna duuchcha'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a woyyichchaken.<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />« ‹Dedhange'ni manji mitti isi bira reyeexxi isi gargar foyememmaka umo ifika battoossoole seeriinxe aadashsha luqqi hiyyammaxxe torbeessoxxe barra'n ifikr umika ordichcho haaxxowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Saddeettixxe bara'n isi guugeenjo yookaan lame guuggenna yookaan lame bejjo'o aadheexxi afenshatike duunkaanixxe huddumme edo qeesichchinba dagowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Qeesichchikinna mitte cubbotike tolchi'a, helxenee ciincatik tolchi'a shiqishati, Naazirchi renshii bira shiqati ifi battoossemmaxxa cubbo biraan; Naazirchikinna eettenneenni barra ifike umike ordichcho woyyonsaan. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />Isinna ifi gargar foyemmaxxa yanna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a woyyonsaan; mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruussanna balleesatike tolchixxee iyyedaguun. Konnechchi edo Naazirummatixxe yanna'n batto'eemmaxxe'e iti yanna isi'a laakko'endabaan.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />« ‹Mitti Naazirichchi ifi gargar foyemmaxxi yanna muuxxendaa woddik seeri konnechchi butta hedheen: isi afenshatike duunkaanixxe hudummebaa dageexxi, <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />ookko Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwa shiqishuun; kunninna ciincatike tolchi'a mitte woggaka faya afebaaka gedhebiinka buruusa, cubbotike tolchi'a mitte woggaxxa faya afebaaxxa gedhebiinxa beltanjo ittanni mittummatike tolchi'a fafayyaka gedhebiinka korbeesa shiqisha'n, <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />konneerinni welti ifi ifike midhatke tolchinni weltininna ifi ifike ha'watike tolchinni welti mitteba, gamami e'yebaaxxe bullexxa mitte masoobe kebbo tinninna zayiteti qushshendee shaqqiteexxe bulleka xaltuwwanna raxxeexxe zayite hana buurendeeka hephphaka xalta iyyedagowaal.<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />« ‹Qeesichchikinna konneechchuwwa duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo cubbotike tolchi'anna ciincatike tolchi'a shiqishuun. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Gedhebiinka korbeesanna mittummatike tolchi'a masoobe giddo hexxeexxa gamami e'yebaaxxe bullexxe kebbonni iittanni midhatikenna ha'watike tolchinn welti Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishuun. <verse eid="NUM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />Ookkonechchi uduma Naarichchi weerregeexxi ifi gargar foyemmaka ifike umika ordichcho afenshatike duunkaanixxe huddume edo haaxxeexxi mittummatike tolchi hunda ha'yita'neexxe gira giddo ugguun.<verse eid="NUM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />« ‹Naazirichchikinna weregeexxi ifi gargar foyemmaka ifike umika ordichcho haaxxeechchi udumi dare qeesichchi gafemeeka gedhebiinke korbeessika hayenna masoobe giddi'n gamami e'yebaaxxe bullexxa kebbonna mitte hephphaka xalta aadheexxi Naazirichchoke'n anga abidaashsha assuun. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Ookkoneechchi uduma qeesichchi konnechchuwwa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a edo dolsatika tolcha asse shiqishuun. Kunni dolsemeek hayinna shiqqeexxi corme woyyichcha qeesichiinke qoobbo kaddaan. Ookkoneechchi uduma Naazirichchi woyinetixxa booka ha'wa dande'aan.<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />« ‹Yooni kunni werreega muuxo'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a werreegeeke Naazirichike seeran; yaane kinni mitti Naazirichchi Naazirummatee dande'eexxi uwwaaxxe yaane iimi darre Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwo'a werregeexxa yaane Naazirumma ifixxee weregeemmahshanni kada hassissaan. Naazirummatike seerishshanni werreegeeka werreega muuxowwaal.› »<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeesooletixxa Eebba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />«Aarooninna isixxi labbaxxi oose, ‹Isira'eelito eebbissinaa wodda hitinaa qici:<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />« ‹Duuchchi woddike Gootti atee eebbisoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:24">atee heqqoo;<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'a alba farri hiyyoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:25">ati'anna mararoo;<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti alba atibaa wirri hiyyoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:26">nage'a ifikanna ati'a uwwoo.› »<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />«Konnee qicinni summa anka ganna'n Isira'eelito eebinsoole aninna Isira'eelito eebbisannon.»<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Galdumiink Duunkaani Eebbisemeexxa Barra Shiqqeexxa Uwwuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Muuse Taabotiinke galdumiimika duunkaana ochcho bireechchi uduma duunikaanakanna isika mi'uwwa duuchcha hariireexxi woyyoonse. Iittanni tolchimalchokanna isika miuwwa duuchcha hariireexxi woyyoonse. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Ookkoneechchi uduma gosatike mini minike akeekisanjuwwa kadeexxi laakko'ememmakee umoke kadeeki Isira'eelik akeekisanjuwwi ifi ifike mini hadik akeekisanjuwwi ifi ifixxa uwwa shiqishe. <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />Insa'ne uwwa ifi ifixxa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo shiqinshe; tinninna jaane buqendeexxa jibooti hariksaaxxa garuwwanna tommenna lame jiboota, iitta hiyya mitti mitti akeeksanji mitte mitte jibichcha, iittanni lami lami akeekisanjuwwi mitte mitte jiboti harkisaaka sarageella Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo shiqinshe. <verse eid="NUM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />«Afenshatike duunkaanixxe ergatensha'n hosso'a konnee mi'a insa'nenaa'n aaxxetexxi ergatenshatixxe huje'a hanseexxe qixxe'n mitte mitte Leewwito'n uwwi.» <verse eid="NUM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Tennexxee Muuse eettenee jibotinxa gaaruwwanna joboota aadheexxi Leewwitote'n uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Gershoonitotee insa'neexxe ergatensha'a hasiseexxe qexxe'n lame jobootiinxa gaaruwwanna shoole jiboota uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />Meraaritotee insa'neexxe ergatensha'a hasisseexxe qixxe'n shoole jibootiinxa gaaruwwanna saddeeta jiboota uwwe. Insa'ne duuchchiing ergatema'emmaki Aarooni qeesichchinka belto Itamaarixxe akeette hundamman. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Yaane kinni Qe'aatito uuddaaxxi ergatensha woyyichcha mi'a dukate kaddemmaxxee Muuse insa'ne'a jibootiinka serageelluwwanna kaddo'o jibootanna uwwebaan.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Akeekisanjuwwi tolchimalchi hariiremeeke ayyaanixxe eebba'a kaddeexxa barra uwwa iyyedange tolchimalchi edo shiqinshe. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse, «Sooreessuwwi tolchimalchi hariiremeeke ayyaanixxe eebba'a barra barra'inni mitti mitti uwwa ifixxa iyyedagowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Siretixxe bara'n ifixxa uwwa shiqiseek Yihudake gosati mininaa'n Aminaadaabike belto Ne'asoonite, <verse eid="NUM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushendeexxa shaqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte biretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa killo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi biretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqeti giissemee mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />cincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruussuwwamman. Yoona Aminaadaabik belti Ne'asooni shiqisheemmaxxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Langaxxe barra'n Yisaakoorik akeekisanji Tsi'aarik belti Naatina'eeli ifixxa uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="NUM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa killo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxa worqeti giisseexxi mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeesanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwamman. Yoona Tsi'aarik belti Naatina'eeli shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Sakkaxxe barra'n madadanga shiqisheek Zabilonik gosak ardinaa'ni Helonike labbake belto Eli'aabitemman. <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa killo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqet giisendeexxa mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />iittanni mittummatike tolchia'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwamman. Yoona Helonik belti Eli'aaabi shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Sholgaxxe barra'n Roobelike ardik akeekisanji Sediyoorik belti Elitsuuri ifixxa uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa killo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqeti giisendeexxa mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeesanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwaman. Yoona Sediyoorik belti Elitsuuri shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Ondixxe barra'n Simoonike ardik akeekisanji Suurisedayik belti Selemi'eeli ifixxa uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="NUM 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa kiilo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqeti giissendeexxa mooqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeesanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />iittanni mittumatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwamman. Yoona Suurisedayik belti Selemi'eeli shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Jiyeessoxxe barra'n Gaadike ardik akeekisanji Raagu'elik belti Elisaafi ifixxa uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa kiilo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqeti giisendeexxa mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeesanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwamman. Yoona Raagu'elik belti Elisaafi shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Torbeesoxxe barra'n Efireemike ardik akeekisanji Amihuudik belti Elishaama'i ifixxa uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa kiilo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqeti giisendeexxa mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwamman. Yoona Amihuudik belti Elishaama shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Saddeeteessoxxe barra'n Minaaseke ardik akeekisanji Fidesuurik belti Gema'li'eeli ifixxa uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa kiilo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqeti giisendeexxa mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwamman. Yoona Fidesuurk belti Gema'li'eeli shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Salleessoxxe barra'n Biiniyaamike ardik akeekisanji Geedeyoonik belti Abidaani ifixxa uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa kiolo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqeti giisendeexxa mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwamman. Yoona Geedeyoonik belti Abidaani shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Tommeessoxxe barra'n Daanike ardik akeekisanji Amisadayik belti Ahi'eezer ifixxa uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa kiilo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqeti giissendeexxa mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwaman. Yoona Amisadayik belti Ahi'eezer shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Tommenna taakkeessoxxe barra'n Aseerike ardik akeekisanji Ekiraanik belti Faagi'eeli ifixxa uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchi'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa kiilo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa woriqeti giissendeexxa mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeesanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwamman. Yoona Ekiraanik belti Faagi'eeli shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Tommenna langaxxe barra'n Nefitaalemike ardik akeekisanji Enaanik belti Ahiira'i ifixxa uwwa iyyedage; <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />isixxi uwwa midhatike tolchia'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa wo'ma wo'ma qore bulle, mitte birretike sibljixxi qore woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe aadashsha mittekanna gamisa kiilo ha'urtaaxxa, langaxxi birretike sibiljixxi hubbuqqitte qore saddeeta dhibba giraama ha'urtaaxxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />dhibbanna tomme giraama ha'urtaaxxa worqeti giissendeexxa mooqqo wo'ma hixaana; <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />ciincatike tolchi'a mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeesanna, mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa; <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco; <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />iittanni mittummatike tolchi'a lame qotile, onde gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, onde re'etixxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka onde gedhebiinka buruusuwwamman. Yoona Enaanik belti Ahiira'i shiqisheexxi uwwa tennetemman.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Tolchimalchi hariireemeexxa barra shiqisheexxi uwwa: tommea lame birreti sibiljinni hujendeexxa ba'laxxa qoruwwa, tommenna lame birreti sibljinni hujendeexxa hubbuqqitte qoruwwa, tommenna lame worqeti hujendeexxa hixaani uggemaaxxa mooqquwwa. <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Mitte mittinde birret siblijinni hujendeexxi ba'laxxi qoruwwa mittena gamisa kiilo, mitte mittend birreti sibiljinni hujendeexxi hubbuqqitte qoruwwa saddeeta dhibba giraama, mitteba birreti sibiljinni hujendeexxi qoruwak ha'uri woyyitte bakkaxxe kiilo'n lame tommenna saddeeta kiilon. <verse eid="NUM 7:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Tommenna lame worqeti hujendeexxi hixxani uggemaaxxi mitte mittende mooqquwwak ha'urri woyyitte bakkaxxe kiilo'n dhibbanna tomme giraama kaddaa wodda duuchchiinxi mitteba mittenna gamisa kiilo qico'n. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Ciincatike tolchi'a ifi ifike midhatike tolchinni welti shiqeek hori mittenba tommenna lame jiboota, tommenna lame gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, mitte woggaxxa tomenna lame gedhebiinka buruusa; tomenna lame re'etixxa korbeeyye cubbotike tolchi'a shiqqe. <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />Mittoomiinke tolchi'a shiqeeke hork laakkosi lame tommenna shoole jiboota, jaane tomme gedhebiinxi korbeeyye, jaane tomme re'etixxi korbeeyya, mitte woggak jaane tomme gedhebiinka buruusa, tolchimalchi hariireeme woyyoomee uduma tolchakee shiqqeexxi uwwa tenneerateman.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Muuse Duuchchi Woddike Goottinn welti haaso'ate'e afenshatike duunkaan giddi'a e'yee wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti lame kurubeelixxe oddo'n kakotike Taabotik cubbo biratike tuphanji iimi darree'n iso'n haaso'aa'naa laqe. Isinne welti haaso'e.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Torbaane Dhankoke Xassika Offo'lsanjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyee qic, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />«Aarooni ookkonee torbaane xassuwwa dhankotike offo'lisanji hana uggaa wodda ifi ookkone offo'lisanji edi darre'n ifaashsha asseexxi uggo'a kuli.» <verse eid="NUM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Aarooninna hiyyeendeshshanni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse ajajemmashshanni xassuwwi dhankotike ofo'lissanji hana hedheexxi ookkone xasike offo'lisanji edi darri'a xabaashsha asse ugge. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Dhankotike xassik offo'lisanji giisemeema qici Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'n kulema qicinnite kadda wodda isike uurrsanjinaa'ni isike daraaruwwi qico'n duuchchingechchi giisemeemak tumendeexxe worqenitemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Fula. 25:31-40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 37:17-24">37:17-24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leewwito Erganshatee Foyendeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />«Leewwito Isira'eelitoti giddii'n gargar footettexxi seeriinxe aadashsha insa'nee luqqi assi. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Insa'ne luqqi hinaashsha assitatto qici luqqi assatiks wode'e insa'ne'n fifixi; biso insa'neeke'n hexxeexxa orda duuchcha haxxineexxi seemmatanna anshe'ne ca'a hinowaal. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma midhatika tolcha zayiteni qushshendeexxi shaqqaxxa bulle mitte jibichchinni welti aa'nowwaal; atinna cubbotike tolchi'a kadaaka wele jibichcha aaxxatton. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduuma Leewwito afenshatike duukaani edo uurrittashsha assitettexxi Isira'eelika arda duuchchanna bukki assi. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Leewwitotanna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo shiqise'na'a Isira'eelik ardinna anga ifixxa insa'ne umi hana uggowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Aarooni Leewwito Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ergatendo'a qophpho'aashsha Isira'eelike ardi giddii'n insa'nee Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo dolsatixxe uwwashsha shiqishuun.<verse eid="NUM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />«Leewwito anga ifixxa jibichchuwwi hana uggiteechchi uduma mitte Leewwitotixxa cubbo biratike tolcha kadaashsha holqonee cincatike tolcha kadaashsha Duuchchi Woddike Goottia'a shiqishi.<verse eid="NUM 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />«Leewwito Aarooni edonna isixxe labbaxxe oose eddo uurrissettexxi dolsatike tolchisha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishi. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Konnee qicinni Leewwito Isira'eelike ardi giddii'n ani'a gargar foyi; insa'nenna anke kandaan.<verse eid="NUM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />«Leewwito ca'a assite'e dolsatike tochishsha shiqisettechchi uduma ergatemmo'a afenshatik duunkaani giddo e'yinaan. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Anke kandaashsha insa'ne ani'a uwwendeexxe Isira'eeliton; heene meyyaxxe Isira'eelichchonaa'n ilemaake labbake angafixxa bado ani insa'nee ifi'a adhdheennen. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Manjokenaa'ni kado horekenaa'ni Isira'eeli giddo ileemeek labbak angafi duuchchi anken; Gibtseke bogi giddo hedheemmake hori manjika angafa shiyeenna wodda ani Isira'eelike hori manjik labbak angafi, anke kadaashsha foyeennen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Fula. 13:2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Isira'eeli giddo ilemeeke labbake angaffuwwixxa badonna Leewwito adhdheennen. <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />Isira'eelike ardixxe tukke kandeexxi afenshatike duunkaani giddixxa ergatensha ergatemmo'anna Isira'eelito woyyitte bakka'ni shiqiyyoti ba'neti gannendebaashsha cubbo insa'ne'a birro'a Leewwito Isira'eelitotixxe uwwaashsha aadhenexxi Aarooni'anna isixxe labbaxxe oose'a insa'nee uwwe'eennen.» <verse eid="NUM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Muusee Aarooninna Isira'eelik ardi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse ajajemmashshanni Leewwitote assine. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Leewwito ifi luqqi assexxeexxi seemmatanna anshexxe; ookkoneechchi uduma Aarooni insa'ne'e dolsatike tolchishsha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo shiqishe; luqqi hino'aanna cubbo insa'neexxa bire. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Ookkonechchi uduma Leewwito Aaroonixxenna isixxe labbaxxe oosexxe akeette hunda heexxeexxi afenshatike duunkaani giddixxa ergatensha ergatendo'a e'yite; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse Leewwitotixxee ajajemmashshanni ardi duuchinxa asse.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />«Lame tommenna onde woggakinna eettene wogga iimi darrek Leewwitotiki labballi afenshatike duunkaani giddo ergatemo'a dagaan; <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />yaane kinni onde tomme wogga wo'maa wodda ergateemammaxxa huje walaan; langaxxa hujabaan. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma ifika dayyuwwa Leewwito afenshatike duunkaanixxa ergatensha qarqaara malee insa'ne umo ifike callin mittechchonna huja hassissabaan; kunni Leewwito ergatendo'a ergatenshatika seera abidissatto qicon.»<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Langaka Sa'atika Ayyaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />Gibtseke boganaa'n fulleexxe langaxxe woggake takkeessoke agenjo'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Siinaxxe qilla gammoojje giddo Muuse'n hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />«Isira'eelik ardi sa'atika ayyaana eettene murtesendeexxe yanna'n ulfeesowwaal; <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Ayyaanakanna konne agenjixxe tommenna shoolgeessoxxe barra'n arishsho e'yitammaxxa yanna konne ayyaanike seerishshanna aadashshanni muxemowwaal» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Tennexxee Muuse sa'atika ayyaana ulfesaashsha ardake'n kule. <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />Insa'nenna siretike agenjixxe tommenna shoolgeessoxxe baraa'n arishsho e'yitammaxxa yanna Siinaxxe qiilla gammoojje giddo sa'atika ayyaana ulfeessine; Isira'eelito Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'n ajajemmashshanni duuchchiinxa assitte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-13">Fula. 12:1-13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Yaane kinni mitti mitti manni rensha tuqatenaa'n kexxeexxinni konne ayyaanike seersha batto'eeke kadeemmaxxee eettene barra'n sa'atika ayyaana ulfeesa dande'abaan; tennexxee kunni manni ettenee barra Muusebaanna Aaroonibaa dageexxi hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />«No'o rensha tuqatenaa'n kexxeexxa battooneennen; yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddike Goottika tolcha mayeeteta wele Isira'eelike manninni welti eettene murteesendeexxe yanna'n shiqinshabe'noshsha hoyyemaannek?»<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Muusenna insa'ne'e, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'no'o uuddaaxxenni uwwaaka ajaja laqanno qico'n egerre» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />«Isira'eelito hitatto qici: ‹Ha'nonaa'n yookaan ha'nooxxe hortenaa'n huuni manjinna rensha tuqati batto'oole yookaan bayyi ora me'eexxe kaddoole Duuchchi Woddike Goottika sa'atika ayyaana ulfeessa dande'aan; <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />Tinninna langak agenjixxe tommenna shoolgeessoxxe barra'n arishsho e'yitammaxxe yanna'n ulfeessinuun; sa'atike ayyaanika korbeessanna gamami e'yebaaxxe bullexxe kebbonninna qaraaraake shafinni welti induun. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Sooda qico'n eettene itanaa'n mittichchonna gatinsoqe'e; ookkone korbeessixxe miqenaa'ninna mittetanna enqinoqe'e; sa'atika ayyaana ulfeessinaa wodda isike seerishshanna isixxe aadashsha ulfeessinowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Fula. 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:36">Yoh. 19:36</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Yaane kinni manji mitti batto'ebaang yookaan ora bayya me'ebaang sa'atika ayyaana ulfesebaang gatoole murteesendeexxe yanna'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolcha shiqisha gopheemmaxxee iikki manji anke ardi giddi'n gargar uudemaan; iikki manji ifixxe cubboka hiranna adhdhaan.<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />« ‹Ha'noo giddo hedheek alagi manji Duuchchi Woddike Goottika sa'atika ayyaana ulfeessa hasoole sa'atike ayyaanika seeranna aadda isi muuxa hassissaan; bogiinke manji'anna kado'o alagakee kunni seeri mittengen.› »<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taabotiinke Galdumi Iimi Darre Hedhemmaka Duumancha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Fula. 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Taabotiink galdumi otemeexxa barra duumanchi afenshatika duunkaana buqe; galgalinaa'n sooda qico'n Taabotiinka galduma buqeemmak duumanchi giira laba'nemman. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Tinni konnee qicinni iitta kadda'n me'ite; duumanchi Taabotiinka galduma buqe; hashshanna giiratixxe bifa afeemman. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Duumanchi duunkaanakenaa'n ke'aaxxe yanna duuchcha'n Isira'eelito me'a saffa'emman; Duumanchi urreexxe bakka duuchcha'ninna Isira'eelito kaanbe abixxitee ofolda'nemman. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajajinni Isira'eelik ardi ke'e me'a'nemman; isike ajajininna me'a waale afo'la'nemman; duumanchi duunkaani iima turaaxxe yanna duuchcha'n insa'nee ookkone ofolleenge olla'i giddo turra'nemman. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Duumanchi duunkaani iima heddo barra turoolenna Isira'eelik ardi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajaja heqedhaama malee ke'exxi me'aammabaan. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Mitte mitte yanna duumanchi heenoxxe barra calla duunkaani iima tura'nemman; eettene yannanna insa'ne Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajajinni ke'ne me'inaan; isike ajajinninna me'a waalle afollaan. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Mitte mitte yanna kinni duumanchi galgalinaa'n gorsi qico calla'n tura'emman; duumanchi gorsa ke'aaxxe yannanna me'a ke'naan; barrate kaddo'a hashsha duumanchi ke'oole ke'nee me'inaan. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Duumanchi duunkaani iima lame barranna kaddo agenjoke, yookaan qeerraxxa yanna turoole Isira'eelik ardi ofo'leemanxe kaanbe'n turaa malee ke'e me'aamabaan. Duumanchi seematik dunkaanakenaa'ni ke'aa wodda insa'ne ke'ne me'inaaman. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajajinni Isira'eelik ardi ke'ee me'a'nemman; isike ajajinninna me'a waale afo'la'nemman; Insa'nenna Muuse darree'n uwwemeemmaka Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajajuwwa heqe'naamman.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s1">Birretike Sibiljika Malagatuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti Muuse, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />«Tumendeexxe birreke sibiljika lame malagata giissi; isoonna arda mitteba bukki assateenna olla'akenaa'n ke'e me'aashsha assatee la'oonfati. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Lamiingi malagati ufuufemaa wodda ardi duuchchi ati edo afenshatike duunkaanixxe huddume'n bukki hiyyuun. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Mitti malagati calli ufuufema wodda kinni Isira'eelike gosatike minik akeekisanjuwi calli ati edo bukki hiyyuun. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Malagati gikkichchi hafuurinni ufuufemaa wodda kaanbe giddo boroti darre'n offo'leemmak gosatike minuwwik ardi ke'e me'uun. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Malagati langaxxa gikkichchi hafuurinni ufuufemaa wodda kaanbe giddo bita'i darre'n offo'leemmak gosatike minuwwik ardi me'a ke'uun; gikkichchi hafuuri me'a ka'atike beessisan. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Orga bukki assatee malagatuwwi ufuufemowwaal; yaane kinni gikkichchi hafuurinnite kaddoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />Ookkonee malagata qeesichcho Aaroonixxi labbaxxi oose ufuffuun; tinni ha'no'anna daggaaxxe ha'nooxxe ila'a duuchchi woddixxe aada kadduun.<verse eid="NUM 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />«Ha'nonge bogi giddo ha'no'o lolo'a dagaake naapha'n duuldina wodda malagatuwwa gikki assitine ufuuffe; ookkonee wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'no'o qaabbataan, naaphakenaa'ninna ha'no'o anjiraan. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Iittanni ha'noke gammashshotike ayyaanuwwi woda, tinninna ha'nooke murteesemeeke ayyaanuwwanna haaroke agenjixxe e'yaka ha'nooka ayyaanuwwa ulfeessitinaa wodda, ha'nooke ciincatike tolchuwwi woddanna ha'nooke mittummatike tolchuwwi wodda malagata ufuuffe; isinna ha'nooke Mageni edo ha'no'a qallite kadaan; ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Magenon.»<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelik Ardi Siina'ni Ke'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Langaxxe woggake langeessoke agenjixxe lame tomme barra'n duumanchi Taabotiinke galduminaa'n ke'e. <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Ookkoneechchi udama Isira'eelik ardi duumanchi Faraanixxe qiilla gammoojje'n dage uurraa qico'n Siinaxxe qiilla gammoojjenaa'n ke'e me'e.<verse eid="NUM 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Insa'nenna taakkaxxe yanna'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse ajajemashsha ke'ne me'ine. <verse eid="NUM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Yihudaxxe kaambek qorbi ifi ifike baandiri hunda hedheexxi taakkaba me'e; insa'neeki akeekisanjinna Aminaadaabike belto Ne'asoonitemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Yisaakoorike gosati minik akeekisanjinna Tsi'aarike belto Naatina'eelitemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />Iittanni Zabilonike gosati miniki qorbik akeekisanjinna Helonike belto Eli'aabitemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Taabotiink galdumik duunkaani gosheme'naa Gershoonitotinna Meraarito dukke kexxe me'ite.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Itti aaneexxi Roobelixxe kaanbeke bandiri hunda hedhemmak qorb me'e; insa'neek sooreessinna Sediyoorike belto Elitsuurtemmani. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Simoonixxe gosati miniki sooreessi Suurisedayike belto Selemi'eelitemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Iittanni Gaadixxe gosati minik sooreessi Raagu'elike belto Elisaafitemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Qe'aatito woyyichcha mi'a dukkeexxi me'ite; insa'nee marre genneebaa ediga'ma Taabotiink galdum otema'emman.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Itti aaneexxi Efireemixxe kaambeki qorbike baandir hunda hedhemmak me'e; insa'neek akeekisanjinna Amihuudik belto Elishaama'itemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Iittanni Minaaseke gosati minik akeekisanji Fidasuurike belto Gemali'eelitemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Biiniyaamike gosati minike ardik sooreessi Gadiyoonike belto Abidaanitemman.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Udu'meexxi Daanixxe kaambek qorbi ifi ifike baandir hunda duuchchinge qorbuwwi'a udumi'n kiphake kadeexxi me'e; insa'neek akeekisanjinna Amisadayike belto Ahi'eezertemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Iittanni Aseerike gosati minik sooreessi Ekiranaanike belto Faagi'eelitemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Nefitaalemike gosati minik sooreessinna Enaanike belto Ahiira'itemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Yoona Isira'eelito qorbi qorbinni kaanbe giddii'n fuldeexxi googessik me'itaamma qici iittatemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Eettenne yaana Muuse ifixxe areka anna Midiyaamichcho Raagu'eelika belto Hobaabii'i, «Kunse, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti, ‹Ha'noo'a uwwannon› hiyyemmake bogiba'a me'a ke'neennen; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeli'a eloxxa yaane asso'a addachchiiseemmaxxe atinna no'onni welti me'i; no'onna ati'a eloxxe yaane assinannon» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Isinna hiisseexxi, «Waawwo'o me'abe'no; ani anke bogiba'anna anke firibaa illeema higee me'anon» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Muusenna isoo, «Ballo no'oonaa'n meenni gargar higi; qiilla gammoojje giddo haba kaanbe olta hassissaaxxa egendeetaxxee no'o'anna ille no'oxxe kaddatton. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Ati no'onni welti silaan daggettele, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'o'a assaaxxe elolla yaanerinaa'n no'onna ati'anna qoondannon.»<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe koobanaa'n ke'neexxi sase barraka ora me'ine; Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Kakotik Taaboti tennee sase barra giddo insa'ne'e hafuura adhdhinaaka booncho hasitto insa'ne edii'ni me'a'nemman. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Kaanbe giddii'n fulle me'inaa wodda Duuchchi Woddike Goottik duumanchi barra insa'ne iimii'n hedhemman.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Kakotik Taabboti kaanbe giddii'n ke'e meexxa yanna duuchcha'n Muuse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:35">«Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa Ke'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">naaphi atiki feshshi hiyyuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">atee gibaak duuchchinna ati edii'n baajowwaal» hiyya'nemman.<verse eid="NUM 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Insa'nenna Kakoti Taabboti me'a waaleexxi uuraaxxa yanna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:36">«Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:36">Heddo kumike mine'n laakko'ema'neeke atike Isira'eelike ardibaa ille iima higi» hiyya'neemman.<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa'n Dirriteexxa Giira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Eettene yanna Isira'eelik ardi insa'ne'n gelteexxe rakkonaa'n kexxeexxa Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n adhdhemme; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna adhdhuma insa'nexxa laqeexxi yo'oshsha mufate; ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi giira oddo insa'nexxe'n bubbeexxi kaanbeetika kasa heenoka itte. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Ardikinna Muusebaa raare; Muusenna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodate'na'a giiratinna xoxxe. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi giira oddo insa'nexxe'n bubbemaxxee eettene bakkak summi Tebeera, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tebera hiyya Ibrititotike laagadinni giira bubbeen hiyyatishate. </char></note>hiyyeme.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelike Ardi'a Uwweexxa Gogorre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Isira'eelike aridinni welti me'aammak alagi manni wele ita ito'a heene. Isira'eelik ardinna «Maala habaa'n alfine'e indunnu; <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Gibtse he'neenaa wodda mitte hirbelo hansenne qico qulxu'me indaanaxxa qaabbantaannen; ookko'o he'nenne wodda indaannachchi baaqula, oyyuu baaqula, diimmoxxa shunkurtenna qullubbe qalli hinaannen. <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Ta'a kinni ita no'oo cufeen; konne menna hiyyema'neechcho malee wele ita illet anfaabe'non.»<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Menni dinbilaaletixxe gummashsha shiixxoke kadeexxi muucciinsha baaxxotixxe bifa afe'emman. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Ardikinna mammareme qocedhee daammake'n da'wa'n yookaan mooyyeke'n tu'meechchi uduma meshete'n galifa'nemman yookaan ra'isedha'nemman; xe'me isixxinna ejersiinxe zayitenni qushshendeexxe kebboshshatemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:31">Fula. 16:31</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Hashsha kaanbe giddo qorri ibaa wodda mennikinna iittanni iba'nemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:13-15">Fula. 16:13-15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Muuse ardi duuchchi ifi ifike mini mini hadi ifi fike duunkaanixxe huddume'n hedheexxi oodhaa'na'a laqe. Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna lumoo qica mufate; Muusenna yo'oshsha wixxirri hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Muusenna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta, «Iitta hexxeexxa tennee rakko anee garbichcho atike'n mayee'e iyyedaggette? Maa ate'e qoxxi assannalete konne ardi duuchchixxa ko'o ane'n ba'issettek? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Ba'anjo manjichcho laatto anno hanqalfite luu'mexxammashsha konnee arda anga hanqalfennexxi edike insa'neeke annuwwi'a uutota'a addachchiissetteke boga'n geessissonnaa ane'n kuldaattechchi mayeete? Konne arda isi ante siila'wenne? Yookaan ante ilenne? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Konne ardi duuchchi'a maala habaa'n aadhanno? Duuchching, ‹Indonna'a maala uwwi› hiyya'n ane'n oodha'neen. <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />Konne ardi duuchchixxa ko'o ani calli dande'e fulchabe'non; ane'n yo'oshsha ha'urtaan. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Tinni rakko ane'n geltaashsha assitetexxi mannii'n ate'n elle alfo'onnole konnee abara uudabe'noshsha ta'anni anee shiyi.»<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse'e hiyyee qici: «Arda akkeekatixxanna ajajatixxa dande'a affeexxa egendettexxa Isira'eelike ardixxa torbaane tomme geedhe ani'a iyyedagi; insa'nenna atinni welti uurrino'a afenshatike duunkaani edo dangaashsha assi. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Aninna dirrennexxi ookko atinni welti haaso'annon; ate'n hedheeke Hafuurinaa'ninna aadhennexxi insa'ne'n uggurannon; ardiinxa ko'o ati calli ba'exxabexxoshsha insa'ne atee qarqarraan.<verse eid="NUM 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />«Ardake'n: ‹Soodo maala ittina'emmaxxee ifi woyyoonsati qophpheefatte; «Maala calla alfine indenele! Gibtse he'nannaxxa wodo!» Hitina'n ooxxineexxa oodhishsha Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti laqeedheen; tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti maala ha'no'a uwwa uwwaan, ha'nonna maala ittinaan. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Iitinaakinna, mitte barra calla yookaan lame barra, yookaan onde, yookaan tomme yookaan lame tomme barra callabaan; <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />Yaane kinni ha'nooxxe sanonaa'n fuleexxi ha'noo dingidingi assaa qico'n wo'ma agenjo duuchcha ittinaan; tinni kaddaachchi oddo ha'nooxxe'n hedheeka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta tuffattineemmaxxeenna Gibtsee'n fula gonphuunnatu hitina'n ooxxinemmaxxeeten.› »<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Muuse kinni hiyyee qici, «Kunse ani jaane dhibba kuma lekkatike manninni welti hedhennen; atik kinni, ‹Wo'ma agenjo indaaka maala insa'ne'a uwwannon› hiteetten. <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Lali gedhebiink me'i horta duleme insa'nee goddisa? Abbaayya giddo hexxeexxi qulxu'me duuchcha abidendeechcho kaddeelenna insa'nee geltaata?»<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse «Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi anga isi harumaxxee? Ate'n kulennek ank hiyyichchi dhugo'aaxxanna dhugo'abaaxxa ta'a tennee uuddaton» hiyye hisse haaso'e.<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Tennexxee Muusenna gadhi'a fuleexxi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyeexxa duuchcha ardake'n haaso'e. Ardiinxe geedhe giddii'ninna torbaane tomme manna mitteba bukki asseexxi duunkaanixxe dowwe'n uurrinaashsha asse. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti duumanchik dirre isinni haaso'eexxi Muuse'n hedhemmake Hafuurnaa'n aadheexxi eettenne torbaane tomme geedhe'n uggure; Hafuurkinna insa'ne'n galee wodda insa'nenna raaga raange; kaddo malee kinni ookkoneechchi uduma langaxxa raangeba'a.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Insa'ne giddii'n Eldaadinna Modaadi hiyyemaak lami manni kaanbe giddo gate'emman; kunni lami manni torbaane tomme manninni laakko'emmeenni hedheexxi duunkaani giddo mareemmabaan; kaddo malee Hafuur insa'ne'ninna galeemmaxxee insa'nenna he'neemaba kaanbe giddo raaga raange. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Mitti dargaggees gonga'n mareexxi Muuse'n, «Eldaadinna Modaadi kaanbe giddo raaga raanga'neen» hiyye kule.<verse eid="NUM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Dargaggeesumandenaa'ninni Muuseke gargaaranjo kade'emak Newek belti Iyyaasu, «Koo anke gootta Muusee! Haassonnabaashsha hoyyi!» Hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Muusenna «Ati ani'a quuqendette? Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki ardi duuchchii silaa wabeeko kadeele, Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Hafuura ifika insa'ne'n uggeele hittatta gammadanna'a!» Hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muusenna Isira'eelixxi geedhe kaambe giddi'a ille iima hinge.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Eettene yanna diidallo Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa'n daggeexxi gogoretishsha hexxeexxa ci'a abbaayyatenaa'n kaambetibaa iyyedagge'e kaanbetixxe dowwe'n buttii'n iimi'a lame ciqile, bayyinekanna mitte barraki ori bayyataa qico duuchcha'n tuulde. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Eettenne barranna hashsha duuchcha langaxxa wo'ma barra ardi fuleexxi tenne gogorretishsha hexxeexxa ci'a gudhdhe; mitti manjinna ha'urre tomme tomme kiilograaminni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotike lagadanni mitte homer 220 liitiren,</char></note>butti'a hexxeexxa gudhdheek ayyinna hedhemmabaan; gudhdheek manninna tennee ci'a ifixxe baxxe baxxeke qarqara'ni fa'we. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Yaane kinni maali reefi insa'nexxe isso giddo hedhenaann corqine liqiinsinebaang Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi mufe ardake'n bubbe; isinna arda jabake dhukkubinni gane. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Wele ita heenemmaka manna ookko moongemaxxee eettenne bakka summl «Heenatike Hirreessa» hiyyeme.<verse eid="NUM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Ardikinna Heenatike Hirreesibaa'n me'eexxi Hatserooti hiyyemaaba ookko offo'le.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Maariyaaminna Aarooni Muuse'n Ke'ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Muuse Tophphiyichcho manjichcho aadhe'emmani, tenne aadheemmaxxe manjichchoxxe buuto'a Maariyaaminna Aarooni Muusee kometen ke'ne. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />Insa'nenna «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti haaso'eek Muuse darree'ni calla? No'o darree'n haaso'ebaa?» Hine. Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna teennee laqe. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Muuse butta duuchcha'n hedheeke manni duuchchi caala hara shaqqakemman.<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Dedhange'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muusee, Aarooniinna Maaryaamii'i, «Ha'no sasiing fuldineexxi afenshatike duunkaanbaa amme» hiyye; insa'ne'nna fulle marre. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti duumanichiinke utuphinni dirreexxi afenshatike duunkaanixxe huddumme'n uurrati Aarooniinna Maaryaamii'i ye'e; lamiing isibaa dangee wodda, <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Isinna insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Hiyyichcho anka caqase:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:6">«Duuchchi Woddike Goottik wabeek ha'noo giddo hedheele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">waleellati iso'ni ifisannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:6">Oojjotinna iso'ni haaso'annon.<verse eid="NUM 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Erganjo anke Muusenni kinni haaso'annok iittatebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:7">isi anke mine duuchcha'ni xuurameesaken.<verse eid="NUM 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Ani erganjo anke Muusenni welti haaso'annok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">iittatebaan isi anke mine duuchcha'ni xuurameesaken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:8">Isi anee'e Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa bifa uudaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">ha'nota erganjo anke Muuse'n affo'o fulchedha hitta shooka gophphine?»<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna insa'ne'n mufateexxi insa'nee waale me'e.<verse eid="NUM 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Duumanchi duunkaani iimii'n ke'eexxa yanna kunse Maariyaami soomottee bisokanna kaadetishsha gola'liteemman; Aarooninna isebaa wirri hiyye uuda wodda Maariyaami soomotee'naa afe. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Aarooninna Muusee, «Anke gootta gowwummati hunjennexxe cubboxxee maganneten no'oo mura woxxissoxxe'e. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Isenna amatinke godobi giddo lubbendeexxi bisi duuchchi iteme luggo'e shixxobi gateenaa ilendemmaxxe gufo labbeexxi gattaashsha assitoxxe'e.»<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Tennexxee Muusenna, «Magenoo! Maganneten isee fayyisi» hiyya'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a oodhe.<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse'e, «Anni isek midde hancufa alba iseke'n tufeechcho kaddelenna shooko odo'witeexxi torbaane barra qico turtaaxxemabaa? Tennexxee ta'atenna kaddoole kaambeti gadhi darre torbaane barra'a qofitti turtaashsha assi; ookkoneechchi uduma kinni ille iima higge dagguun» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:2-3">Lak. 5:2-3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Tennexxee Maaryaami kaambeti gadhi darre torbaane barra qofitti turte; ise illeema higgeexxi daggaa qico'n ardi ke'eexxi me'eemmabaan.<verse eid="NUM 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma ardi Hatserooti'n ke'eexxi Faaraanixxe qiilla gammoojje giddo mare offo'le.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kenaanik Bogixxa Dooyyema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Lan. 1:19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti Muuse'n, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />«Tommenna lame Isira'eelike gosati mini'a uwwaanneka boga dooyyo'a heenoka manna erg; duuchchinge gosati mininaa'n mitte mitte seereessa ergi» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Tennexxe Muuse Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajajajinni Faaraanixxe qiilla gammoojjenaa'n manna erge; kunni duuchching manni Isira'eelitotike akeekisanjuwwamman. <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Konne mannik summuwwinna konneechchi butta hedheeken: Roobelike gosati mininaa'n Zakkurika belto Samu'eelii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />Simoonike gosati mininaa'n Suureka belto Sefaaxii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />Yihudake gosati mininaa'n Yufoonika belto Kaalebii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />Yisakoorike gosati mininaa'n Yoosefika belto Yigi'aalii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />Efireemike gosati mininaa'n Neweka belto Hooshe'a. <verse eid="NUM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />Biiniyaamike gosati mininaa'n Raafuka belto Felxii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />Zabilonike gosati mininaa'n Sediika belto Gaadu'eelii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />Minaaseke gosati mininaa'n kunninna Yooseefike gosati mine hiyyaten, Suusika belto Gaadii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />Daanike Gosati mininaa'n Gemaalika belto Ami'eelii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />Aseerike gosati mininaa'n Mika'eelika belto Setuurii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />Nefitaalemike gosati mininaa'n Yaabika belto Naabii'i; <verse eid="NUM 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />Gaadike gosati mininaa'n Maakika belto Ge'u'eeli'i. <verse eid="NUM 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Yoona boga dooyyo'a Muusee ergemmake mannik summi konneten; Muusenna Neweka belto Hooshe'a, «Iyyaasu» hiyye summa fulche.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Muusenna Kenaanika boga dooyyaashsha manna hiyyeexxi ergee qici, «Negeebi darree'n alalle qabatineexxi koobatike bogibaa me'we. <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />Bogi hitta hedheexxanna giddo hedheek manni hittee qico jabake yookaan shaqqake, heenoke yookaan heddateeke kadeexxa dooyye. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Insa'ne he'na'neek bogi hitta hedheeke? Eloke mo'o elobaake? Giddo hedha'neek qachchuwwina'a? Dalla'i beloke mo'o yookaan kollotike? <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Buttinita hitta hedheeke? Shaqqake mo'o bagoke? Gongomiike mo'o gongomi beloke? Dandeessissee qicinni ookkone bogixxa gumma aaxxine dagge;» yanna iittinna woyyine gumma reefi ra'issitaamaxxe yannaman.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Tennexxee manni alalle me'eexxi Tsiinxe qiilla gammoojje'n, Lebooni Hamaati darree'n Re'aabi qico'n calaqi hiyye me'ati boga dooyye. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Insa'nenna Negeebi giddii'n alalle fulleexxi Ahimaan, Seesinna Telaami hiyyendaaxxi Enaaqixxi hundaayyetixxi horte hexxeeba Kebirooni dange; Kebiroon ijaarendeek Gibtse giddik Zo'aarik qachchi ijaaremebaaxxe torbaane wogga edi darremman. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Insa'ne Eshikoolixxa dhooqa genneexxi ookkoo'n mitte daalo woyinetixxa rodde wonxe; lami manni tennee woyinetixxa rodde Roomanixxenna oddi'iinxe gummanni welti murgete'n leenxiseexxi dugumote'n duke. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Isira'eelik manni woyinetike daalxa rodde wonxemaxxa eettenne bakka Eshikoolixxe dhooqa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eshikool Ibrititotikenni woyinetixxe gummaxxa rodde hiyyaten.</char></note> hiyyeme summa fulche.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dooyya Fuleemmak Manni Iyydageexxa Odo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Iikki mannikinna boga dooyyeexxi shoole tomme barra uduma ille iima hige. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Iikki mannikinna Muuse Aarooninna Isira'eelik orgi hedhemmaba Faaraanixxe qiilla gammoojje giddo Qaadesi'a ille iima hige; uundeexxa duuchchanna insa'ne'ninna orga duuchcha'n haassonne; iyyedangemaxxa bogiinxa gummanna insa'ne'n leelinshe. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Mannikinna Muuse'n hiyye haaso'ee qici, «No'oo ergitetteke boga'n genee'e e'yine dooyyineennen; bogi malebi ado phu'isaaken; gumma isixxinna tenneten. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Yaane kinni ookkone boga'n hedheek manni jajjabbake; qachchuwi insa'nekirinna kollifatemeeke lumollamman; wele waalin Enaaqixxe horteka manna ookko anfenne. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Amaaleqik manni hedha'neebi Negeebi giddon; Hiititotik, Iyyaabusikinna Amoorak manni koobatike boga'n hedha'neen; Kenaanik manni kinni abbaayyatee shiqibanna qarqara Yordaanoosike lagike'n hedha'neen» hiyye kule.<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Ookkoneechhci uduma Kaalebi Muuse edo manni sammi hiyyaashsha asseexxi, «Marree boga insa'neeka dhaallannon; insa'nee injifantannoxxinna kokaken» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Yaane kinni isinni welti me'eemmak manni, «No'o caala jajjabbake kandemaxxee insa'nee dandeenne injifantabe'non» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Mannikinna dooyye dagemake bogixxee elobaaxxa odo Isira'eelike ardi giddo hiyya'n odeesee qici: «Dooyyinennek bogi giddo hedhaaka manna ittaaken; ookko undenneki manni duuchchinna ejjuma qeerrarrammaken; <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Nefiliimika mannanna ookko anfennen; Enaaqixxi horte daggeek Nefiliimi'niten; no'onna ifi uundanoo wodda koro'miisa lanbenne; insa'nenna no'oo iittanni unde'een.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:4">Dada. 6:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ardiinxa Xaqaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Eettene hashsha tuuta duuchcha hafuura gikki assite ooxxe. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Isira'eelito duuchcha Muuse'ninna Aarooni'n adhunde; tuutattinna insa'neen hitee qici, «Gibtse yookaan tenne qiilla gammoojje giddo renneenele silaan hitta eloxxemma'a! <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'oo konne boga'n iyyedagineechchi mayyeete? Wolaantichchik mundona'atebaa? No'oxxi aruwwanna oose no'oxxa no'onaa'ni adhdhinaan; tenne mannii'nita'a Gibtse'a ille iima hingennexxa woyyabaa?» <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Tennexxee weli'anni weli, «Amme! Sooreessa fi'line Gibtse'a ille iima hingo» hine.<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Eettene yanna Muusenna Aarooni ookko bukki hiyyeeke Isira'eelike ardi duuchchi edo albik gonbisemme. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Boga ookkonee dooyyemmake manni giddii'n Newek belti Iyyaasunna Yufoonik belti Kaalebi yaaddoti seemma ifi ifixxa dadarreexxi, <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />Isira'eelika orga duuchcha'n hinee qici, «Mammaremme dooyyinnennek bogi haranga konnete hiyyemabaake danchan. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'o'n gammadeexxe kaddoole isi aadhe iyyemaree no'oo ookkone malebi ado pu'isaake boga'n no'oo akeeke aassee, isoonna no'aa uwwaan. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n jallitine xaqartiyyette kaddinoqqe'e; waassuffa insa'nee indannaxxee ookkone bogika mannanna mee sodaatte; gollake asse'nammaki gopheme'een; yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'onni hedheen»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:16">Ibr. 3:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Tuuta duuchcha kinni insa'nee kinjik cancaqqo'a haassotte; ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Goottik ulfinni afenshatike duunkaana'n Isira'eelike arda duuchcha'n leelle.<verse eid="NUM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'n hiyyee qici, «Haani qico'n kunni ardi anee tuffata? Konne manbe'uwwa duuchcha insa'ne giddo assa'naa ane'n addata giba'neekiitta haani qico'nite? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Ani dhukkubik insa'ne'e ganee birannon; yaane kinni atee'e insa'ne caala lumokeenna jabake mannike assannon.»<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Muusenna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta, «Konne arda hunna atixxenni Gibtse giddii'n fulchiteettaxxee tennee yaane insa'ne lanqoole,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">Fula. 32:11-14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />assendeexxa yaane konne bogike manna'n kulaan; Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa! Ati konne ardinni welti hexxettexxa iittanni Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa! Ati alba insa'neek edo leellitaa'naa'a duumanchik utuphi insa'ne iimi darre hedhemmaxxa, barra duumanchiinke utuphinni hashshanna giirati bubenninni insa'nee edi eddii'n me'ita'n akeekkattaxxanna kunni ardi ediseenni laqeedheen. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Ta'ata konne arda duuchcha mitte yanna'n birtottole, gurra atika laqeek gosa gosak arduwwi, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‹Duuchchi Woddik Gootti konne ardi'a uwwo'a addachiise kakatemmake boga'n insa'nee dande'e aassa gopheemmaxxee insa'nee qiilla gammoojje'n bireen› hiyyaan. <verse eid="NUM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />Ta'anna hunna atixxa leellishatee iittanni addachiisa atixxe'n haasotteetta wodda, <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />‹Duuchchi Woddik Gootti rake mufatabaake; eeyya isixxi birasaxxeeke, cubbotanna balleesa gattowwaal hiyyaake; yaane kinni seera sa'eeka xixebaak waalabaaken; annuwwiinxe cubboxxe'e insa'nexxa oose sasenna shoole ila qico'n xixannon› hitettashshanni<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5-6">Fula. 20:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:9-10">Lew. 5:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:9-10">7:9-10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />konnee arda Gibtsee'n fuleexxe yannanaa'n ta'i qico'n cubbo insa'nexxa gattowwaal hitetteshshanni, atixxe jaalalaxxe lumminnixxe qixxe'n maganneten ta'anna cubbo insa'neexxa gattowwaal hiyyi.»<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna hissichcho hiyye haaso'ee qici, «Hitetteshshanni cubbo insa'nexxa gattowwaal hiyyeennen; <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Kaddo malee ani hedhaanneke kadennexxanna Duuchchi Woddike Goottik ulfinni butta duuchcha'n wo'maammaxxee <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />ulfinna anka iittanni Gibtse'ninna qiilla gammoojje giddo assenneka manbe'uwwa uudeen hedhe'e ajajema gibeexxi tommele anee hega uudemmake manninnaa'n mitti manjinna <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />annuwwa insa'neekee uwwonna'a kakate addachiiseennaka boga uudabaan; anee tuffateek mannanaa'n mittikinna haranga ookkonee boga uudabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:18">Ibr. 3:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Yaane kinni anki garbichchi Kaalebi gargart hedheeka hafuura afeemmaxxenna wo'ma hedhonni anee hordofe'e mare dooyemmake boga'n iso'o e'ishannon; horte isixxinna ookkone boga dhaaldaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:9-12">Iya. 14:9-12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Amaaleqikinna Kenaanik manni dhooqa giddo hedha'neeke kademmaxxee'e soodo illeema higgineexxi Eritiriinxe Abaayyaka ora qiilla gammoojje giddi'a me'we.»<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muusenna Aarooni'i hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />«Konne fuggichchi tuutiki manni ane'n adhuma'neek haaniqico'nite? Konne bojogema'neeke Isira'eelike mannixxa bojoggensha laqeennen. <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Tennexxee insa'nee, Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Ani hedhaanneken; eetteneen haasotinaa'na laqennexxa yaanuwwa ha'no'n assannon; tinninna, <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Majinke laakkosi wodda lame tomme woggakinna yookaan eettene iimi darre hexxeexxe woggake kaddineekinna ane'n adhundina'neek duuchchi renshi ha'nook tenne qiilla gamoojje'n fiddi hiyyaan. <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Itti galdine hossinaake kadaashsha jaba qicinni kakateenneke ookkone boga'n Yoofonika belto Kaalebiinna Neweka belto Iyyaasu malee ha'noo giddii'n mitti manjinna e'yitinabaan. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Boojinaan hitineemmaxxa ha'nooxxa oose kinni ookkone boga'n aassannon; ha'no tuffatineemmake ookkone boga'n insa'nee gammandaan. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Ha'no kinni renshi ha'nok tenne qiilla gammoojje'n fiddi hiyyee gataan. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Xuurameeyyete kada gopha ha'nooxxenaa'ni kexxeexxenni ha'nonaa'ni udu'me reyaakik renshi tenne qiilla gammooje giddo fiddi hiyyaa qico ha'noxxi oose abara uudda'n shoole tomme wogga allalsanote kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:36">Erga. Huj. 7:36</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Ookkone boga dooyate'n turtineemmaxxe shoole tomme barraxxa qixxe, mitte barra'a mitte wogga laako'ende'naa cubbo ha'noxxee'e shoole tomme wogga abara uudinaan; hitteeqico ha'non ke'ennexxanna egendinaan. <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Ani Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'n mitteba ke'eeke konne fuggichcha orga'n tennee yaanuwwa assannoxxa haaso'eennen; muda insa'nexxinna tenne qiilla gammoojje giddo kaddaan; ookkonna rennaan hiyyi.»<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Ookkone boga dooyyatee Muuse erge'naa ookkoni ille iima higat ookkone bogixxee fuggoxxa odo bogi giddo duuchcha'n geessisat tuuta duuchchi iso'n adhdhudaashsha asseemmak, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />ookkone bogixxeenna elobaaxxa odo bogi giddo geessiseemmak iikki manni, Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo balati reye. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Ookkone Boga dooyyatee ergemeeke manninaa'n lubbo gateekir Neweke belto Iyyaasunna Yoofonike belto Kaalebi callamman. <verse eid="NUM 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Muusenna tenne yaane Isira'eelike arda'n kule wodda ardi fuggo oodhe. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Langa barro gorsanni ardi koobatike bogiba'a alalle qabateexxi, «Cubbo hunjeennen; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'aa addachiise uwwemmake boonchiba'a alalle me'innannon.»<verse eid="NUM 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ookkone Boga Adhdhate Assendeexxa Wo'laancho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Lan. 1:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Muuse kinni hiyyee qici, «Mayeete ha'no Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajaja saxxinaachchi? Tinni yaane ha'noo'a qajeeldabaan. <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Alalle mee qabatte; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nonni welti hedha gopheemmaxxee naaphi ha'noo injifataan. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Amaaleqikinna Kenaanik manni ookko ha'noni lolik futti hiyyaan; ha'nonna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta hordofatenaa'n ille iima higginemmaxxenna isi ha'nonni welti hedhagopheemmaxxe wolaantichchik muddinaan.»<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Insa'ne kinni Koobatike bogibaa alalle qabante me'ine; yaane kinni Muuse yookaan Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Taaboti kaanbe giddii'n fule'eemmabaan. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Eettenee yanna koobatike boga'n hedhammak Amaaleqikinna Kenaanik manni adadde dirre dageexxi insa'nee lole injifate; Horimaamike qachchi qico'ninna insa'nee shorre.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lebemeexxi Shiqaaka Tolchuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />«Isira'eelike arda'n hitatto qici, ‹Galdine hossino'a uwwaanneke boga'n e'yitinee uduma, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />Werreega ha'nooka muuxatika yookaan fedhi ifixxenni shiqilsatika yookaan ayyaanuwwa ha'nook wodda fishshe isixxi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchisaaka tolcha lalokenaa'n yookaan gedhebokenaa'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ciincatika tolcha, <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />konnee tolcha shiqisaak manji mitte leetiro zayitenni qushshendeexxa mitte kiilo eloxxa midhatixxa bulle Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />Ciincatike yookaan duliinke tolchi'a shiqaake mitti mittengi gedhebiinke buruusinni welti mitte leetiro woyinetixxe bookanni qophpheessowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />Gedhebiinke korbeesinni welti mitte leetironna gamisa zayitenni qushshendeexxa midhatixxa eloxxa lame kiilo bulle qophpheessowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />Iittanni ha'watike tolchi'a kadaaxxa mitte leetironna gamisa woyinetixxa booka qophpheesse; tinninna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchissaaxxa fishshe afaashsha assitine shiqishshe.<verse eid="NUM 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />« ‹Mitte jibichcha gargarti hedheeke werregi'a yookaan mittummatee shiqaake ciincatike tolchi'a yookaan duliinke tolchi'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishshinaa wodda, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />jibichchiki welti lame leetiro zayitenni qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa sase kiilo bulle iyyedagge. <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />Iittanni lame leetiro woyinetixxa booka ha'watike tolchi'a shiqishshe; isinna giirate'n ciinceessemeexxi fishshe isixxi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchiisaake tolcha kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />Yoona Mitti mittiing jibichchi yookaan gedhebiink korbees, mitti mittiinge gedhebiink buruus yookaan re'etik buruusi konne qicinni shiqowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Shiqishshineeke horike laakkosixxe qixxe'n, mitti mittinige'e tenneenni asse.<verse eid="NUM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />« ‹Mitti mittiingi Isira'eelichchoke kadeek manji duuchchi ciincessemeexxi fishshe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachisaaka tolcha shiqisaa wodda tennee yaanuwwa konne qicinni assowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Daggaaxxe illa duuchcha'n alagi yookaan ha'noo giddo hedheek huunni manjinna ciincessemeexxi fishshe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachiisaaka tolcha shiqisaa wodda ha'no assitinammashsha isinna assowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Tuutatenna kadi ha'noo giddo hedheeke alagi'a mitte bifake galduma kadowwaal; tinninna daggaaxxe ilake baro duuchcha'n jijjirendabaaxxe aadan; ha'nonna kadi alagi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo mitteken. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Ha'no'ninna kadi ha'no giddo hedheeke alaga'n kunni seerinna tinni aada qixxe muuxxendaan.› »<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:22">Lew. 24:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />«Isira'eelike arda'n hitatto qici: ‹Ha'noo iyyemaraanneke boga'n aaggineexxi, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />ookkone bogixxa ita ittinaa wodda isenaa'ni aaxxine'e Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolcha uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Tinninna edisse uxxendeexxe adda dayendebaaxxe bullenaa'n kebbo kebbisineexxi ooddetenaa'n aaxxine uutinammaxxe midhashsha uwwa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Daggaaxxe illa duuchcha'n edisse uxxendeexxa adda dayendebaaxxa bulle Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwa shiqishshinaan.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haakitik Hujendeexxe Cubbo'a Shiqaaka tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />« ‹Akimagaada haakitik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'n uwwemake ajajuwwinaa'n mitte heqqedha gophphinoole, kunninna <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajuwwa uwwemmaxxe barranaa'n edi'a daggaaxxe illa duuchcha'n Muuse darree'n ha'noo ajajemmaka konnee ajajuwwa muuxa gophphinoole, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />tinninna kaddeek tuutatike haakitinaa'nite kaddoole, tuuta duuchchi mitte jibichcha shiqishsheexxi fishshe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gamachiisashsha ciincesowaal; seerinshanni mitteba ifi ifika midhatika tolcha, ha'watike tolchi'anna iittanni cubbotike tolchi'a mitte labbaka recco shiqinsowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Qeesichchikinna Isira'eelixxe tuuta duuchchi cubbo birowwaal; cubbo insa'nexxinna gattowwaal hiyyendaan; gattowwaal hiyyendaachchinna balleessa hunjeeki haakitikite kaddeemmaxxeenna konnee assineeke dedhi'a ciincatika tolchanna cubbotike tolcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqinshemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Haakitik assemeeka dedha duuchchiing hujeeke kademmaxxee Isira'eelixxi tuuta duuchchinna insa'ne giddo hedheek alagi duuchchi gattowwaal hiyyemaan.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />« ‹Yaane kinni mitti manji haakitik umo ifikenn cubbo hujoole kinni cubbotike tolchi'a mitte meyaxxa recco iyyedagowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma qeesichchi haakitik cubbo hujemmake manji'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo cubbo isi'a biraan; cubbo biratinna isi'a assendaa wodda manjichchikinna gattowwaal hiyyemaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:27-31">Lew. 4:27-31</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Isira'eelike boga'ni ilemeek manjonna kadi yookaan alagi cubbo haakitiki hujoole, hoone manjo'ninna adhdhemaak seer mittengen.<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />« ‹Isira'elke boga'ni ilemeeke manjonna kadi yookaan alagi mudhdheexxi cubbo hujeek huuni manjinna kinni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta shollisheemmaxxee iikki manji ifike ardi giddii'n fugussemowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Isi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika hiyyichcho tuffateemmaxxee seeruwwa isikanna sa'eemmaxxe'e eeti, iikki manji balleesa isixxe kaddemmaxxee fugussemowwaal.› »<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edi Sanbata Ulfeessa Gopha Reyote'n Geessisseexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Isira'eelito qiilla gammoojje giddo hexxemma wodda manjichchi mitti Edi Sanbatiixa barra haqqe qoceccate'n afeme. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Isi haqqe qocedhaa'naa isoo afeemmak manni ookkonee manjichcho Muuseba'aa Aarooniba'aanna duuchchiinxi Isira'eelitotixxi tuuta hexxeeba'aa iyyemare. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />Manjichchoke'n maa assa hassissaaxxa ca'a hiteexxi yaane hedha gophpheemaxxe'e seeri hunda heqqemaashsha assine. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse, «Manjichchi shiyemuun; Iisra'eelik tuuti duuchchinna isoo kaanbeti gadho kinjik cancaqowwaal» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse ajajemmashshanni tuuta duuchchi manjichcho kaanbeti gadho fulchiteexxi reyaa qico'n isoo kinjik cancaqqe.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seemmatike Handaarixxee Uwwendeexxa Akkeette</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />«Isira'eelitote'n hitatto qici, ‹Daggaaxxe illa duuchcha'n ha'nooxxe seemmake kasa'n handaara giisse; mitti mittiing handaari iimatixxe bifake handaara kadowwaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:12">Lew. 22:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Qalbe ha'nooxxi yorteexxanna ille ha'nooxxi uuddeexxa duuchcha hordofine yabaabuldinabaashsha, konne handaaruwwa uuddina'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajajuwwa qalli hitina'n ajajendino'a ha'noo kunni handaaruwwi qalli assaan. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Tennexxee ajajuwwa anka duuchcha muuxxino'a qaabbatinaan; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'anna ifi woyyoonsitinaan. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Mageno kadona'a Gibtsee'n ha'noo fulchennek ante Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Magenon.› »<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Qorexxa, Daatanixxanna Aberoonixxa Xaqaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Leewwike gosak mini hado kadeek Qe'aatixxe gosak Yisa'eerik belti Qore, Roobelixxe gosak mini hadinaa'ni Eliyabixxi labbaxxi oose Daataninna Aberooni, iittanni Fileetimik belti Ooni fuggoxxenni qophphi hine ke'neexxi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:11">Yih. 11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />Muuse gaarrifante. Insa'nenni welti Isira'eelik ardi giddo gurra fuleekinna, tuutatike sooreesuwwa kado'a filemeemmaki lame dhibbinna onde tomme Isira'eelik manni insa'nenni welti hedhemman. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Insa'nenna bukki hine dangeexxi Muuseenna Aaroonii'i gaarrifanta'n, «Ha'no hara bira saxxineen! Tenne Tuutatik mitti mitting manji woyyichchaken; Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna insa'ne'n hedheen; mayeeteta ha'o Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe tuuta'n ifi lummisina'neek?» Hine.<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Muusenna tennee laqeexxa yanna albik butta gonbisemeexxi, <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Qoreenna isinni hedhemmaka manna, «Soodo gorsa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ifike kadeekanna woyyichchake kadeeka gargar foyeexxi leellishaan; ifi biri'anna iyyedagaan; fi'leeka manjo ifibaa shikki hiyyaashsha assaan. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Koo Qore, atinna atik manni duuchchi assitinaa qici hixaaniinka gubimalchuwwa aaxxinee dagge! <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />Soodo gorsa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ookkone hixaaniinke gubmalchuwwa'n kashiloke'n hixxana worre; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti filaak manji isi woyyichchake kadaan; ha'no tee Leewwito haranga birasaxxineeki ha'noten.»<verse eid="NUM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Higgeena Muuse Qore'n, «Ha'no tee Leewwito, laqqe! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Ha'noo Duuchchi Woddik Gootti wele gatteexxe Isira'eelixxe tuutanaa'n gargar hissiyyotinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottike Taabotiinke galdumixxa ergatema muuxxinaashsha ifibaa ha'noo shikki assedhiyyo, tuutatanna ergatendinaashsha tuutati edo uurritinaashsha isi assa calli ha'noo geltabaa? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Isi ateenna wele atinni welti hexxeexxa Leewwito duuchcha ifibaa shikki assedhe'een; ta'a kinni ha'no Qeesumatixxa huje lephphitine hujjino'a wo'laandina'neen. <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Tennexxee atinna atee hordofemak manni bukki hitine kexxine'ek Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'niten; Aarooni'n adhdhundina'neek Aarooni isi ayyete?»<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muuse Eliyaabika belto Daataninna Aberooni ye'emmaashsha manjo erge; yaane kinni insa'ne «Dangabe'non! <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Qiillaa gammoojje giddo no'oo shiltotaa malebo ado pu'isaake boginaa'n no'oo axxe fuldetaxxi atee geltabaa? Ta'a kinni no'o'n goottondota'a hassaatte? <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Tennee waalin malebi ado pu'isaake bogibaa no'oo iyyedagebexxo, yookaan fichchuwwakanna woyinetika hiddichchuwwa dhaallannoshsha assitebexxo; maata konnee manna ille abiddatto? Haranga dangabe'no!»<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Muusenna lumoshsha mufateexxi, Duuchchi Woddika Gootta, «Uwwa insa'nexxa mee adhdhi; ani konne manninaa'n mitte harrichco midde adhdhebe'non; insa'nenaa'ninna mittekanna balleessebe'non» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muusenna Qoree hiyyee qici, «Atinna atinni welti hedhemmak manni duuchchi, iittanni Aarooninna, soodo gorsa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo shiqqe. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Mitti mittiing manji ifii ifika hixaanika gubimalcho adhdheexxi isi giddonna hixaana worowwaal; duuchching gubimalchi mitteba 250 kadaan; iittanni atinna Aarooninna ifi ifika hixaanika gubimalcho Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo sqishshe.» <verse eid="NUM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Tennexxee mitti mittiing manji ifi ifika hixaanika gubimalcho adhdheexxi giddonna kashiloke'n hixxana woreexxi Muuseninna Aarooninni welti afensahatike duunkaanixxe wuddumme'n uurre. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Qorenna, ifixxa hordofeeyye duuchcha afenshatike duunkaanixxe wuddumme'n insa'nee bukki asse wodda Duuchchi Woddike Goottik ulfinni tuuta duuchcha'n leelle. <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, Muusenna Aaroonii'i, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />«Duuchiinga insa'nee mittemba hirbake'n bironna'a, tenne tuuta giddi'n fulle» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Yaane kinni Muusenna Aarooni albik butta gonbisemeexxi, «Manji duuchike hafuurike Mageno kaddeeteke Magenoo, manji mitti cubbo hujoole, tuuta duuchcha'n mufattattota?» Hinne. <verse eid="NUM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottinna Muuse, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />«Tuutate'n, ‹Qoreke, Aberoonikenna Daatanike duunkaanibaa'n bayyatte› hite kuli hiyye.»<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muusenna ke'eexxi Daatanibaanna Aberoonibaa mare, Isira'eelixxi akeekisanjuwwa isoo hordofe. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Isinna tuuta, «Konne fuggaalesi mannike duunkaaninaa'n bayyatte! Isa'nechcho kadeechcho mittekanna tuqqinoqqe'e; kada gophphoole insa'nexxe cubbo duuchchixxe buuttonni ha'noo muddinaani» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Tennexxee Qoreke, Daatanikenna Aberoonike duunkaanuwwinaa'n bayyante; Daataninna Abirooni dangeexxi ifixxe aruwwanni, oosenninna ifixxe annoolenn welti ifike duunkaanuwwixxe wuddumme'n uurrine.<verse eid="NUM 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muusenna, «Assaannexxa yaanuwwa Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee erge'naate malee anke umike yaada kadebaaxxa egendinaa qici: <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Kunn manni manji reyamashsha seeriinxa reyyo reyoole yookaan reyammake manjo'n geltammaxxi calli insa'ne'n geltoole Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anee ergeebaan hiyyaten. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hara kadde egendebaaxxa haaroxxa yaane, buttini haanni hiyyeexxi insa'neenna insa'neechcho kadeechcho duuchcha liqinsee'naa hedhondinni hirreesi giddo mooggemmoole, kunni manni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta tuffateeke kadeexxa egendinaak ookkone woddan.»<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Tenne yaane duuchcha haaso'e bireeshshanni buttin uurrinemmaxxe bakka'n haani hiyyeexxi <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />ins'neenna insa'neeka mini haduwwa, iittaanni Qoreenna isika manjo duuchcha horanteexxa karra duuchcha buttin liqiinse. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Tennexxee insa'ne anfeemmaxxe yaane duuchchinni welti hedhondinni hirreesi giddi'a dhidhimme; buttinikinna insa'ne hana cufeme; insa'nenna ba'neexxi tuuta giddii'n fuggussemme. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Insa'nexxe raarenaa'ninna kexxeexxa ookke hedhemak Isira'eeli ardi «Buttin no'onna liqinsaan» hiyya'n baaje.<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Gootti giira iimii'ni ergee'naa hixaana gubammaka lame dhibbanna onde tomme manna itte.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse'n, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />«Hixaaniink gubimachchuwwi woyyichchake kademmaxxee giddo hedhemaka kashilo aa'ne bayinseexxi dunnaashsha qeesichcho Aaroonika belto Ali'aazaari'n kuli. <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />Kunni hixxaniink gubimalchuwwinna cubbo hujati hedho ifixxa ifi'anni balleessemmake manniken; gubimalchuwwikinna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo shiqeexxi woyyoommeke kadeemmaxxee tolchimalchinke buyyisanjo kado'a tundettexxi hephpheesi; kunni hixxaaniink gubimalchuwwinna Isira'eelika arda xexxe'achiisatike beessisa kadaan.»<verse eid="NUM 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Tennexxee Qeesichi Ali'aazaar iikki gubatemaki manni iyyedageemmaka segeetotike sibiljika gubimalchuwwa mitteba bukki asseexxi tolchimalchinke buyisanjo kado'a tume giise. <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />Tenneenna isi iitta asseechchi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse darree'n isoo ajajemmashshaten. Tinni Aaroonixxe horte kaddoole malee'e ayyinna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo shiqeexxi hixaana gubabaashsha, guboole kinni Qore'ninna isike manna'n kaddemmaxxi ookkone manjo'n kaddaaxxa Isira'eelike ardi'a uwwendeexxe xexxe'achchiissamman.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Langaxxa barra gorsa Isira'eelixxi tuuta, «Ha'no Duuchchi Woddike Goottika arda shiltine'een» hita'n Muuse'ninna Aarooni'ni adhdhunde.<verse eid="NUM 16:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Yaane kinni Isira'eelixxi tuuta Muuse'ninna Aarooni'ni kexxo'a bukki hiteexxa yanna afenshatike duunkaanibaa wirri hineexxi uunda wodda duumanchi iikki woddi afenshatika duunkaana buqe'naa anfe; Duuchchi Woddike Goottik ulfinninna leelle. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muusenna Aarooni afenshatike duunkaani edi'a me'ine. <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse'n, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />«Tenne tuuta mitte yanna'n bira'ennen insa'ne birii'n bayyati» hiyye. Muusenna, Aarooni Albik butta gonbisemme. <verse eid="NUM 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muuse Aaroonii'i, «Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi aare dagee'naa bala saffa'een gubimalcho aadhi, kashilokanna tolchimalchokenaa'n aaxxeetexxi hixaanik welt itti worte'e rakke gongite tuutatiba'a martettexxi insa'ne'a cubbo biri» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Tennexxee Aarooni Muuse hiyyemmashshanni tuuta giddi'a gonge mare e'ye; balatinna edisenni ardi giddo saffe'eemman; kaddoolenna Aarooni hixaana gubeexxi insa'neexxa cubbo bire. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Isinna reyyeekeenna hedhoti hedheeke mannixxe oddo'n uure; balatinna uurte. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Kaddoolenna Qorexxe buutonni reyeeke manni gadhi darre tommenna shoole kuminna torbaani dhibbi manni balati reye. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Ookkoneechchi uduma bala uurte; Aarooninna Muuse hedheebaa afenshatike duunkaanixxe wudumeba'a ille iima hige.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s1">Aaroonixxe Siqqichchoxxa Quuxisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />«Isira'eelike arda'n kuldettexxi mitte mittenge gosati minike sooreessuwwinaa'n mitte mitte, duuchchiinxi mitteba tommenna lame siqqo aadhi; mitte mitte manjichchika summa isi isinxe siqqichcho hana borreessi. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Mitti mittiing gosati minik sooreessi mitte mitte siqqichcho afa hasissaaxxe kaddemmaxxee Leewwike gosati minixxe siqqichcho hana Aaroonika summa borreessi. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Tenne siqqotanna ani atinni afemannoke afenshatike duunkaani giddo Taabotiinke galdumi edi darre uggi. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Tennexxee ani filannoke manjixxi siqqichcho quuxisa quuxxissaan; tennenninna Isira'eelik ardi hashsha barra ha'no'n adhdhuma'neexxa adhdhuma uurrisannon.»<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Tennexxee Muuse Isira'eelike arda'n haaso'e; insa'nek sooreessuwwi ifi ifike mitte mittiinge gosati minenaa'n tommenna lame siqqo uune. Aaroonixxi siqqichchonna insa'neexxe siqqo giddo hexxemman. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Muusenna tenne siqqo duuchcha iyyemareexxi Taabotiinke Galdumike duunkaani giddo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ugge.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Langaxxa bara gorsa Muuse Taabotiinke Galdumike duunkaan giddi'a e'yaa woda Leewwike gosati minik summi itti borreessememmaxxi Aaroonixxi siqqichcho quuxisa calla kaddebaangi luuphphisseexxi, daraarte Almoondi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wele tika Lewizetixxe gumma hitaan. </char></note> gummise'na'a afe. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muuse duuchchiinxa siqqo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edii'n aadheexxi Isira'eelike manni duuchchiba'a iyyedage; insa'nenna uundeexxi mitti mitting manji ifi ifixxa siqqichcho adhdhe. <verse eid="NUM 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse, «Aaroonixxi siqqichcho xaqartichchi manni'a xexxe'achchiisatike beessisa kaddo'a ille iima hissitettexxi Taabotiinke Galdumi edi darre isee uggi; insa'ne rennabaashshanna, ane'n adhdhummaxxa adhdhumanna isee gatissaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:4">Ibr. 9:4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Muusenna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti isoo ajajemmashshanni asse.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelik manni Muuse'e, «Yoona no'oo'a reyanden; ba'nennen, no'oo duuchchinge ba'nenden! <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottike Taabotike galdumibaa shiqaak ayyetenna kadoole midde reyaan; isi no'oo duuchingi rennaanneta?»<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s1">Qeesetixxanna Leewwitotixxa Huje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Aaroonii'i, «Woyyitte bakka uuddaaxxe yaane'n assendaaxxe cubboxxee, ati, atixxi labbaxxi oosenna atike annik mini hadduwwi annooma adhdhitinaan; qeesooma uuddaaxxe yaanexxee kinni, annooma uuddaak atenna atixxe labbaxxe oose calla kaddaan. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Atinna atixxi labbaxxi oose Taabotiinke Galdumike duunkaani edo ergatendinaaxxa yanna ha'nonni welti hexxeexxi ha'no'o qarqaarto'a atike annike gosati mininaa'n Leewwito iyyedag. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Insa'nenna atixxe akkeette hunda duunkaani giddixxa huje duuchcha ergattemmuun; kaddo malee rennabaashsha woyyitte bakkake mi'iba'aanna kaddo'o galmiinke tolchimalchiba'a shinqoqqe'e; shinqeexxe kaddoole insa'nenna atinna rertinaan. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Insa'ne afenshatika duunkaana heqqatee tinninna duunkaani giddo hujendaaxxa huje duuchcha heqqatee atinni welti he'nuun; weli manji ayyinna ha'noobaa shiqoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Langaxxa Isira'eelike manna'n aare kaddabaashsha ha'no woyyite bakkanna tolchimalcho heqqe. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Ani umo angenninni ha'nooka dayyuwwa Leewwito Isira'eelike manni giddii'n filennexxi ha'no'a uwwennek anten; insa'ne'e afenshatike duunkaani giddixxa huje hunjo'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwemme'een. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Yaane kinni tolchimalchoke'n goli giddo hujendaaxxa heene qeesummatixxa ergatensha ergatendinaaki ateenna atixxe labbaxxe oose callan; qeessummatixxa ergatensha ha'no'a uwweennen; ha'no gadhi darre woyyitte bakkabaa shiqaak hedheexxe kaddoole kinni shiyemuun.»<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseeteenna Leewawitotee'e Uwwendaaxxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Aarooni'ni hiyyee qici, «Ani'a shiqqaaxxe uwwa hana ani umo angenninni deette ati'a uwweennen; Isira'eelik manni ani'a shiqisaaxxa woyyitte uwwa duuchcha ati'anna atixxe labbaxxe oose'a duuchchi woddike qoobbo kadaashsha ha'no'a uwweennen. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Ani'a shiqqaaxxe hara woyyitte uwwa duuchchinaa'n midhatike tolchinaa'n, cubbotike yookaan balleessatike tolchinaa'n atikenna atixxe labbaxxe ooseke qoobbo kaddaak giirate'n ciinceessemebaaken. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Tinninna hara woyyitte kadeexxa hedati woyyitte bakka'n iti; labballi duuchchi isenaa'n itowwaal. Tinni ati'a woyyitteten.<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />«Isira'eelik manni shiqisaaxxe uwwaarinaa'n dolsendaaxxi uwwaar gargar foyyende uggendaaxxi, atixxe kaddowwaal; tinninna ati'a, atixxe labbaxxe oose'anna atixxe meyyaxxe oose'a duuchchi woddike ha'nooke qoobbo kadaashsha asseennen; atike mini haduwwinaa'n aadatike seerishsha luqqi hiyyeek ayyinna isenaa'n itowwaal.<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />«Isira'eelik manni, Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a umo iyyedagaaxxa yo'oshsha eloxxa ejersiinxa zayite, yo'oshsha eloxxa woyinetixxa bookanna midha duuchcha ati'a uwweennen. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Iikki bogi fulcheechchi duuchchinaa'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a umo iyyedangaaxxi gumma duuchcha atixxe kaddaan; atike minik hadinaa'n aadatike seeriishsha luqqi hiyyeek duuchchinna isee ita dande'aan.<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />«Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a muremeechchi, Isira'eelike bogi giddo hedheechchi huunlchi duuchchinna atiken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:28">Lew. 27:28</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />«Hore manjokenaa'n taakkaba ilemeexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwemeek duuchchi atiken; yaane kinni hoone'e angafa labbaka beltonna batto'eeke horinaa'n edise ilemeeka hore duuchcha wodi. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Konneeranna elemeexxi mitte agenjo kadaa wodda a'urriinxe woyyitte bakkaxxe mikexxe qixxe'n a'urre onde tommenna onde giraami qico kadaake birretike sibljinni woddatton.<verse eid="NUM 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />«Yaane kinni woyyichchake kademmaxxee edise ilemeeka laliinka, gedhebiinkanna re'etika woddoxxe'e; munde konneerixxa tolchimalchoke'n fifiixetexxi, fishshe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchiissaashsha koneerixxa ha'yonna giirate'n shiqaake tolchi'a giirate'n ciinceessi. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Dolsatike tolchi'a cormetinna middixxi luka atixxe kaddemmashshanni konneerik maalinna ati'a kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />Isira'eelik manni shiqiisaaxxe woyyitte uwwaariinaa'n gargar foyyemaachchi duuchchi atike, atixxe labbaxxenna meyyaxxe ooseke duuchchi woddike qoobbo kadaashsha ha'no'a uwweennen; tinninna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ati'anna atixxe horte'a duuchchi woddi'a jijjiirendabaaxxe maxinetixxe kakon.»<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Aarooni'n hiyyee qici, «Ati Isira'eelike boginaa'n qoodendattok qadaadinna alfitattok qoobbi hedhebaan; Isira'eelike manni giddo atike qadaadinna atik qoobbi anten.<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />«Afensahtike duunkaani giddo ergatenshati hujendaaxxe hujeke runda kadaashsha Isira'eelik manni iyyedagaaxxa tommitte uwwaari duuchchi Leewwitotee qadaadake kadaashsha insa'ne'a uwweennen. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Ta'inni elqi'a weli Isira'eelitotik manni ballesanjoke kadabaashshanna reyabaashsha afenshatike duunkaaniba'a shiqoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Afenshatike duunkaana'n assendaaxxa huje hujaaxxi Leewwitoten; ookko assendaaxxe balleesaxxeenna annooma adhdhitaan; tinni daggaaxxe ila ila'a duuchchii woddixxe aadan; Leewwitotee'e Isira'eelike manni giddo qadaadi insa'ne'a hedhabaan. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />Tennexxa bado Isira'eelik manni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a iyyedagaaxxa tommittetixxa uwwa Leewwitotike qadaada kaddaashsha uwweennen. Aninna tenne uuddaaxxen, ‹Insa'ne Isira'eelike manni giddo qadaada anfabaan hiyyeennak tennexxeetemman.› »<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'n hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />«Leewwitote'n hite kuldatto qici: ‹Ha'nooke qadaada kaddo'a uwweennexxa tommittetixxa uwwa Isira'eelike manninaa'n adhdhitinaa wodda ha'nonna adhdhitineexxe eettene tommittetixxe uwwanaa'n tommitte uwwa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishshinaan. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Tinni ha'nooxxi uwwanna aldummetenaa'n aadhendeexxe midhashsha yookaan bulbulendeebaa'n aadhendemmaxxe woyyinetixxe bookashsha ha'no'a laakko'endaan. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Ha'nonna konne qicinni Isira'eelike manninaa'n aaxxinaaxxe tommittenaa'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwa uutinaan; tennee'e Duuchchi Woddike Goottike qoobbo kaddeexxa tommitte qeesichcho Aarooni'a uutinaan. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottike qoobbo kado'a shiqishinaak aadhdhitnaachchi duuchchinaa'n filendeexxenna hara woyyitte yaane kada hassissaan.›<verse eid="NUM 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />«Leewwitotanna hitatto qici: ‹Filendeexxa kuta shiqishshinaaxxa yanna ise aldummetenaa'n aadhendeexxe midhashsha yookaan bulbulendeebaa'n aadhendeexxe woyinetixxe bookashsha ha'no'a laakko'endaan. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Gatteexxi kinni ha'no, afenshatike duunkaani giddo ergatendinemmaxxee ergatematike runda ha'nooke kaddemmaxxee ha'nonna ha'nooke mini hadi duuchchinni habanna ita dandeetinaan. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Eette filendeexxa yaane shiqishshinoole tenne uuddaaxxenni balleesanjoke kaddinabaan; iittanni Isira'eelitotixxa woyyitte uwwaara battoossitinabaan, reyotanna rertinabaan.› »<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s1">Luqqi Assatika Wode'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'ninna Aarooni'n hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />«Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajeeke seeri'a hasissaaxxi aada konneechchi butta hexxeexxen: fafa yookaan busha affebaaxxanna qanbari ise hana fee'eme ege'nemebaaxxa mitte diimmoxxa raada iyyedangaashsha Isira'eelitote'n kuli. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />Eettene raaddanna qeesichcho Ali'aazaari'ni uwwi, isenna aadhendeexxi kaanbeti gadhi darre isi edo gora'endowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Ookkoneechchi uduma qeesichchi Ali'aazaar qubichcho ifika isexxe munde'n cuupha'n afenshatike duunkaani edi darre'n torbaanele fixowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Isi udda'naa iitti raada gubendowwaal; isek gogi, maali, mundetinna cumi iseki gubemowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Qeesichichchiikinna birbirsiinka haqichcho, hisoophenna diimmoka shimala aadheexxi raada gubatta'eemaxxe giira giddi'a darbowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki qeesichchi seemma ifixxa wodi'ik borcedha, biso ifikanna wodi'ik anshedha hassissaan; ookkonechchi uduma kaanbe giddi'a higa dande'aan; kaddo malee aadatishsha galgali qico'n isi batto'eeke kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Isee gubeek manjinna iitanni seemma ifixxa borcedha, biso ifikanna wodi'ik anshedha hassissaan; isinna galgali qico'n batto'eeke kadaan.<verse eid="NUM 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />«Ca'ichake kadeek manjinna eettene raadaka bululo gure'e kaanbeti gadhi darre iyyemareexxi aadatike seersha ca'ittete kaddeexxe bakka'n uggurowwaal. Kunninna Isira'eelixxi tuuta luqqi assatika wode'e qophpheessatee la'o uwwaake kadaan; tinni aadanna cubbotenaa'n luqqi assatee kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:13">Ibr. 9:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Eettene raadaka bululo guraak manjinna iittanni seemma ifixxa borcedha, biso ifikanna anshedha hasissaan; iikki manji galgali qico'n batto'eeke kadaan. Tinni Isira'eelike ardi'a insa'ne giddo hedhaake alagi'aanna duuchchi woddixxe aada kaddaan.<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />«Reyeeke manjika rensha tuqaak huuni manjinna torbaane barra qico'n batto'eeke kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Isi sakkaxxenna torbaxxe barra'n biso ifika duuchcha wode'ik luqqi assedhowwaal; ookkoneechchi uduma isinna luqqi hiyyaan. Sakkaxxenna torbaxxe barra'n ifi luqqi assa gophoole kinni isi luqqichchake kadabaan. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Reyeeke manjika rensha tuqeexxi ifi luqqi assebaak huuni manjinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Taabotiinka galduma battoossaan; iikki manji Isira'eelike ardi giddii'n fugussemowwaal. Iso'n luqqi assatik wodi'i fixema gopheemmaxxee isi batto'eeken. Battummatenaa'n fulebaan.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />«Manji mitti duunkaani giddo reyaaxxa yanna assemaak seer konneechchi butta hedheeken: ookkene duunkaani giddi'a e'yaakenna kado'o ookko giddo hedheek huuni manjinna torbaane barra qico'n batto'eeke kadaan; <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />iittanni tuphemebaang haanni hiyyeexxi hedheek huuni mi'inna batto'eeke kadaan.<verse eid="NUM 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />«Gadho wolaantichchik shiyeemeek yookaan iittanni reyeeka yookaan reyeeke manjixxa miqe yookaan hirreessa tuqaaki huuni manjinna torbaane barra qico'n batto'eeke kadaan.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />«Batto'eeka manjo, luqqi assatike cubboti tolchi'a gubendeemmaxxe eettene diimoxxe raadake bululinaa'n odolcho giddo uggat muummetik wodi'i isi hana woremowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma aadatike seerishsha luqqi hiyyeek manji hisoophixxa dame aadheexxi wodi'i giddo cuupheechchi uduma ookkone duunkaana'n, ookko giddo hedheeka mi'a duuchcha'n, ookkonna hedhemmake manna duuchcha'n fixowwaal; iittanni reyeeke manjixxa miqe yookaan hirreessa yookaan shiyemeeka yookaan ifitti reyeeka manjo tuqeeke hoone manjo'ninna fixowaal. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Luqqi hiyyeek manji luqqi hiyyebaake manjo'n sakkaxxenna torbaxxe barra'n fixowwaal; torbaxxe barra'n isoo luqqi assuun; iikki manjinna seemma ifixxa borcedhowwaal; biso ifikanna wodi'ik anshedhowwaal; isinna eettenee galgala luqqi hiyyeeke kadaan.<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />«Yaane kinni batto'eek mitti manji ifi luqqi assebaang gatoole Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa woyyitte bakka battoossammaxxee tuuta giddii'n fuggussemowwaal; luqqi assatik wodi'i iso'n fixema gophemmaxxee isi batto'eeken. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Tinni insa'ne'a duuchchi woddixxe aadan; luqqi assatika wode'e fixeek manjinna seemma ifixxa borcedhowwaal; ayyinna luqqi assatika wode'e tuqaak manji galgali qico'n batto'eeke kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Battoo'eek manji tuqaaxxi hiini yaanenna battooteexxe kaddaan; iseenna tuqaak manjinna galgali qico'n batto'eeke kadaan.»<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s1">Rassatenaa'n Fuleeka Wode'e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Fula. 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Siretike agenjo'n Isira'eelik duuchching orgi Tsinixxe qiilla gammoojje giddo dageexxi Qaades offo'le; ookko Maaryaami rerte, ookkonna moogende.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Eettnee yanna, orgakee wodi'i hedhemmaba'a ardikinna Muuseenna Aaroonii'i aallachchoti bukki hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Ardikinna Muuse'n ke'e hiyyee qici, «No'ok dayyuwwi Duuchchi Woddike Goottike dunkaani edo reyyeemma wodda maa hedhema silaati no'onna eettene yanna renneennele. <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottika orga kaba iyyedagineechchi mayaate! Hore no'okenni no'o kaba mundonnaatee? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Gibtsee'n no'oo fulchitineexxi midha yookaan balase, woyine yookaan roomaane hexxebaake konne rakkichcha booncho'n no'oo mayee iyyedaggine? Ha'watee midde wodi'i gophemaa!»<verse eid="NUM 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Muusenna Aarooni ardi giddii'n ke'ne'e afenshati duunkaanixxe wuddumebaa marreexxi albik gonbissemme; Duuchchi Woddike Goottik ulfinninna insa'ne'n leelle.<verse eid="NUM 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'n, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />«Siqqichcho aadhi, dayyo atike Aarooninni arda bukki asse; insa'ne uunda'naa'a eettene rassa'n haasso'we; iitti rassanna wode'e fulchitaan; ati ardakee rassatenaa'n wode'e fulchitee'na'a insa'nenna insa'nek hor ha'waan.»<verse eid="NUM 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Tennexxee Muuse ajajemeemmashanni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edii'n eettenee siqqichcho aadhe.<verse eid="NUM 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Isinna Aarooni arda, eettene rassa edo bukki assine; Muusenna arda, «Koo ha'noo jallichcha mannaa caaqasse; no'o ha'noo'a tenne rassanaa'n wode'e fulchiyya hassissama'a?» Hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muuse anga qophphi asseexxi siqqichchoti rassa lamele gane; wodi'ikinna rassatenaa'n phu'isee'naa'a, ardi hore ifike duuchchinni ha'we.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Yaane kinn Magen Muusenna Aaroonii'i, «Isira'eelike aridi edo anee'e woyyuma anxee'e ulfesatee ane'n amana gophineemmaxxee, tenne tuuta insa'ne'a uwwanneke boga'n iyyemartine geessissinabaan» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Isira'eeliki manni Magenik welti lolemeebi, isinna woyyumma ifixxa insa'nexxe oddo'n leellisheeb konne Meribake wodeemman.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eeli Me'atbaashsha Edomi Ora Sa'a Kute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Muusse Eedoomike Moyanjiba'a Qaadesii'ni erganjuwwa hiyyeexxi ergee qici: «Dayyi atiki Isira'eeli, hiyya'nee qici: no'o'n gelteexxa rakko duuchcha laqqeetten; <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Edik no'ok annuwwi adadde Gbitse'a me'een; no'onna ookko heddo wogga turrenne; Gibtsek manninna no'oonna annuwwa no'oka jaba qicinni rakkise. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />No'onna no'oo gargaaraashsha Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a raarree'na'a, isi raare no'oxxa laqe'e iimika erganjo ergeexxi Gibtsee'n no'oo fulche.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 20:16">«Ta'a no'o he'nennebi, kaba atike bogixxe galchake kasa'n hedheeke Qaadesike qachcha'nten. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Tennexxee atike bogi giddii'n sa'nonna'aa maganneten eeti no'aa uwwi; hoone fichchi giddi'aanna yookaan woyinetike hiddichchi giddi'a gorrabe'non; heene baleka wode'enna ha'winabe'non; moyanjiinka lumoka ora abixxine me'a malee'e galcha atixxe giddii'n me'ine sa'nano qico midda bita'aa gorrabe'non.»<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Yaane kinni Eedoomito, «Kabaa'n saxxinaba'a; sa'nee me'innannon hitina'neexxe kaddoole googessine, fullee'e ha'noo wolantichchik birranno» hite.<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Isira'eelik aridinna, «No'o'o badaasuma ora abixxine me'innannon, akimagaada no'o yookaan hori no'ok ha'nooka hoonee wode'enna ha'woole, hira ha'noo'a uunnannon; no'o lekka callinni giddii'n sa'nee me'a malee'e weli mittichchi hansannolchi hedhebaan» hiyyeexxi hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Eedoomito langaxxa, «Kabaa'n saxxinaba'a!» Hiyyaaka hiissichcho insa'ne'n hiisite haasote.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 20:20">Ookkoneechchi uduma Edoomi heddo jajjabba loliinka manna adhdheexxi insa'nee lolo'a fule. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Eedoomik manni ifi bogi giddii'n sa'ne me'inabaashsha hoyyemmaxxe tenne buutto'a Isira'eelik manni insa'nebaa'n ille iima hige.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aaroonixxa Reya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Isira'eelixxi duuchchiinxi tuuta Qaadesii'n kexxeexxi Horexxe Koobaba dagge gelte. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottinna Eedoomixxe gabala bira hexxeexxe Horexxe Kooba'n Muusenna Aaroonii'i hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />«Arooni Isira'eelike manni'a uwwannoke boga'n e'yabaan; ha'no lamiing Meriibake wode'n ajaja anke'n jallittineemmaxxee Aarooni reyaan. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Aarooninna belto isika Ali'aazaarii'i aaxxetexxi Horexxa Kooba qabati. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Aarooni reyemake ifike hadibaa bukki hiyyaammaxxee'n isixxe qeesummaxxa seemma isii'n fulchiteetexxi Ali'aazaar belto isike'n oddeessi; Aarooninna ookko reyaan.»<verse eid="NUM 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Muuse Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti isoo'o ajajemmashshanni asse; duuchchiinxi tuuta insa'ne'e uda'naa Horexxe Kooba qabante. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Muusenna Aaroonixxa seemma fulcheexxi isika belto Ali'aazaari'n oddeesse; Aarooninna ookkonni koobatixxe xungo hana reye; ookkoneechchi uduma Muusenna Ali'azaari kobatinaa'n dirrine. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Duuchchiinxi tuuta Aarooni reyeexxa egendeexxi Isira'eelik manni duuchchi sase tomme barra isi'a oodhe.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s1">Moyanji Araadi Injifatemeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Araadik moyanji, Negeebi hedhammak Kenaanichchi, Isira'eelik manni Ataarimika ora daga'neexxa laqee wodda, insa'ne lole miidheexxi heenoka mannanna booji'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:40">Lak. 33:40</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Eettene yanna Isira'eelik manni, «Konne arda no'oxxe anga'n sa'issite uuttottole, qachchuwwaka insa'neka bakka balleessinnannon» hiyya'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a wereege. <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Duuchchi woddiki Goottinna Isira'eelixxa kadha laqeexxi Kenaanika manna anga insa'neexxe'n sa'isse uwwe; Isira'eelik manninna insa'neenna qachchuwwa insa'neeka bakka balleesse. Tennexxee ookkone bonchiki summi Horimaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hormaa hiyyaa Ibrititotike laagadinni bakka balleessan hiyyaten</char></note> hiyyeme.<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sageettoti Sibiljika Bofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Isira'eelik manni Eedomii'i doweexxi me'a haseemmaxxee'e Horexxe Koobaa'n ke'eexxi Eritiriinxe Abbaayyaba'a me'ammaka ora me'e; kaddo malee ornge'n ardiinxi ossa mudde.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:1">Lew. 2:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Ardikinna Duuchchi woddika Goottanna Muuse'e aallata'n, «Qiilla gammoojje'n rennonna'a mayee no'oo Gibtsee'n fulchitine? Ha'watee wodi'i hedheba'a! Indaachi hedheba'a! Tinni woyi fuldabaaxxi ita no'oo diqqachchiisseen!» Hiyye haaso'e. <verse eid="NUM 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Eettenee yanna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'latika bofa ardake'n wocci asse'naa arda idde; heddi Isira'eelik manninna reye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:9">1 Qor. 10:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Ardikinna Muusebaa dageexxi, «No'o Duuchchi Woddika Goottanna atee'e aallante haasonnennaxxee'e balleessineennen; bofuwwi no'onaa'n bayyato'a Duuchchi Woddika Gootta no'aa soodati» hiyye; Muusenna ardakee'e soodate. <verse eid="NUM 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse, «Bofa giisiteetexxi haqichchoke'n fannis; iddemeek duuchchinna isiba'a uudeexxi fayyaani» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Tennexxee Muuse sageettoti sibiljika bofa giisseexxi haqichchoke'n fannise; ookkoneechchi uduma bofi iddeek huuni manjinna sageettoti siblijke bofibaa uudeexxa yanna fayya'nemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">2 Moy. 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yoh. 3:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moo'abiba'a Assemeeka Me'injo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Isira'eelik manni me'e mareexxi Obootimi kaanbe abixxe. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Obootimii'ni ke'neexxi Mo'aabike arsho fuldama darreke kallachcha'n hexxeexxe qiilla gammoojje giddo Iyye'abaaremi'n kaanbe abixxine. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Ookko'ninna me'ineexxi Zaareddixxe Dhooqa'n kaanbe abixxine. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Ookko'ninna me'ineexxi Amoorke mannik bogixxe gabala qico'n gelteexxe qilla gammoojje'n hedheeke Arinoonike wodi'i bira kaanbe abixxine; Arinoonik wodi'i Mo'aabitonna Amoorike ardike bogixxe oddo'n hedheeke Mo'aabixxe gabalan. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Tennexxeetemman Duuchchi Woddike Goottike loliinke maxaafa'n:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:14">«Suufa giddixxi Waaheebi'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:14">Arinoonike lagixxe dhooqa'n; <verse eid="NUM 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />Eeri'i marte gelteexxe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:15">Mo'aabixxe gabalaba hexxeexxe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:15">dhooqa giddixxe koobuwwa» hiyyendeexxi borreessendemmashshaten.<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Ookkoo'n ke'neexxi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e, «Arda bukki assi wode'e insa'ne'a uwwannon» hiyyeemmaxxee'e Bi'eer hiyyendaaxxe wode'iinxe balebaa me'ine.<verse eid="NUM 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelik manni konneechchi butta hexxeexxa faaro hiyya'n faarsee qici;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">«Tee muumee wode'e pu'isi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:17">ha'nonna isi'a faarse.<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Eettenee ja'laabuwwi qotemmxxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">ardink akeekisanjuwwi ifixxe bokkuwwanninna ifike bageduwwinni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">umeemmaxxa wodi'iinxa bale faarsine.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NUM 21:18">Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'ne qiilla gammoojjenaa'n Mateena me'ine. <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />Mateena'a Nehali'eeli'a, Nehali'eelinaa'ninna Baamoti'a, <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />Baamotinaa'ninna Pisikaxxe Kooba hanii'n qilla gammoojje adadde leellitaaxxe Mo'aabixxe dhooqaba'a me'ine.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seewoonixxanna Aagixxa Injifatema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">Lan. 2:26—3:11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Isira'eelik manni Amoorake moyanjo Sewooniba'aa hiyya'ne manna erge qici,<verse eid="NUM 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />«Boga atik giddii'n sa'nennexxi me'inonnaa no'a eetii uwwi; hoone fichchi giddi'aanna kaddo'o hoone woyinetike hiddichchiba'a e'ynabe'non; yookaan hoone baletike wodiinaa'ninna ha'winabe'non; galcha atixxi giddii'n fullanno qico'n moyanjiinka lumoka oranaa'n elqe kayya gorrabe'non.»<verse eid="NUM 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Sewooni kinni Isira'eeli galcha ifixxi giddii'n saxxe'e me'iteaashsha eeti'i uwwebaan; sannachcha ifika duuchcha bukki assedheexxi Isira'eeli'i lolo'a qiilla gammoojje giddi'aa mare; Yahatse geyeeshshanni Isira'eelinni lola gence hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Isira'eeli iso'n midditte adhdhiteexxi Arinoonik wode'inaa'ni saffe'e middi darree'ni Amoonitotik gabalaanaa'ni Yaaboqi galaani qio'n hedheeka isika boga abixite; kaddo malee'e Amoonike mannixxi gabala jaba qicinni heqqendeexxe kaddeemmaxxe'e insa'ni Yabooqika galaana edi'a sa'nebaan. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Isira'eeli Haseebonen qarqarake'n hedheeka qachchuwwinninn Amoorake mannika qachchuwwa duuchcha mitteba abideexxi ookkonni offo'le. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Haseeboni edi woddik Mo'aabike moyanjo lole injifateexxi Arinooni qico'n hedheeka isika boga isinaa'n adhdhe'emake, Amoorake mannike moyanjo Sewoonike qachchamman.<verse eid="NUM 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Tennexxeenna genceti meellaammaki manni hiyyeemma qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">«Haseeboni'a amme, higgeeni qamachenduu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:27">Sewoonik qachchinna haaroba ijaaremuun.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />«Giira Haseebonii'n fulde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">buubenikinna Sewooni qachchinaa'n bubeexxi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">Eerite hiyyemaaka Mo'aabika qachcha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">Arinoonixxe gooruwwa'n hedhamakaranna itte.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Koo Mo'aabii ati'a aane'e!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Koo Kemooshike arda ha'no'a mudanden!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">Isi labbaxxa ifixxa oose baajjotee'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">meyyaaxxa ifixxa oose booji'otee'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Amooraka moyanjo Sewooni'n sa'issee uwwe'een.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:45-46">Erm. 48:45-46</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />«No'o kinni insa'nee muxxuqqi assine'eennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">Haseeboni Dibooni qico'n kutti hite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:30">Noofam qico'ni hedheekaara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">Mediibaa qico'ni ba'late hedheekaara he'neeshanni alagantenne.» <verse eid="NUM 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Tennexxee Isira'eeli Amooritotike boga'n offo'le.<verse eid="NUM 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Muuse dooyyaaka manna Iyyazeeri ergeechchi uduma Isira'eelik ardi qachchakanna qarqarake'n hedheeka shiixxaramma qachchuwwa abideexxi ookko hedhammaka Amooraka manna shorre. <verse eid="NUM 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelik ardi higeexxi Baasaani'a me'ammaka ora'n fule me'e; Baasaanik moyanji Ooginna isik sannachchi duuchchi Edire'i insa'nee lollo'a fulle.<verse eid="NUM 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootinna Muuse'n, «Isoo'o, isika duuchchiinga sannachcha iske boginninni welt anga atixxe'n sa'issee uwweenneni mee sodaati; Haseeboni hedha'n galchaammaka Amooraka moyanjo Sewooni'n assennexxa duuchcha iso'ninna assannon» hiiyye.<verse eid="NUM 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Tennexxee Isira'eelik manni Ooggii'i isixxa oosenna isike duuchchiinge sannachchinninni mittikinna gatebaang duuchchiinga bire; boga insa'neekanna dhaale.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s1">Baalaaqi Balaami'i Ye'ise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Ookkonechchi uduma Isira'eeli manni Mo'aabike diidiba'a me'eexxi Yordaanoosi qarqara Iyyaariko widdi darre offo'le. <verse eid="NUM 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Eettene yanna Sofoorik belti Baalaqi Isira'eeli Amoorake manna maa asseexxa afe. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Mo'aabinna ardiinxe birra sa'nenaa'n kexxeexxa culphise; eeti, Moa'aabik ardi Isira'eelike ardinaa'n kexxeexxa sodaate corco hiyye'eman. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Mo'aabik ardinna Midiyaamike akeekinsanjuwwa'n, «Qotiyyo kalote'n hedhemmaka arsichcho ca'a assite'e itte birtammashsha kunni sannachchi qarqara no'oke'n hedheechcho duuchcha ca'a asse biraaken» hiyye. Tennexxee eettenee yanna Mo'aabike moyanjo kadeemmak Soffork belti Baalaqi, <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />galaani qaraqara hedhemmake ilememmake boga'n Faatur hiyyemaake qachchi giddo hedhammaka Bii'oorka belto Bele'aami'i ye'no'a erganjuwwa erge; hiyyeenna ergee qici:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 22:5">«Kunse laakkosi hara birra sa'eedheek manni Gibtsee'n dageexxi loola anke'n offo'leedheen. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Konnee arda ifinaa'n dande'annoke kadagopheemmaxxee ta'a daggettexxi insa'nee ani'a badi; akimagaada ookoneechchi uduma insa'ne'e injifatennexxi boga ankenaa'n fulcheedhannoxxe hexxaan; ati eebbissettek eebbisemaaxxa baddettekinna badinemaaxxa ege'neennen.»<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Tennexxee Mo'aabikinna Midiyaamik akeekisanjuwwi morotee'e uunaaka maalaqa abixxineexxi Bele'aamibaa me'ine; Bele'aamibanna genneexxi Baalaqixxa erganna iso'n kulle. <verse eid="NUM 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Bele'aaminna insa'ne'n, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ani'a uwwaaka hissichcho ha'no'a uwwaannaxxee'e tennee hashsha kabanni galle» hiyye. Tennexxee Mo'aabike akeekisanjuwwi isineenba turre. <verse eid="NUM 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Magenikinna Bele'aamibaa dageexxi, «Kunni atiba hedheek manni ayyeera?» Hiyye iso qore. <verse eid="NUM 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Bele'aaminna Magenoke'n hiyyee hiissee qic: «Mo'aabik moyanjo Sofoorik belti Baalaqi eraga aniba ergeeke mannani; hiyyeexxi ergee qiccinna, <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />‹Gibtsee'n daggeek ardi bogake'n elleqqi hiyyeedheen; tennexxee'e daggettexxi ani'a insa'nee badi; akimagaada ookkoneechchi uduma insa'nee lole shorrannoxxe hexxeen.› »<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Magenkinninna Bele'aamii'i, «Konne manninni welti me'itoxxe'e; ardi eebisemeek kadeemmnaxxe'e baddoxxe'e» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Langa baro gorsa Bele'aami ke'eexxi Baalaaqike akeekisanjuwwa, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nonn welti me'abe'noshsha ane'e hoyyeemmaxxe boga ha'nokiba'a illeema higgine me'e» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Tennexxe Mo'aabike akeekisanjuwwi Baalaaqibaa illee iima hingeexxi iso'n, «Bele'aami no'onni daga gibeen» hine kulle.<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Oookkonechchi uduma Baalaqi erganjuwwa eddike laakkosik caalaakanna ulfaate'eke wele ja'laabuwwa erge. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Insa'nenna Bele'aami'n dange hinee qic:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 22:16">«Sofoorik belti Baalaaqi hiyye no'o'o ergeeqic: aniba daggabexxoshsha ate'e hoyyaachchi mittichchinna hedhoqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />Galata ati'a shankaffi asse hissannoni, hitattoxxa duuchchanna assannon; tennexxe daggettexxi konne arda ani'a badi.»<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Yaane kinn Bele'aami insa'ne'n hisse haaso'e hiyyeeqic, «Wele waalin Baalaaqi worqetinna birretik sibil wo'meedheeka ifika mootummatika mine ani'a uwwa'noolenna midde Duuchchi Woddike Gootta anke Magenika ajaja sa'ennexxi tenne caldaaxxa yookaan tennenaa'n heeno'mitaaxxa heene'e yaanenna aasa dande'abe'no. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Ta'atenna kaddoole weli assemmashshanni ha'nonna tenne hashsha kabanni galdinee'na'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'n lebeexxi maa haaso'aaxxa laqo.»<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Eeteneenni hashsha Mageni Bele'aamibaa dageexxi, «Kuuni manni dageechchi insa'nen welti me'itotta'ate kaddemmaxxe'e welti me'i; yaane kinni ani ate'n kulannoxxa calla assi.» <verse eid="NUM 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Tennexxee gorsa bariisa Bele'aaminna ke'eexxi harrichcho koodhdheexxi Mo'aabike ja'laabuwwinni welti me'e. <verse eid="NUM 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Kaddomalee Ba'aal me'e wodda Mageni yo'oshsha mufateemmaxxe'e Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji isi'a diineexxi me'a'neeke ora'n uurre; Baalaa'aminna harrichchote'n ofo'leke'eman; lame isixxa garboolenna isinni welti hexxemman. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Harrichchottinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji wolaantichcho golshe anga abixxeexxi orake'n uure'eexxa affeexxi orakenaa'n fichchi giddi'a gorte; Bele'aaminna orake'n illee iima higgaashsha harrichcho gane. <verse eid="NUM 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Goottike iimik erganji lamii darree'n woyinetike hiddichchike kinjiniike dalla'ixxe oddonaa'n sa'neeke cu'make ora'n uurre. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Harrichchotinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika iimika erganjo affeexxi kinjiinke dalla'iba'a shikki hiteexxi Bele'aamixxa lekka dalla'ake'n ande; tennexxe ise'e higgeenna gane. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji edi'a sa'aaxxi middibitta'a hingaabi hedheebaaxxe cu'maxxe bakka'n uurre. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Harrichchotinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika iimika erganjo affeexxi Bele'aami hundii'n guguruffi hitte ciisse; Bele'aaminna mufateemmaxxe'e ise siqqichoti gane. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti eetene harrichchotika afo'o bannee'naa Bele'aami'i, «Sasele anee'e gandetek atee maasannalete?» Hite.<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Bele'aaminna harrichchote'n, «Ane'ni gacifattettexxeetentaa'a; wolaantichcho anga afeennele silaan ta'anni ate'e shiye'ennan» ise hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Eetti harrichchotinna Bele'aami'i, «Eddo, heddo yannanaa'n telchiqico'n ane'n ofolda'n daggettexxe atixxe harrichchobaasi ani? Iitta hedheeka adaba ane'n uudde egendette?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">Isinna «Waawwo!» Hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Bele'aamixxa ille baqqi asse; isinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji wolaantichcha goshsheeka anga abixxeexxi orake'n uurreenaa'a afe; Bele'aaminna albik butta gonbiseme.<verse eid="NUM 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimiki erganjinna iso'o, «Harrichcho sasele mayeete gandettek? Ani dagennexxi ora atika cufennki ati ba'netike ora'ni me'itabexxoshsha hoyyonna'a hiyyeeten. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Harrichcho ane'e affeexxi sasele gamake'n goragophphe'ee'ya, eeti ta'iqico ate'e shiyeennan salaan, harrichcho kinni lubbondinni waalaannan» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Bele'aaminna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika iimika erganjo, «Cubbo hujeennen; ane'e diindota'a orake'n uurriteettexxa ege'nebe'non; ta'atenna kaddoole gammada gophphaattole illeema higannon» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganjinna Bele'aami'i, «Mannik welti me'a me'i yaane kinni ani ate'n haaso'anoxxa calla haaso'i» hiyye; tennexxe'e Bala'aami ja'laabuwwa Balaaqikenni welti me'e.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Baala'aaqii daga'n ora hedheexxa Bele'aami laqeexxi, iso'o qophedho'a galchammake bogixxe gabala'n hedheeke Arimoonike galaani qarqara'n hedheeke Mo'aabike qachchiba mare. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Baalaqi Bele'aami'i, «Rakke daggattoshshatebaa ate'n ergennek? Mayee daga gophphete? Dhugandinni galata ati'a hissa dande'abe'noke kadee'naate?» Hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Bele'aaminna, «Kunse, dage'ennen; anita heenee yaane dande'e haaso'anno? Ani haaso'iyyo hasissaaxxi Mageni haaso'onna'a afo'o ane'n uggeexxe callan» hiyye hisse haaso'e.<verse eid="NUM 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Bele'aami Baalaqinni welti Qiriyaati Hatsooti me'e. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Baalaqinna lalokanna gedhebo tolcheexxi ookkone maalakenaa'n Bele'aami'anna isin welti hedhemmake ja'laabuwwi'a erge. <verse eid="NUM 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Langa baro gorsa Baalaqi Bala'aami'i alalle Bamitiba'oolni, Ba'aaliba'a fulche; Bala'aaminna ookko hedheexxi Isira'eelixxe kaanbeke kasa'n hedheeka arda afe.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="s1">Sirettixxa Bala'aamika Wabeekkumatika Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Bala'aminna Baalaqi'i, «Konne booncho'ni torbaane tolchimalchuwwa ani'a ijaar; ittanni torbaane koromoolenna torbaane gedhebiinxa korbeeyye ani'a qixxeesse» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Baalaqinna Bala'aami hiyyemmashshanni asse; lamiing mitte mitte tolchimalcho'ni mitte mitte koremenna mitte gedhebiinka korbeesa shiqinshe.<verse eid="NUM 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Ookkonechchi uduma Bala'aami Baalaqi'i, «Ani ooko'a me'anno wodda ati kabanni atike cincatike tolchi bira hekki hiyyi; akimagaada Duuchchi Woddik Gootti aninni afemo'a dagaaxxe hexxeen; ane'n leellishaaxxa ate'n kulannon» hiyye. Ookkonechchi uduma Baalaqi mitte qephphichcha diidiba'a me'e.<verse eid="NUM 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Magenikinna isinni afemena'a Bele'aami, «Kunse ani torbaane tolchimalchuwwa jaareennen; mitte mittenge'ni mitte mitte korommenna mitte mitte gedhebiinka korbeessa tolcheennen» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Bele'aamike afo'on haaso'aaxxa erga uggee'na'a «Baalaqibaa illee iima higgettexxi tenne erga iso'n kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Isinna illeema higeexxi me'e wodda Baalaqi duuchiinge Mo'aabike akeekisanjuwwinni welti ifike cincatike tolchi bira uurree'na'a afe. <verse eid="NUM 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Belaami raaga hiyya'n haaso'ee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">«Baalaqi anee Aaraamii'ni aadhe dage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">Mo'aabik moyanji borotixxe koobuwwabaa'n.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">‹Amoo Ya'iqoobi'i ani'a badi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">daggettexxi Isira'eeli'i ani'a duuki› hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Mageni badinebaaka arda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">ani hitta badano?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti duukebaaka manna?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">Ani hitta duukanno?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Rassatixxe koobuwwaxxe xungoo'ni hedhenexxi Ani insa'ne'e uuda'ennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">qephphichchuwwake'n hedhennexxi insa'nee afa'ennen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">Anii qofinn fule hedhaanneka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">ifinna wele gosa gosake arda asse uudabaaka arda uuda'ennen.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Bukkotishsha bira saxxeexxa Ya'iqoobixxa horte ayyete laako'e dande'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">sholigaxxa anga Isira'eelika arda ayyete laakko'e dande'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Qulichchiinxa reyo ani reyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">muuxami anikinna isike muuxamishsha kaduun!» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Baalaaqinna Bele'aami'i, «Maye ita ane'ni assiteette? Naapha anka ani'a badindota'a ate'e iyyedagennen; Ati kinni insa'ne'e eebbissette malee'e mittelchonna assitebexxon!» Hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Isinna hiisseexxi, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti afo'o anke'n uggeexxa haaso'abe'noo?» Hiyye ise haaso'e.<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Langaka Bala'aamikka Wabeekumati Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Ookkonechi udumi'a Baalaqi Bele'aami'i hiyyee qic: «Insa'ne'e uuda dandeettatoke wele boonchiba'a marro; okkoo'n insa'ne duuchinge kandebaak insa'ne'e heenoka calla uuddatton. Ookonna hexxe'e insa'ne'e ani'a badin» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Tennexxee Feesigaxxe koobaxxe xungo'ni hedheeke Tseefemi hiyyemaake diida'n iyyemare: ooko'ninna torbaane tolchimalchuwwa jaareexxi mitte mittenge'ni mitte mitte koremmanna mitte mitte gedhebiinka korbeessa tolche.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Bala'aaminna Baalaqi'i, «Ani isinni afematee'e ooko'a maranno wodda, ati konne tolchimalchii bira hekki hiyyi» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Bele'aaminni afeme; haaso'aaxxa erga afo'o isike'n uggeexxi hiyyeqic, «Baalaqiba'a illeema higgetexxi tenne erga kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Isinna illeema higeexxi me'a wodda Baalaqi Mo'aabike duuchchinge akeekisanjuwwinn welti ifike tolchimalcho bira uurreena'a afe; Baaqinna Belaami'i, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti maa hiyye?» Hiyye qore.<verse eid="NUM 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Ookkonechchi uduma isi wabeekkumatixxa erga hiyya'n safeqic:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">«Koo Baalaqi, ke'i hiyyaannexxa caqasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:18">koo Seeferike belto laqi,<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Mageni manjiishsha sobabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">yaada ifikanna manjiishsha jijjiirabaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Hiyyeexxa assabaake?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">Addachiiseexxa muuxabaake?<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Eebisona'a ajajeme'ennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">Isi eebise'en; ani isixxa eeba jijjiira dande'abe'no.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />«Ya'iqoobi'n fuggoxxa daggaaxxa afebe'no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">Isira'eeli'ninna geltaaxxa bakke uudebe'no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni isinni welti hedheen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">Mageni moyanjoke kadeexxanna ililisa'ni haassonnaan.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Mageni Gibtsee'n insa'ne'e fulcheen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:22">isinna insa'ne'a gafarisiinxe hunnashshaten.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Ya'iqoobi miitaaxxi gojo hexxebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">Isira'eeli'ninna xano hujjabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">Ya'iqoobi'aana Isira'eeli'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">‹Mageni asseexxa yaane uuddee!› Hiyyemman.<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Isira'eelik ardi meyyake neenqishsha qophphi hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">Labbake neenqishanna ke'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">adamemmaka ninnife ite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">mundetana'a ha'webaak hafuura adhdhammabaakishshaten.»<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Eetteene yanna'ni Baalaqi Bele'aami'i, «Yoona insa'nee'e badindagophphaattechchinni insa'ne'e eebbissoxxe'e!» Hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Bala'aami Baalaqi'i, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'n hiyyeexxa duuchcha ani assiyyo hasissaaxxa ate'ni kuleennabaa?» Hiyye iso'n hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sakkaka Bala'aamika Wabeekkumika Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Ookonechchi uduma Baalaqi Bala'aami'i, «Amo wele boonchiba'a atee'e iyyemaro; akimagaada ookko hexxettexxi insa'ne'e ani'a yowwitottaa'a mise badindota'a ati'a eeti'i uwwaaxxe hexxeen» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Baalaqinna Bala'aami'i qiilla gammooje butti'a leellitaaxxe Fegoorixxe koobbaxxe xungo'n iima iyemare.<verse eid="NUM 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Bele'aaminna iso'o, «Torbaane tolchimalchuwwa ani'a kaba jaar; torbaane kormoolenna torbaane gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenn ani'a qixxeessi» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Baalaqinna Bala'aami iso'ni kulemmashanni, mitti mittinge tolchimalchi hana mitte mitte kormanna mitte mitte gedhebiinka korbeessa tolche.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Eettenee yanna Bele'aami Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeli'i eebisa eeya'neexxa afe wodda, wele woddishsha gojjo hasito me'ebaan. Yaane kinni alba qiilla gammoojjeba'a wirri hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Bele'aaminna tammi asse uudaa wodda Isira'eelik ardi gosa gosatike mini hadinni kaambe giddo afoldeexxa uuda wodda Mageniink Hafuur iso'n dage. <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />Isinna wabeekkumatika haaso'e safe hiyyee haaso'eqic:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">«Ille isixxi ookkone banendeeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:3">Bele'aami'i Bi'oorke beltika Wabeekkumatik haaso'a:<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />Ookkone Magenika haao'a laqaake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">isi edo ibeenba'a ille isixxi banendeeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">Duuchiinxa dandea'aake Magenixxa waleella uudaak hiyya'neeqic:<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />«Koo Ya'iqoobi atik duunkaanuwwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:5">tee Isira'eel ati galdaatek boonchuwwi hittatta ela'neeke!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />«Insa'ne dhooquwwatishsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">galaani qarqara hedheeke hiddichchuwwinke boonchuwwisha barqaanqe'en;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kaasemmake heexotike haqichchuwwisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">wodin qarqara lateeke birbirsuwwishaten.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Insa'neke waabuwwanaa'n wodi'i phu'isaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">insa'nexxi mayenna geyaaka wode'e alfitaan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 24:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">«Insa'nek moyanjinna Agaagii'i caalaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">mootumma insa'nexxinna lummexxaan.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />«Mageni insa'nee Gibtsee'n fulcheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">jabeenni insa'neekinn gafarisiinxe hunnashaten.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">Insa'nenna ifike naapha kadeeka gosa gosaka arduwwa ninniffaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">miqe ins'neexxanna bulleessinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">ifike gabetike mogidinni insa'ne ontaan.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />Kunni ardi adamatee qixxeeffateeke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">labbake neenqishshanna meyyake neeqishsha rinphe'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">ayyete mare iso'o dammassa dande'aak?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 24:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">«Atee'e eebisaak ebbisemowwaal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">ate'e badinaakinna badinemeeke kadowwaal» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Dada. 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:9">49:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Ookkonechchi uduma Baalaqi Bala'aami'n yo'oshsha mufate angatanna cala'n, «Naaphuwwa anka ani'a badindota'a ye'ennen; ati kinni sasiinxa yanna isa'ne'e eebbissetten. <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Yoona rakke mine atikibaa me'i; silaati ani hira ati uwwona'a hiyyeennan; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni hirra alfitabexxoshsha ate'e hoyyeen.» <verse eid="NUM 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Bele'aami Baalaqi'ni hiyyee hiisse haaso'e qic: «Anibaa ergitetteke manna'n <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />‹Welechcho waalini Baalaqi worqetinna birretik sibilji wo'me'eeka ifika mootommatika mine ani'a uwwe'elenna midde Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyaaxxa haaso'ati gadhidarre Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajaji gadhidarre ani anke yaadinni eloyo'oxxa assa dande'abe'non hiyyennabaa?› <verse eid="NUM 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />Yoonna arda ankeba'a illeema higannon; yaane kinni dagaake baruwwa'n kuni Isira'elik ardi atike arda'n assaaxxa ate'n kulonna'a amo» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sholgaka Bala'aamika Wabeekkumatika Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Ookkonechchi uduma isi wabeekkuama hiyye safe haaso'aa qic:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">«Bele'aami'i Bi'oorike beltik wabeekkumatik haaso'i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:15">ookkone ille isixxi banendeeke manjichchika haaso'a.<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />Ookkone Magenika hiyyichcho laqaaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">Lumooke Mageninaa'n ege'na'a alfeeke</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">Duuchinxa dande'eeke Mageninaa'n waleella leelitaake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">isi edo ibeenba'a ille isixxi bandeeke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">Duuchinxa dandea'aake Magenixxa leella uudaak hiyya'neeqic,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">ibeeba'a hedhe'na'a ille isixxi banendeeke manjika wabeekkumatika haaso'a:<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />«Iso'o afaanne kaddo male ta'atebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">iso'o uudaanne kaddo malee shiqotebaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Urjetishsha wa'a hiyyeek moyanji Ya'iqoobixxe gosanaa'n afemaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">mootummatixxi bokko Isira'eeli giddi'ni kexxan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Mo'aabixxa xiyyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Seetixxe labbaxxe ooseka umiika qonjonna bullessaan.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Eedoomii'i injifatemaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">naaphi isik Seeyirinna kutti hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">Isira'eeli kinni injifata'ne me'aan.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Galchaak Ya'iqoobinaa'n afemaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:19">qachchi giddo gatemakaranna kutti assaan» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muxamiika Balaamika Wabeekkumika Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Ookkonechchi uduma Balaami Amaalaqi uudeexxi wabeekkuma haaso'a hiyyeeqic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">«Amaaleeqi gosa gosak ardi'a taakkakemman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">udumi uduma kinni ba'aan» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Ookkonechchi uduma Qenaatito uudeexxi wabeekkuma hiyye haaso'eqic:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">«Galdumi atik boonchi jabaate'eken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:21">qoorch atikinna kinjiinxe wele'o giddon.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />Kadoolenna ha'no Qenaatito,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">Asoori boojite adhdhitaa wodda kutti assendinaan» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Ookonchi udumi'a isi lebe'e wabeekkuma hiyye haaso'eqic:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:23">«Anee! Mageno tenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:23">assoole aate gate?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Lumolla hoboluwwa Kitimike kasanaa'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">daggaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:24">Asooriinna Eboori'i abiddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">insa'nenna kutti assemmaan» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Bele'aami ke'e illee iima ifike minibaa hige: Baalaqinna ora ifinga me'e.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s1">Mo'aabik Manni Isira'eeli'i Dedhiseexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Isira'eelik ardi Siixiimi ofo'le tureexxa yanna labballi Mo'aabike mannixxe melaallenni yabaabule. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Itti melaallenna ifike magenuwwika tolcha itaashshsha arda ye'e; ardikinna tolcha ite; insa'eneeke magenuwwi'anna sagade. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Konne qicinni Isira'eelito Peeritsoore Ba'aalixxa misile magenoonfateemmaxxe'e Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne'n yo'oshsha mufate. <verse eid="NUM 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Tennexxe'e Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e, «Bubba'neexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi mufe Isira'eelinaa'n illeema higgo'a Isira'eelika ja'laabuwwa duuchcha barra arshote'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fannis» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Tennexxe'e Muusenna Isira'eelixxa hayyoole, «Mitti mitti ha'noogi gosa gosake mini minishshanni Ba'aali hinaake Peeritsoorixxe misile'ni magenoonfateeka manjo duuchcha aha'no shiwwe» hiyyeexxi ajaja sa'isseen. <verse eid="NUM 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Ookkonechchi uduma Muusenna Isira'eelixxi tuuta duuchchi afenshatike duunkaanixxe huddumme'n oo'na'neeke'n mitti Isira'eelik manji insa'ne'en uunda'naanni mitte meyyaxxa Midiyaamichcho ifike mini hadiba'a aadhe dage. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Qeesichcho Aaroonika belto, Ali'aazaarik belti Finihaasi, tenne uudeexxinna, tuuta waale fule bagedo qophphpi asse aadhiyyoti, <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />ookkonee Isira'eelichcho hordofa'n duunkaani giddo e'ye'e bagedo darbeexxi, isoonna eettenee manjichcho lamiinga mitteba ote golobe shiyye; ookkonechchi uduma Isira'eeli'n dagge'eemmaxxi bala uurritte. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Kaddo male kinni eettene balanni reyeeke mannik laakkossi lamme tommenna shoole kumamman.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse'e, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />«Qeesichcho Aaroonika belto, Ali'aazaarik belti Finihaasi, ani ulfinna anke'e ha'no giddo hinaafannashsha hinaafeexxi, muffe anxa Isira'eelike ardinaa'n illeema hisse'een; tennexxe'e aninna insa'ne'e xo'o asse balleessebe'non. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Tennexxe ani isi'a nage'iinxa kako aagaannexxa kuli. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Isi Mageno ifikike ulfinni'a hinaafeexxi Isira'eelike ardixxa cubbo biremmaxxe'e isi, isi udumanna horte isixxi, duuchchi woddixxe qeesummatixxe kako kaddaan.»<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Midiyaamichcho manjichchonni welti shiyememmak Isira'eelichchi, Seeluk belti Zimmiri Simoonitotike ja'laabamman; <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />isenni welti shiyendemaxxe Midiyaamichchoke manjichchoki summinna Koozibi hiyyema wodda anni isekinna Miidiyaamixxe gosake mini haduwwinaa'n mitte gosati mini'a ja'laaba kade'emmake Suurke beltomman.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Muuse'e, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />«Midiyaamika manna naaphiinsha uddineexxi insa'ne birre. <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />Tinninna, insa'ne'e ha'no'o Fegori dedhinse wodda ha'no'n assineexxe fuggo'anna, eetene buutoxxee'e daggeexxe balanni Fogori'n shiyendeexxe insa'neeke ja'laabixxa belto, dayyo insa'neexxe Koozibixxeeten» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s1">Langaka Ardiinka Laakosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Bala uurriteechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muusenna qeesichcho Aaroonika belto Ali'aazaarii'i hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />«Isira'eelixxe tuuta giddike mini mini hadinaa'n wogga lame tomme ookkonechchi iima hedheeka lola dande'aaka duuchcha laakko'we» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Tennexxee Muusenna qeesichchi Ali'aazaar Iyyaariko edidarre Yordaanoosi bira hedheeke Mo'aabike diida'ni ardake'n hine haasonneeqic, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />«Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e ajajemmashshanni woga lame tommenna ookkonechi iima hedheeka labballo laako'we.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:4">Gibtseke Boginaa'ni Fuleeki Isira'eeliki Ardi Konnechchinni Butti'a Hedheeken:<verse eid="NUM 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Isira'eelika angafa belto Roobelixxi horte, Heenooki darree'n, Henooitotixxi gosa; Felusi darree'ni, Felusitotixxi gosa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-46">Lak. 1:1-46</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />Hatsirooni darree'ni Hatsiroonitotixxi gosa; Keriimi darree'ni, Keriimitoxxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Tinni Roobelixxe gosa kaddaa wodda insa'ne giddii'n laako'emeek shoole tommenna sase kumanna torbaane dhibbanna sase tommemman.<verse eid="NUM 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Feluusik belti Eeli'aabite kadaa wodda, <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />Eeli'aabixxi labbaxxi oose Nemu'eeli, Daataaninna Aberoonitemman. Daataninna Aberooni kunni Muuse'ninna Aarooni'ni jalle'eke ardike ja'laabuwwa kandaa wodda, Qorenna hordofeeyye isixxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'ni jalline wodda insa'neenna tenne yaane he'nemman. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Lame dhibba onde tomme manna giira ittee wodda Qorexxi hordofeeye rertaa wodda konne manna kinni buttini haani hiyyeexxi isinni welti insa'ne'e liqiinse. Insa'ne'e arda xexxe'achchiisatee beesisa kande. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Kaddo malee Qorexxi oose rerteba'a. <verse eid="NUM 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Simoonixxe horte gosa gosan konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: Nemu'eeli darree'ni, Nemu'eelitotixxi gosa; Yaameni darree'ni, Yaamenawitotixxi gosa; Yaakiin darree'ni Yaakinitotixxi gosa; <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />Zaara darree'ni Zaarahitotixxi gosa; Sa'uuli darree'ni Sa'uulitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Tinni Simoonixxe gosuwwa kaddaa wodda, insa'ne giddii'n laako'emeek lame tommenna lame kumanna lame dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Gaadixxi horte, gosa gosa insa'neexxe'n konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: Tsifooni darree'ni Tsifoonitotixxi gosa; Haagi darree'n, Hagitotixxi gosa; Shuni darree'ni Shunitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />Esina darree'ni, Esinitotixxa gosa; Eeri darree'ni Eeritotixxa gosa; <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />Arodi darree'ni Aroditotixxi gosa; Ari'eeli darre'ni Ari'eelitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Tinni Gaadixxi gosa kaddaa wodda insa'ne giddii'n laako'emeekir shoole tomme kumanna onde dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Eerinna Awinaani Yihudaxxe labbaxxe oosemman; yaane kinni insa'ne Kenaaanike boga'ni renne'en. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Yihudaxxi horte gosa insa'neexxe gosanaa'ni konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: Seeloomi darree'ni Seelomitotixxi gosa; Faaresi darree'ni, Faareesitotixxi gosa, Zaara darree'ni Zaarihitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Faaresixxi horte gosa gosa insa'neexxenni konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: Esooir daree'n Eesiritotixxi gosa, Hamuli darre'ni, Hamulitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Tinni Yihudaxxe gosa kadda wodda insa'nenaa'n laako'emek torbaane tommenna jaane kumanna onde dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Yisakoorixxi horte gosa gosa insa'neexxenni konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: Toola darree'ni Toolitotixxi gosa, Faawa darree'ni Faawitotixxi gosa; <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />Yaasubi darrenaa'ni, Yaasubitotixxi gosa, Shimeeroni darrenaa'ni Shimeeritotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Tinni Yisakoorixxe gosa kadda wodda, insa'ne giddii'n laakko'eemeek jaane tommenna shoole kumanna sase dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Zabilonxi horte gosa gosa insa'nexxenni konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxe: Sereddi darre'ni Sereditotixxi gosa darree'ni Elooni Yahiyi'eelinna insa'nexxi hortemman. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Tinni Zabilonixxe gosa kaddaa wodda insa'ne giddii'n laakko'emeek jaane tomme kumanna onde dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Yooseefixxi horte Minaase darre'ninna Efireemi darre'ni gosa gosa insa'neexxi konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: <verse eid="NUM 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Minaasexxi horte Maakiri darree'ni Maakirtotixxi gosa; Maakirinna Gele'adike annamman; Gele'adi darree'ni Gele'aditotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Gele'adixxi horte konnechchi butta hexxeexxemman: Ii'eziir darree'ni I'eziiritotixxi gosa, Heleeqi darree'ni Keeligitotixxi gosa, <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />Asiri'eeli darree'ni, Asiri'eelitotixxi gosa, Seekemi darree'ni Seekemitotixxi gosa; <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />Shemiida darree'ni, Sheemiditotixxi gosa, Ooferi darree'ni Ooferitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Ooferik belti Seliphi'aadi labbaxxa oose afeemmabaan; isixxi oose dubara callamman; Insa'nenna Mahilehi, Nu'a, Hogila, Milikanna Tirtsa'a hiyyema'am. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Insa'ne Minaasexxe horte kaddaa wodda insa'ne giddii'n laakko'emek onde tommenna lame kumanna torbaane tomme dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Efireemixxi horte gosa gosa insa'nexxenni konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: Suutuli darree'ni Suutulitotixxi gosa, Bekkeeri darree'ni, Bekkeerixxi gosa, Tahana darree'ni Tahanitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Edeni darre'n Edeenitotixxi gosa; tinni Suutullaxxe hortemman.<verse eid="NUM 26:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Konneechchinni butti'a hexxeexxi Efireemixxe gosa kadda wodda insa'nenaa'n laako'emekir sase tommenna lame kumanna onde dhibbamman.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 26:37" />
  <para style="m" vid="NUM 26:37">Insa'nenna gosa gosa insa'nexxenni laakko'emeeke Yooseefixxe hortemman.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Biiniyaamixxi horte gosa gosa insa'nexxishshanni konneechinni butti'a hexxeexxen; Beela darree'ni, Beelitotixxi gosa, Ashibeel darree'ni, Aseebelitotixxi gosa, Ahiirami darree'ni Ahiiraamitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />Soofani darree'ni Soofanitotixxi gosa, Huufami darree'ni Huufamitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Beelaxxa horte Ardinna darre'ninna Ne'iman darree'n: ardi darree'n Arditotixxi gosa, Na'imani darree'n Na'imitotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Tinni Biiniyaammixxe gosa kaddaa wodda, insa'ne giddii'n laakko'emeek shoole tommenna onde kumanna jaane dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Daanixxi horte gosa gosa insa'neexxishsha: Simi'ee darree'ni, Simi'etotixxi gosa. Tinni Daanixxe gosa kaddaa wodda, <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />Duuchching Simi'etotixxe gosamman; insa'ne giddii'n laakko'emeek jaane tommenna shoole kumanna shoole dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Aseerixxi horte gosa gosa insa'nexxishsha konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxe: Yiimina darree'ni, Yumiinitotixxi gosa; Yesuwwa darree'ni Yesuwitotixxi gosa; Beeri'a darree'ni Beeri'atotixxi gosa, <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />iittanni Beeri'axxe horte darree'n: Heberi darree'ni Hebertotixxi gosa, Meliki'eeli darree'ni Melike'eeltotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Aseeri Seerahi hiyyendaaxxe belto afe'eman. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Tinni Aseerixxe gosa kandaa wodda, insa'ne giddii'n laako'emeek onde tommenna sase kumanna shoole dhibbamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Nefitaalemixxi horte gosa gosa insa'nexxishsha konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: Yahitsi'eeli darree'ni Yahitsi'eelitotixxi gosa; Guuni darree'ni, Guunitotixxi gosa; <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />Yetser darre'n Yetseritotixxi gosa; Shileemi darree'ni Shileemitotixxi gosa; <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Tinni Nefitaalemixxe gosa kadaa wodda, insa'ne giddii'n laako'emek shoole tommenna onde kumanna shoole dhibbaman. <verse eid="NUM 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Isira'eelike labballik duuchching laakkosi mitteba, jaane dhibbanna mitte kumanna torbaane dhibbanna sase tommeman.<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyeqic, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />«Iikki bogi insa'neke laakkosike summixxe qixxe'ni qoqodeme'e qadaadi insa'ne'a uwwemmowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Heddate'eka laakkosa afe'exxe gosa'a ba'laka qadaada, heenooka laakkossa affe'eexxe gosa'a kinni heenoga uwwi; mitti mitting qadada borresemeeke laakkosixxe qixxe'n adhdhowaal. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Bogink qoqodensha hixikite kadowwaali, mitti mittinxi gosa qadaada ififike edike annuwwike summinnite kaddaan. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Mitti mitting qadaadi hixiiki qoqodemowaal; heddo laakkosike ba'lak qadaad heeno laakkosike shiixxok»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:13">Lak. 34:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1-2">Iya. 14:1-2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 26:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Gosa gosati insa'nexxishsha laako'endeemaxxi Leewwito konneechinni butti'a hexxeexxen.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 26:57" />
  <para style="m" vid="NUM 26:57">Gediso darree'ni, Gershoonitotixxi gosa, Qe'aati darree'ni Qe'aatitotixxi gosa, Meraari darree'ni, Meraaritotixxi gosa. <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Iittanni konnechhcinni butti'a hexxeexxinna Leewwixxe gosaman: Liibinitotixxi gosa, Kebiroonitotixxi gosa'a, Moholitotixxi gosa'a, Muusitotixxi gosa, Qoretotixxi gosa. Qe'aattinna Imram i'le. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Imraamixxe arek summi Yokaabidi hiyyemaan. Isenna Gibtse boga'ni Leewwitotenaa'ni ilendeexxe Leewwixxe horten. Isenna Aarooni'i, Muusenna dayyo insa'neexxa Maaryaami'i Imraami'a ilde. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Aarooninna Naadabike, Abihu, Ali'aazaarikenna Itamaarike annamman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:2">Lak. 3:2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Yaane kinni Naadabinna Abihu seerbeloxxe giira'ni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolcha shiqinsheemmaxxe'e renne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lew. 10:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 3:4">Lak. 3:4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Wogga insa'neexxi mitte aganjo yookin ookoneechchi iima hexxeexxi labbaxxi Leewwito duuchchi laakko'endeexxi lame tommenna sase kuma kadde; insa'ne wele Isira'eltotishsha qadaadi insa'ne'a uwwemagophammaxxee Isira'eelitotixxe welt laakko'emmebaan.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Muusenna qeesichchi Ali'aazaar Iyyaariko edi darre Yordaanoosike galaani bira hedheeke Mo'aabike diidda'ni he'nemma wodda Isira'eelika arda laakkonne wodda laakko'emeemmak konne mannamman. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Muusenna qeesichchi Aarooni Siinaxxe qiilla gammoojje'n Isira'eelika arda laakkonnee wodda konne laakko'emeeke manninaa'n mittikinna hedhemmaba'a. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Tinninna kaddeechchi iikki manni qiila gammoojje'n rennaaxxa ookkone wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti haaso'emaxxete kadda wodda Yoofonika belto Kaalebiinna Naweka belto Iyyaasu gadhidarre insa'nenaa'ni reyebaak gate'eemmak mitti manjinna hedhemmabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-35">Lak. 14:26-35</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s1">Selephe'adika Dubaruwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Mahilehi, Nu'a, Hogila Milkanna Tirtsa Selephe'adike dubarramman. Selepha'adi Ooferike, Efer Gele'adike, Gele'adii Makiirik, Makiir Minaaseke, Minaase Yooseefike. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Kunni dubarri afenshatike duunkaaniba mareexxi Muuse, qeesichcho Ali'aazaar, akeekisanjuwi edonna duuchchiinxe tuuta edo uureexxi hiyyeeqic, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />«Anni no'ok qiilla gammooje giddo reyeen; isi welti gudeexxi Magenoke'n fuggoxxenni ke'emaxxe Qorexxe hordofeeyyenn welti hedhemmabaan; yaane kinni isi reyeechchi ifixxe cubbonite kadda wodda labbaxxa oosenna afe'emmabaan. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Mayeeta anni no'ok labbakka afagophati isik summi isik gosa isixxi giddii'n hitta gophema? No'oke annixxe gosa giddo no'aanna qadaada uwwe» hine.<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Tenne'e Muuse yaada insa'neeka Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo shiqishe. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti Muuse'ni hiyyee qici: <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />«Selephe'adik dubarr shiqisheek qortumi seeriinken; dhugaate'n isa'ne'a insa'neke annixxe gosa giddo qadaada uwwiyyo hasissaammaxxe anna insa'neekika qaadaada insa'ne'a uwwi.<verse eid="NUM 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />«Isira'eelike arda'n hitattoqic, ‹Mitti manji labbaka ileebaak rewoole isixxa karra dubar isike'a dhaalchisse. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Isi dubarra afagophoole karra isixxa isike dayyuwwi'a uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Isi dayyuwwakanna afagophoole anna isikike dayyuwwi'a karra isixxa uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Ann isik dayyuwwa afagophoole karra isixxa isixxe gosanaa'n shiqike manji'a uwweende'n'a ikki manji dhaalowwaal. Kunni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e ajajemmashshanni, Isira'eelike ardi akeekemaake seera kadaan› » hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muusexxe Bakka'n Iyyaasuxxa Filema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Lan. 31:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Ookkonechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyeeqic, «Abaarxe kooba hana marte Isira'eelike ardi'a uwweenneka boga uudi. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Ookkone boga uudetechchi udumma atinna dayyo atike Aaroonishshanni rertatton. <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />Tinninna kaddaachchi tuuta Tsiinxe qiilla gammoojje giddo hedheeke wodi'i bira ane'n fuggoxxenni kexxee wodda ha'no laamiing ardi edo anee'e woyyoonsitineexxi ulfeessa gophati ajaja anka heqedha gophineemmaxxeeten» Tinninna Tsiinxe qiilla gammoojje'n Qaadesi giddo hedheeke Meriibake wode'en.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:23-27">Lan. 3:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:48-52">32:48-52</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Muuse Duuchchi Woddika Gootta hiyyeeqic, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />«Manjoke keddeexxe dada duuchike hufuurke Mageno kade'ek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti tenne tuuta'n manjo fili. <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />Ikki manji Duuchchi Woddike Gootti ard, alalsanjo afebaake gedhebo kadabaashsha insa'ne edo fule aagaakenna bobbaase aassaake kadaashshaten» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Moy. 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Hiz. 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat. 9:36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar. 6:34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Tennexxe'e Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyeeqic, «Woyyichchi Hafuur iso'n hedheeka Naweka belto, Iyyaasu'n hana anga atixxa uggi. <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />Iso'o qeesichcho Ali'aazaar edonna tuuta duuchchi edo uurraashsha assite'e insa'neexxe ille edo iso'o fili. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Isira'eelixxi tuuta duuchcha isi'a ajajendaashsha baallooma atika hanii'n isi'a uwwi. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Isi, isixxee'e Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo hedheexxi Uruumi darree'n qodha'n murte is'a uwwisaake qeesichcho Ali'aazaar edo urraan. Isotenna kado Isira'eelixxi tuuta duuchcha isike ajajinni fuuldaan; isike ajajinni aaggaan» hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Muuse Duuchchi Woddik Gootti iso'n hiyyemmashshanni Iyyaasu aadheexxi qeesichcho Ali'aazaar edonna Isira'eelixxe tuuta edo uurrise. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti iso'o ajajemmashshanni Muuse Iyyaasu'n hana anga uggeexxi iso'o file.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:23">Lew. 21:23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s1">Barra Barraka Tolchuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:38-46">Fula. 29:38-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />«Isira'eelike arda ‹Fishshe ane'e gammachiissaashsha ita giirate'n ani'a tolchendaaxxa ita murendeexxe yanna'n ani'a shiqqishshe› hite'e ajaji. <verse eid="NUM 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />Lebbettexxi insa'ne'e hitattoqic: ‹Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a giirate'n tolchitinaak tolchi konnechchinni butti hedheeken: lame fafa afebaaka mitte mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa barra barra'n shiqamake cincatike tolchi'a barra brra'n shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Mitte buruusa gorsa mitte kinni galagala shiqishshe; <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />mitte mittenge buruusinni welti tumeme qulleessemeeke ejersixxa mitte liitire zayitenni qushshendeexxa mitte kiilo eloxxe bullenni midhatika tolcha qophpheesse. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Kunninna fishshe isixxi gamachchisaake giirate'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqaake tolcha kada wodda Siinaxxe kooba'n muremeeke barra barrake ciincesemaake tolchan. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Siretike buruusinni welti mitteba shiqaak ha'watik tolchi danfite fuldeexxe mitte liitireke ha'wo kaddaan; ha'watika tolchanna woyyitte bakka'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a dhangalaasse. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Langaka ookkonee buruusa gorsika tolcha qophpheessitinemmaxxe biffa'ni midhatike tolchinninna ha'watike tolchinni welti galgala qophpheesse; isinna fishshe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchiisaake giirate'n shiqaake tolchan.<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sanbatiinxe Barraka Tolcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />« ‹Edi Sanbatixxa barra mitte mitte woggaka fafa mitte afebaaka lame gedhebiinka buruusa welti shiqammake ha'watike tolchinna midhatike tolchi'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa lame kiilo eloxxe bullenni welti shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Kunni ha'watike tolchinni welti barra barra'n shiqammak ciincatike tolchi lebeme edi sanbatixxa barra shiqaake ciincatike tolchan.<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agenji agejinxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />« ‹Agenji agenjiinxe sirtixxe barra'n fafa afebaaka lame jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeesanna torbaane mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa ciincatike tolchi'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />Mitte mittinge jibichchinni welti midhatike tolchi'a zayiteti qushshendeexxi sase kiilo eloxxi bulle, gedhebiinke korbeessinninna welti midhatike tolchi'a zayiteti qushshendeexxi lame kiilo eloxxi bulle shiqqaan. <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />Iittanni mitte mittenge gedhebiinke buruusinni welti midhatike tolchi'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa mitte kiilo eloxxa bulle shiqishshe; kunninna ciincatike tolcha kadaa wodda fishshe isixxi gammachchisaake giirate'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqaake tolchan. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Mitte mittinge jibichchinni welti ha'watike tolchi'a lame liitire woyinetixxa booka shiqqowwaal; gedhebiinke korbeessinn welti mittenna gamisa liitire, mitte mittinge gedhebiinke buruusinninna welti mitte liitire woyinetixxi booka shiqqowwaal; kunninna agenji agenjiinxe siretixxe barra'n wogga duuchcha shiqaake ciincatike tolchan. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Ha'watike tolchinni welti barra barra'n shiqammake ciincatike tolchi gadhidarre mitti re'etik korbeessi cubbotike tolchi'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqowwaal.<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa'atike Ayyaanixxa Barra Shiqaaxxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Lew. 23:5-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />« ‹Taakkaki agenji e'yeexxe tommenna sholgeessoxxe barra'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottik sa'atik ayyaani ulfeessemaan. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Konne agenjixxe tommennna ondeessoxxe barra'n ayyaanake kadaan; torbaane barra gamami makemebaaxxe bullexxa kebbo itte. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Ayyaaniixxe taakkeessoxxe barra'n magenoffachchotee bukki hiyye; mittelchonna eetene bara'n hujjinoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Fafa afebaaka lame jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna mitte mitte woggaka torbaane gedhebiinka buruusa cincatike tolchi'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Mitte mittinge jibichchinni welti midhatike tolchi'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa sase kiilo eloxxa bulle; gedhebiinke korbeesinninna welti lame kiilo eloxxa bulle shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />Torbaaninge gedhebiinka buruusa, mitti mittingenninni welti mitte kiilo zayiteti qushshendeexxa sase kiilo eloxxa bulle shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Iitanni cubbo biratee mitte re'etika korbeesa cubbotike tolchi'a shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Konnechcho duuchcha barra barra'n gorsa gorsa shiqamake ciincatike tolcha'ni lebbine'e shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Konneqici'n fishshe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchissaaxxe itaka tolcha barra barra'n torbaane barra'a giirate'n qophpheesse; kunninna ha'watike tolchinni welti barra barra'n shiqammake ciincatike tolcha'n lebemeexxi shiqaan. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Torbeesoxxe barra baro magenooffachchote'e bukki hiyye; mittelchonna eettene barra'n hujjinoqqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:14-20">Fula. 12:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:15">23:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:18">34:18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:3-8">Lew. 16:3-8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Torbaane Torbuwwaka Ayyaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Lew. 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />« ‹Torbaane torbuwwa'n ulfessemaake ayyaana'n haaroxxe midhaka umo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishshinaake haaroxxe gummaxxe uumixxa barra magenooffachchote'e bukki hiyye; mittelchonna eettene barra'n hujjinoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Lame jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna torbaane mitte mitte woggaka gedhebiinka buruusa fishshe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachiissaaka ciincatika tolcha shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />Mitte mittenge jibichchinni welti midhatike tolchi'a zayiteti qushshendeexxa eloxxa sase kiilo; gedhebiinke korbeessinni welti lame kiillo eloxxi bulle shiqqaan. <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />Torbaaninge mitte mittinge gedhebiinke buruusinni welti midhatike tolchi'a zayiteti qushshendeexxi mitte kiilo eloxxi bulle shiqqowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Iittanni ha'noxxa cubbo biratike tolchi'a kadaashsha mitte labakka re'etika korbeesa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Konnee duuchcha, ha'watike tolchuwwa'n lebbine'e barra barra'n shiqammake ciincatike tolchininna midhatike tolchinni shiqishshe; iikki shiqishinaak hori fafa afeeke kadabaashsha kokke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:16">Fula. 23:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:22">34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:9-12">Lew. 16:9-12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s1">Malagatiinka Ayyaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Lew. 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />« ‹Torbake agenjo sirettixxe barra'ni woyyitte bukki asse; edo hujjinammaxxa hujenna hujjinoqqe'e. Tinni ha'no malagatuwwa ufuufinaaxxe barran. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti'a fishshatike ciincatike tolchi'a fafa afebaaka mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna mitte mitte woggaka torbaane gedhebiinka buruusuwwa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Jibichchik welti midhatika tolcha sase kiilo, gedhebiinke korbeessinni welti lame kiilo, zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa bulle shiqqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />Mitti mittinge torbaane gedhebiineke buruusinni welti zayiteti qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa mitte kiilo bulle qixxeesse. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Lebbineexxi mitte re'etika korbeessa cubbo ha'no'a biratee'e cubbotike tolchi'a shiqqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Kunni tolchuwwi kulendemmaxxe ififixxe midhatixxe uwwanninna ififike ha'watike tolchuwwinni welti barra barra'ninna agenjo agenjo'n shiqammake ciincatike tolchuwwa'n lebeme'e fishsheti Duuchchi Woddike Gootta gammachchiissake giirate'n ciinceessemaake tolchuwwan.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cubbo Biratixxa Barra'n Shiqqaaxxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Lew. 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />« ‹Eettne torbake agenjixxe tommixxe barra'ni woyyitte yaa'a bukki hiyye. Eettene barra'n ifinna salphisse; hujetanna hujjinoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti'a fishshetike ciincatike tolchi'a duuchchiing fafa afebaaka mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna mitte mitte woggaka torbaane gedhebiinka buruusuwwa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Jibichchik welti midhatika tolcha sase kiilo, gedhebiinke korbeessinni welti lame kiilo, zayitet qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa bulle shiqqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />Torbaane gedhebiinke mitte mittenge buruusuwwinni welti zayiteti qeshshendeexxa shaqqaxxa mitte mitte kiillo bulle qixxeesse. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Cubbo ha'no'a biratee'e kadaashsha cubbote'e shiqaake tolchinninna ookkone tolchike iittanni kinni midhatike tolchinninna ha'watike tolchinni welti barra barra'n shiqeexxi ciicessemaake tolchi gadho mitte re'etika korbeessa cubbotike tolchi'a lebbineexxi shiqishshe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:29-34">Lew. 16:29-34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fookinka Ayyaanixxe Barra'n Shiqqaaxxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">Lew. 23:33-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />« ‹Torbake agenjo'ni tommenna ondixxe barra'ni woyyitte bukki bukki'i hiyye; edo hujjinammaxxa huje hujjinoqqe; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a torbaane barraka ayyaana ulfeesse. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Fishshe isixxi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gammachchiisaake tolcha kado'a ciincatike tolchi'a fafa afebaaka tommenna sase Jiboota, lame gedhebiinka korbeessanna mitte mitte woggaka tommenna shoole gedhebiinka buruusuwwa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Mitte mittende tommenna sase jibootinni welti sase sase kiilo shaqqaxxa bullenninna mitte mittende lame gedhebiinxe korbeeyenni welt lame lame kiilo zayitenn qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa bulle midhatike tolcha shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />Ittanni mitte mittengee tommenna shoole gedhebiinka buruusa welt mitte mitte kiillo zayitenn qushshendeexxa shaqqaxxa bulle midhatike tolchi'a shiqqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />Iitanni cuobbotike tolchi'a mitte re'etika korbeessa shiqishshinaan; kunni edo shiqammake ciincatike tolchixxe midhati tolchinninna ha'winke tolchinn lebeme shqaake tolchan.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />« ‹Langaxxe barra'n duuchchiigi fafa afebaaka tommenna lame jiboota, lame gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka tommenna shoole gedhebiinka buruusa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />Jiboota, labbaxxa gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna gedhebiinka buruusuwwa ififike midhatike tolchinninna ififike ha'watike tolchinni welti muremeeke laakkossixxe qixxe'n shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Cubbotike tolchi'a mitte re'etika korbeessa shiqishshinaan; kunni edo ciincatik tolch ifike midhatike tochinninni ifike ha'watike tochuwwinni welti shiqammake tolchuwwa'n lebemeeten.<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />« ‹Sakkaxxe barra'n duuchching fafa afebaaka tommenna mitte jiboota, lame gedhebiinka korbeessanna mitte mitte woggaka tommenna shoole gedhebiinka buruusuwwa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />Ookkonee jiboota, eetene labbaxxa gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna gedhebiinka buruusuwwa ififike midhatike tolchinninna ififike ha'watike tolchinni welti muremeeke laakkosixxe qixxe'n shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Cubbotike tolchi'a mitte re'etika korbeesa shiqishshinaan; kunni edo ciincatik tolch ifike midhatike tolchinninna ifike ha'watike tolchuwwinni welti shiqammake tolchuwwa'n lebemeeten.<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />« ‹Sholgaxxe barra'n duuchchinxi fafa afebaaka tomme jiboota, lame gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka tommenna shoole gedhebiinka buruusa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Okkonee jiboota, eettenee labbaxxa gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna gedhebiinka buruusuwwa ififike midhatike tolchinninna ififike ha'watike tolchinni welti muremeeke laakkossixxe qixxe'n shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Cubbotike tolchi'a mitte re'etika korbeessa shiqishshinaan; kunni edo ciincatik tolch ifike midhatike tochinninna ifike ha'watike tochuwwinni welti shiqammake tolchuwwa'n lebemeeten.<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />« ‹Ondixxe barra'ni duuchchiing fafa afebaaka sallane jiboota lame gedhebiinka korbeessanna mitte mitte woggaka tommenna shoole gedhebiinka buruusuwwa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />Ookkonee jiboota, eettenee labbaxxa gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna gedhebiinka buruusuwwa ififike midhatike tolchinninna ififike ha'watike tochinni welti muremeeke laakkossixxe qixxe'n shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Higgeenni midhatixxe uwwanaa'ninna ha'wiinxe uwwanni welti barra barra'n shiqaake ciincatike tolchi gadho wele mitte labbaka recco cubbotike tolchi'a lebbine shiqishshe.<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />« ‹Jiyyaxxe barra'n duuchchiing fafa afebaaka saddeeta jiboota, lame gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka tommenna shoole gedhebiinka buruusa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />Ookkonee jiboota, eetene labbaxxa gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna gedhebiinka buruusuwwa ififike midhatike tolchinninna ififike ha'watike tolchinni welti muremeeke laakkossixxe qixxe'n shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Cubbotike tolchi'a mitte re'etika korbeessa shiqishshinaan; kunni edo ciincatik tolch ifike midhatike tochinninna ifike ha'watike tochuwwinni welti shiqammake tolchuwwa'n lebemeeten.<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />« ‹Torbaxxe barra'ni duuchchiing fafa afebaaka torbaane jiboota, lame gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna mitte mitte woggaka tommenna shoole gedhebiinka buruusuwwa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Ookkonee jiboota, eettenee labbaxxa gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna gedhebiinka buruusuwwa ififike midhatike tolchinninna ififike ha'watike tochinni welti muremeeke laakkossixxe qixxe'n shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Cubbotike tolchi'a mitte re'etika korbeesa shiqishshinaan; kunni edo ciincatik tolch ifike midhatike tochinninna ifike ha'watike tochuwwinni welti shiqammake tolchuwwa'n lebemeeten.<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />« ‹Saddeetixxe barra'ni bukki hiyye; eetene barra'n edo hujjinammaxxa huje hujjinoqqe. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a fishshatike ciincatike tolchi'a duuchchiing fafa afebaaka mitte jibichcha, mitte gedhebiinka korbeessanna mitte mitte woggaka torbaane gedhebinka buruusuwwa shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Ookkonee jiboota, eettenee labbaxxa gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna gedhebiinka buruusuwwa ififike midhatike tolchinninna ififike ha'watike tolchinni welti muremeeke laakkossixxe qixxe'n shiqishshe. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Cubbotike tolchi'a mitte re'etika korbeessa shiqishshinaan; kunni edo ciincatik tolch ifike midhatike tolchinninna ifike ha'watike tolchuwwinni welti shiqammake tolcha'n lebemeeten.<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />« ‹Werreegikinna ifixxe eeyyanni shiqishshinaaxxe uwwuwwa'n lebbine ciincatika ha'nooka tolchuwwa, midhatika ha'nooka tolchuwwa, ha'watika ha'nooka tolchuwwanna mittoomiinka ha'nooka tolchuwwa muremeeke ha'nooke ayyaannuwwa'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishshe.› » <verse eid="NUM 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Muusenna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti iso'o ajajeemmaxxa duuchcha Isira'eelike arda'n kule.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s1">Wereegaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Muuse Isira'eelixxe gosake minike akeekisanjiwwa'n hiyyeexxi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajeexxa kuleeqic konnechchin butti'a hexxenn: <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />«Manji mitti Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a wereega wereegaxxa yanna yookaan mitte yaane assatee kakoti ifi usuraaxxa yanna hiyyemmaxxa gatisebaang muuxiyyo hasissaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:21-23">Lew. 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat. 5:33</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />«Anna ifikike mine'n hexxeexxa yanna mitte dubarrichcho Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a wereega wereegoole yookaan mitte yaane assatee kakoti ifi usurtoole, <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />anni isekinna ise wereega wereeggeexxa laqeexxi mittelchonna ise'n hiyyagophoole wereegi ikki wereegange kade'naa'a isenna assito'a kakoti ifi usurtemmaxxa yaanuwwa duuchcha muuxiyyo hasissaan. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Anni isek tennee yaane laqeexxi ise'e hoyyoole kinni huuni wereeggemmaka wereeganna kadi yookaan ifi usurtemmaxxi kako ise'e abiddabaan. Anni isee hoyyeemmaxxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ise'a gattowaal hiyyaan.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />«Iitanni wereega wereegechchi uduma yookaan si'attebaang afo'ii'n fulchedhiyyoti kakoti ifi usurtee udma heerundoole <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />ikki herundemmak tenne yaane laqeexxi ise'e mittelchonna hiyya gophoole wereeggemmake wereeganna kadi yookaan assito'a kakoti ifi usurtemmaxxa yaane duuchcha muuxiyyo hasissaan. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Yaane kinni isek aro'i tenne yaane lagqeexxi ise'e hoyyoole assiyyotee wereegemake weereega kadi yookaan si'attebaang afo'ii'n fulchedhiyyoti ifi usurtemmaxxa yaane isee'n gatisaammaxxe'e Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ise'a gottowaal hiyyaane.<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />«Aro'i isek reyeexxi manjichcho yokiin aro'i waaleexxi manjichcho wereeggemake wereeganna kadi yookaan assiyyote'e ifi usurtemmaxxi kako ise'e abiddaan.<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />«Minkanna affeexxi manjichcho werreega werreeggoole yookaan mitte yaane assiyyotee kakoti ifi usurtoole <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />aro'i isek tenne yaane laqeexxi ise'e mittelchonna hiyyagophoole wereeggemak wereeganna kadi yookaan assito'a kakoti ifi usurtemmaxxa yaane duuchcha muuxiyyo hasissaan. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Aro'i isek tenne yaane laqeexxe eettene barra'n itti yaane gattaashsha assoole kinni werreegemak werreeganna kadi assiyyote'e afo'o fulchexxemmaxxa yaane assiyyo hasissabaan; tennee yaanuwwa aro'i isek gattaashsha assemmaxxe'e Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ise'a gattowaal hiyyaan. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Hoone ise werreeggeeka werreeganna kadi yookaan kakoti ifi usurtemaxxa yaane duuchcha isek aro'i hexxeeshshanni waaliyyo yookaan gatisiyyo dande'aan. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Yaane kinni aro'i isek tenne yaanexxa yaane barra barra'n mittelcho ise'n haaso'ebaang gatoole werreggemmaka werreega yokiin assito'a kakoti if usurtemmaxxa yaanuwwa duuchcha assitaashsha ise'n duudha'neen hiyyoten. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Yaane kinni tenne yaane laqeechchi uduma wele bara werreegi gataashsha assoole ise hujjemmaxxe balleessa'a qoremaak isoten» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Tinni heerundebaak ifik annike mine'n hexxeexxe yookaan heerunde aro'o ifike'n hexxeexxe dabarteka mittooma uudaaxxinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'n uwweexxe aadan.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s1">Miidiyaamitote'n Halo fula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />«Isira'eelik mannixxee Midiyaamike manna'n halo fuli; ookkonechchi uduma atinna rertatton.»<verse eid="NUM 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Tennexxe'e Muuse arda, «Midiyaamika manna lolate'e mareexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxee halo insa'ne'n fulaaka manna ha'noo giddii'n bagedoke qophpheesse. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Mitte mittenge Isira'eelike gosatike mininaa'n mitte mitte kuma manna bagedo erge» hiyye. <verse eid="NUM 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Tennexxe'e Isira'eelixxe gosanaa'n fuleek, mitte mittende gosatike mininaa'n mitti kumi, duuching mitteba tommenna lami kumi manji bagedokee'e qophpheeseme. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Muusenna woyyichcha woyyitte bakkaka mi'uwwanna beesisakee ufuufemaaka malagata anga afe'eeka qeesichcho Ali'aazaarike belto Finihaasinni welti mitte mittenge gosatike mininaa'n mitte mitte kuma manna bagedo erge. <verse eid="NUM 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Insa'nenna Muuse'e Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajemmaxxe qixxe'n Midiyaamika manna lolle; labballo duuchchanna shinne birre. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Shiyemeeke manni giddo ondi Midiyaamik moyanjuwwi Ewwi, Roqeemi, Suuri, Huurinna Riiba he'nemman; Bi'oorika belto Bele'aamiinna wolaantichchik shinne. <verse eid="NUM 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Ookkonechchi uduma Isira'eelik manni Midiyaamike mannixxa melaallenna annoole booji'e; hore insa'neeka lalo, gedhebokanna re'e duuchcha saame; kara insa'neexxa duuchchanna adhdhine. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Midiyaamik manni hedhammaka qachchuwwa duuchchanna insa'nexxa kaambuwwa duuchcha gunbe. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Hori manji gatebaang boojineechchonna saammeechcho duuchcha bukki assene adhdhine. <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />Boojineemmaka manna, oolfineemmaka horenna saammemmaxxa karra duuchcha Iyyaariko edi darre Yordaanoosi qarqara, Mo'aabike diida'n Muusenna qeesichchi Ali'aazaar ittanni Isira'eelxi tuuta duuchcha he'neexxe kaambe iyyedange. <verse eid="NUM 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Muuse, qeesichchi Ali'aazaarinna tuutatik akeekisanjuwwi duuchchi insa'ne'e qophedho'a kaambee'n gadhi'a fulle. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Muuse, bagedokenaa'n aagemmake loliinke mannike kumma akkeekisanjuwwa'ninna dhibba akkeeisanjuwwa'n mufateexxi, <verse eid="NUM 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Muusenna insa'ne'e, «Melaalle duuchcha hittanni shiyya gophphine?» Hiyye qore. <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />«Insa'ne Fegor kaddeexxe yaane'n Bele'aamika gorsa adhdhineexxi, Isira'eeli Duuchchi Woddike Goottinaa'n udumi'a higgaashsha assinekinna Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna tennexxe arda balati ganaashsha assineek insa'neten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:1-9">Lew. 25:1-9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Tennexxe ta'atenna kaddoolelabbaxxa oose duuchcha, labballik diiphpheexxa melaalle duuchchanna shiwwe. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Yaane kinni labballo ege'nebaaka dubarra duuchcha ifi'a gatilse.<verse eid="NUM 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />«Ha'no giddii'n manjo shiyeek yookaan shiyemeeka tuqeek duuchchi kaambeti gadho torbaane barra turowwaal; sakkaxxe barra'ninna torbaxxe barra'n ha'no umo ifikanna boojitinemmaka manna luqqi asse. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Hiini seemmanna iittanni gogiink, re'etixxe ordaak, yookaan hoone'e haqichiinka mi'uwwa duuchchanna luqqi asse.»<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Ookkonechchi uduma qeesichchi Ali'aazaar lola mare aagemmaka loliinka manna hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'n uwweeke seerxi aada konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />Worqe, birretik sibiljo, sageettotika sibljo, siblo, qorqoorotika sibiljo, irsaasetek sibljonna <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />iittanni giirati gubatabaachchi huunichchi duuchchinna giira giddo sa'issiyyo hasissaan; ookkonechchi udumanna ca'a hiyyaan; kadomale kinni ca'a assatike wodi'inni ca'a hiyyo hasissaan. Giirati gubataachchi huunichchi duuchchinna konne ca'a assatike wodi'i giddo sa'issiyyo hasissaan. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Torbaxxe barra'n seemma ha'nooxxa borcedhdhe; ca'a hitinaan; ookkonechchi uduma kaambe giddi'a e'ya dandeetinaan.»<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Booji'o Qoodema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />«Ati, qeesichchi Ali'aazaarinna tuuti giddo hedheek mini mini hadik akeekisanjuwwin welti booji'eme dageeka ardanna hore duuchcha laakko'we. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Booji'o lameba hissitineexxi bagedo dulemmake loliinke manni'anna wele gatemmake tuutatike ardi'a qoodde. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Bagedo duuleeke loliinke mannika qoobbonaa'n, manjokee'n kadi gateeke horenaa'n laliinke, harretike gedhebiinke yookaan re'etike onde onde dhibbinaa'n mitte mitte Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a hirbo fulche. <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />Tennee hirbo insa'neeke qoobbinaa'n aaxxettexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottike qoobbi'a qeesichcho Ali'aazaari'n uwwi. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Isira'eelitota geyemmake gamisa qoobbonaa'n, manjokee'n kadi geteeke horiinkee'n, laliinke harretike gedhebiinke yookaan re'etike onde onde tomminaa'n mitte mitte fildettexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottike Taaboti galdumika duunkaana erigatema uuddaake Leewwitote uwwi.» <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Muusenna qeesichchi Ali'aazaar Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e ajajemmashshanni assine. <verse eid="NUM 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Loliink manni boji'eexxi adhdhemmaxxe boji'onaa'n gate'emachchi: jaane dhibbanna torbaane tommenna onde kumi gedhebi, <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />torbaan tomminna lami kumi lali, <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />jaane tomminna mitti kumi harrenna <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />sasi tomminna lami kumi labballik diiphphebaaxxi melaalle.<verse eid="NUM 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Ookkone bagedo duulemmake loliinke mannik gamisi qoobbi 337,500 gedhebomman. <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />Konne gedhebi giddii'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a hirbo uune'emmak jaane dhibbanna torbaane tommenna ondekemman. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Sase tommenna jaane kuma lalo; konne giddii'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwendeexxi hirbo, torbaane tommenna lame lalomman. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Sase tomme kumanna onde dhibba harre, konne giddii'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwendeexxi hirbo jaane tommenna mitte harremman. <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Tommenna jaane kumi manni, konne giddii'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwendeexxi hirbo sase tommenna lame mannamman.<verse eid="NUM 31:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse ajajemashanni Muse Duuchchi Woddike Goottike qoobbo kaddeexxa hirbo qeesichcho Ali'aazaari'n uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Muuse bagedo duulemmake mannii'n gargar hiseek Isira'eelitota geyeek gamisi qoobbi, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />tuutatike qoobbo kadeek: sase dhibbanna sase tommenna torbaan kuminna ondi dhibbi gedhebi, <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />sase tommenna jaane kumi lali, <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />sase tomme kumanna onde dhibba harrenna, <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />tommenna jaani kuma mannamman. <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Isira'eelitota geyemmake gamisa qoobbinaa'n Muuse Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajemmashanni onde tomme manjinaa'ninna horinaa'n mitte mitte fila'n Duuchchi Woddik Goottike Taabotiinke galdumika duunkaana erigatema uuddaaxxe Leewwito'a uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Okkonechchi uduma loliinke mannixxe kutuwwa'n kumi akeekisajuwwinna dhibbi akeekisanjuwwi Muuseba'a dangeexxi, <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />Muuse'ni hinee qici, «No'o atik erganjuwwi no'oke ajaja hunda hedhemmaka loliinka manna lakkonneena'a mittikinna xe'yeek hedhebaan. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Tennexxe'e no'o mitti mitting anfenneka worqetika seesuwwa, lekkatika hirbooruwwa, angatixxa sageettuwwa, qubbatixxa qubuwwa, manshatika gutichchuwwanna goobiinxa marxuwwa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo cubbo no'oxxa biratike tolcha kado'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uune'ennen» hine. <verse eid="NUM 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Muusenna qeesichchi Ali'aazaar worqetixxe bifa'n hujemeeka seesuwwa insa'nenaa'n aa'ne. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Muusenna Ali'azaar kuma akeeksanjuwinaa'ninna dhibba akkeesanjuwwinaa'n aaneexxi worqe Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uuneexi worqek ha'urri dhibbanna sallane tomme kiiloqicamman. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Mitti mittingi loliink manni booji'o ifi ifi'a gatilse'emman. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Muusenna qeesichchi Ali'aazaar kuma akeeksanjuwwinaa'inna dhibba akeekisanjuwinaa'n aa'nemmaxxa worqe Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo Isira'eelike mannixxe qaabbe kaddaashsha Afenshatike Duunkaani giddi'a idange.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yoordaanosii'ni Boroti Darre Hixxeexxa Gosa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Lan. 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Roobelinna Gaadik gosatik mini mini hadi yo'oshsha heddo, lalo, gedhebo, re'e, Iyyazeerinna Gele'adik bogi horekee'e eloke booncho kadeexxa anfe. <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />Tennexxe'e Muusebaanna Ali'aazariba iittanni wele tuutatike akeekisanjuwwibaa dangeexxi hinee qici: <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />«Tinni Isira'eelito dhaaldaashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti gargareek Axaarotiki, Dibooniki, Iyyazeeriki, Nimiiraki, Haseeboniki, Eli'aaleki, Siibimaki, Neebokinna Beetsooniki qachchuwwi afemaak bogi horekee eloken, no'onna heddo hore anfeenen. <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />Kunni boguwwi, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelike ardi edo injifatemaashsha asseemmak horeke'e eloken; no'oonna erganjuwwi atiki hore anfeennen. <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />No'o atixxe ille'ni» insa'nenna hiissinexxi, «elle alfinoonnole kunni bogi no'o atike erganjuwwi'a qadaadummati uwwemowwaal, Yordaanoosii foonfannoshsha no'o'o mee assi.»<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Muusenna, Gaadikanna Roobelika gosatika minika manna hiyyeeqici, «Ha'nook dayyuwwi Isira'elik ardi bagediinbaa me'a wodda ha'no konnoo'o gattino'atee? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Isira'eelik ardi foofe Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne'a uwweemmake boga'n e'yinabaashsha godoba gurraashsha mayee assitina? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Annuwwi ha'nooki boga dooyyinaashsha Qaadesi Berinee'ni insa'ne'e ergenne wodda insa'nenna tennende assineemman. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Insa'ne Eshikoolixxa dhooqa marreexxi boga uunde illeema hingeechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti uwweemmake bogiba'n Isira'eelik ardi godoba gure e'yabaashsha assine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:33">Lew. 13:33</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Eeteneenni barra Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti yo'oshsha aare hiyye kakateeqic: <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‹Mitte godobinni anee'e hordofa gonpheemmaxxe'e Gibtsee'ni fulleeke, wogga insa'neexxinna lame tommenna ookoneechi iima hedheeke mannanaa'n mittikinna Abiraami'a, Yisaaqi'anna Ya'iqoobi'a uwwonaa'a kako aagenneka boga uundabaan; <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta mitte godobinni hordonfeemmaxxe'e Qenezichcho Yoofonika belto Kaalebiinna Neweka belto Iyyaasu gadho mittikinna boga ookone'e uudabaan.› <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi aare Isira'eelike arda'ni bubbeemmaxxe'e, isi edo fuggoxxa assitemmaxxi iiti ila duuchchi muddaaqico'ni insa'ne shoole tomme wogga qiila gammooje boga'ni gadaadoonnaashsha asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:26-36">Lew. 14:26-36</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />«Ha'no cubbaaleyyetixxi oose kunse ha'no'o annuwwi ha'nookixxe bakka'ni higgineexxi Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isira'eelike arda'ni hara lebe mufataashsha assitina'neen. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Isoo'o hordofatena'ni illeema higginoole ta'anna isi konnee arda duuchcha qiila gammooje'ni waalaan; ha'nonna konne arda'n geeltaaxxe ba'ne'a laqendinaan.»<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Ookoneechchi uduma insa'ne isiba'a dangee'e iso'n hineeqic, «Kaba hore no'oke'e dalla'a, melaalle no'oxxeenna oose no'oxxe'e qachcha ijaara hansaannen. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Yaane kinni no'o Isira'eelito booncho insa'neeke'n e'yinannoqico'n ka'line insa'ne edo me'inona'a qixxeeffanteennen; Ookkone wodda melaalle no'oxxe'nina oose no'oxxe'n ookone bogiki manni rakko geessisabaashsha konnee dalla'ike qachchuwwa'ni he'naani. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />No'onna mitti mitting Isira'eelik ardi qadaadda ifika adhdhaqico'n ifi ifike minibaa'a hingabe'non. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />No'o qoobbo ifikanna Yordaanoosike galaanina'n boroti darree'ni alfineennaxxe'e, Yordaanoosi wido insa'nenaa'n alfinannok mitti qadaadinna hedhabaan.»<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Ookonechchi uduma Muuse insa'ne'e hiyyeeqic, «Ha'no tenne'e assitinoole Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo lolake'e ka'litine qixxeefatinoole, <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />iittanni naapha ifika ifi edii'n shorre fulchaaqico'ni ha'no duuchchiing Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo lolake'e qixxefatine Yordaanoosi'i fooffinoole, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti injifate ookkonee boga adhdhaaqico'n ha'no loliyyo hasissaan; iitta assitinoole illee iima higa dandeettinaan; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'anna Isira'eeli'a ha'no assiyyo hasissaaxxa yaane assitinen hiyyoten; kunni boginna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ha'nooke qadaada kadaan.<verse eid="NUM 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />«Tennee'e assa gophphinoole kinni ha'noonna Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n cubbo hujjine'een. Cubbo ha'no'o abiddaaxxa ege'ne. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Oose ha'nooxxeenna melaalle ha'nooxxe'e qachcha ijaarre, gedhebokeenna re'etee'e goodhe ijaarre; assitino'a addachchiissinemmaxxa yaane kinni muuxxe.»<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Gaadikinna Roobeliki manni kinni Muuse'n hiyyeeqic, «No'o erganjuwwi atik gootti ajajemmaxxa assinannon. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Oose no'oxxinna aruwwa no'oxxi, gedhebiinkanna re'etika ittanni lali no'okinna kaban Gele'adike qachcha'ni gantaan. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />No'o atixxi garboole ati hitetteshshani mitti mitting no'o kinni lolatee qixxeeffante Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo adhetee'e Yordaanosi'i foonfaannon.»<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'nee'e uudaaxxenni Muuse qeessichcho Ali'aazaari'n, Neweke belto Iyyaasu'ninna Isira'eelike mini mini hadike annuwwa'ni hiyyeexxi ajajeqic, <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />Muusenna insa'ne'e hiyyee qici «Gaadikinna Roobelki labballi duuchchi, mitti mitting bogedokee'e qixxeeffatati Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ha'nnooni welti Yordaanoosika galaana fofoole, ookkone boga abixxitinaa wodda qadaada insa'neke kado'a Gele'adika boga insa'ne'a uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Yaane kinni lolatee qixxeeffante Yordanoosika galaana ha'non welti foofa gonphoole ha'noshshanni Kenaanike boga'n qadaada insa'nee geyamaka adhdhiyyo hasissaani.»<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Gaadikinna Roobelki manni hiyyeeqic, «Erganjuwwi atik no'o Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyeexxa assinannon; <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />lolakee'e qixxeeffante Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo Kenaani'a foonfannon; yaane kinni no'o'o geyaak qadaadi kaba Yordaanoosi kayya kaddaan.» <verse eid="NUM 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Ookkoneechhci uduma Muusse, Amoorik moyanji Sewooninni galchammakanna Baasaanik moyanji Oogi galchammaka boga duuchcha qarqarake'n hedhemake shiixxara qachchuwwinninni mitteba Gaadikenna Roobelke gosatike mini mini hadduww'n, ittanni belto Yooseefike, Minaaseke gosatike mini hadi'a gamisa uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Gaadik gosatik mini, Diboonika qachcha, Axaarotika, Aro'eereenka, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />Axirotishoofanenika, Iyyazeerikanna, Yogibihaanika, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />Beetinimiraninna Beetiharanika qachchuwwa, qammalchine; gedhebokeenna re'e ifixxe goodhe ijaarre. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Roobelik manni Haseebonika qachcha, Eli'aalekanna Qeriyatayimika, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />Neeboni, uudmii'ni summi jijjiiremeki Ba'aalimetsooneninna Siibimaaneka qachchuwwa qammalchine. Insa'nenna konne qachchcuwwi'anna haaroka summa fulchine. <verse eid="NUM 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Minaasek belto, Makiirixxi horte Gele'adi'a marteexxi boga abixxati ooko'o hedhemmaka Amooraka manna shorrine. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Tennexxee Muusse Gele'adika boga Makiirixe horte'a Minaaseke belti'a uwwe, insa'nenna ooko ofolle. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Minaasexxe hortek Iyya'iire insa'neeka heddo qachchuwwa adheexxi, Iyya'iirike qachchuwwa hiyye summa jijjiiire fulche. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Ittanni Noobahi Qenaatika qachchanna qarqarake'n hedheeka shiixaramma qachchuwwa abixxeexxi ifike summinni, Noobahi hiyye jijjiire summa fulche.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s1">Isra'eeli Gibtsee'ni Mo'abiqico'n Me'itee Wodda Kaanbe Abixxiteeka Bonchuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Isira'eeli ardi gosa gosatike mininni qoqqodendeexxi Muusexxenna Aaroonixxe akeettenni Gibtsee'ni fuliddeexxi me'ate'ni he'ne kaanbe asse'ne abixxineemmak boonchuwwi konnechchinni butti'a hedheeken: <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Muusenna me'aten he'nemma wodda kaanbe asse'ne abixxineemmaka boonchuwwa Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajajinni borreesse. Booncho booncho'ni kaanbe abixxina'ni me'inaaxi me'a.<verse eid="NUM 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Isira'eeli siretike agenjixxe tommenna ondixxe barra'ni sa'atike ayyaanixxa langaxxa gorisa Raamiseke qachchanaa'ni kexxe fulde. Gibtseki ardi duuchchi insa'nee uuda'naani mitte godoba me'ine. <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />Eettenee yanna Gibtseki manni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti balati shiyyemmaka ifi fika angafa angafa mooqqa'nemman; Duuchchi Woddki Goottinna Gibtseke magenuwwa'ni mure'emman.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Isira'eeli Raamisee'ni kexxe me'iteexxi Sukooti kaanbe oltite.<verse eid="NUM 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Sukooti'ni ke'neexxi qiilla gammoojjeke kasaa'ni, Eetaami'n kaanbe oltite. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Eetaaminaa'ninna ke'neexxi Ba'aalitseefonii'ni boroti darre'ni, Fihirooti'a hingeexxi Migidooli edi darre kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />Fihaarooti'ni ke'neexxi abbaayya giddii'n sa'neexxi qiila gammoojjeba'a me'ine; ookkoo'ninna sa'neexxi Eetaamixxe qiila gammoojje giddo sase barraka ora me'ineexxi Maara kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Maara'ni ke'neexxi tommenna lame wodiinxi mumuwwanna torbaane tomme meexetiki haqichchuwwi hedheeba, Eelimi dangeexxi ookko kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Eelimii'ni ke'neexxi Eritiriinxe Abbaayya bira kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Eritiriinxe Abbayyabaa'ni ke'neexxi Siinixxe qiila gammoojje giddo kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Siinixxe qiila gammoojjenaa'ni ke'neexxi Duufiqa kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Duufiqa'ni ke'neexxi Eluushi kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Eluushii'ni ke'neexxi Raafidiimi kaanbe oltine. Ookkonna ardi ha'waaki woddi'i hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="NUM 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Raafidiimii'ni ke'neexxi Siinixxe qiila gammoojje giddo kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Siinixxe qiila gammoojjenaa'ni ke'neexxi Qibirooti Hati'awo kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />Qibirooti Hati'awo'n ke'neexxi Hatserooti kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Hatserootii'ni ke'neexxi Ritima kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Ritimii'ni ke'neexxi Remooni Zefaareesi kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Remooni Zefaaresii'ni ke'neexxi Libina kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Libinii'ni ke'neexxi Rissa kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Rissaa'ni ke'neexxi Qehelaata kanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />Qehelaatii'ni ke'neexxi Shaafeerixxe kooba'ni kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Shaafeerixxe koobanaa'ni ke'neexxi Haraada kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Haraadi'ni ke'neexxi Meqihelloti kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Meqihellotii'ni ke'neexxi Tahaati kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Tahaatii'ni ke'neexxi Taara kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Taaraa'ni ke'neexxi Mitiiqa kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Mitiiqa'a ke'neexi Hashemoona kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Hashemoonii'ni ke'neexxi Mooserooti kanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Mooserootii'ni ke'neexxi Beeneya'iqaani kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Beeneya'iqaanii'ni ke'neexxi Horihagidigaadi kanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Horihagidigaadii'ni ke'neexxi Yooxxibaata kanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Yooxxibaatii'ni ke'neexxi Abiroona kanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Abiroonii'ni ke'neexxi Etsiyooni Gabiri kanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />Etsiyooni Gabirii'ni ke'neexxi Tsiinxe qiilla gammoojje giddo hexxexxe Qaadesi'ni kanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Qaadesii'ni ke'neexxi Eedoomike kasa'n hexxeexxe Horexxe kooba'ni kanbe oltine.<verse eid="NUM 33:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Qeesichchi Aarooni Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajajinni Horexxe kooba hana fule; ookoonna Isira'eeli Gibtse'ni fuldeechchi uduma shoole tomme woggake ondike agenjixxe taakkaxxe barra'ni reye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:22-28">Lak. 20:22-28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:6">Lan. 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:50">32:50</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Aarooni Horexxe kooba hana reyee wodda wogga isixxi dhibbanna lame tommenna sasetemman.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Negeebixxe Kenaani'ni hedha'neek Kenaanichchi Araadik moyanji Isira'eeli daga'neexxa laqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:1">Lak. 21:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Insa'nenna Horexxe koobanaa'ni ke'neexxi Selimona kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />Selimoonii'ni ke'neexxi Faanooni kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />Faanoonii'ni ke'neexxi Obootim kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />Obootiimi'ni ke'neexxi Mo'aabike kasa'n hexxeexxe Iyye'abarimi kanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />Iyye'abariimii'ni ke'neexxi Diboongadi kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />Diboongadii'ni ke'neexxi Alimondi Bilatayimi kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />Alimondi Bilatayimii'ni ke'neexxi Naabawwu bira hexxeexxe Abiriimixxe koobuwwa'n hana kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Abiriimixxe koobuwanaa'n ke'neexxi Iyyaariko wido Yordaanoosike galaani bira hedheeke Mo'aabike diida'ni kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Ookko Yordaanoosike galaani bira Mo'aabike diida'ni Beetiyeshimootii'ni Abeeli Shuutimi qico'n hedheeke booncho'n kaanbe oltine.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelito Yordaanoosi'i Fooffeba Edi Darre Insa'ne'a Uwwendeexxa Akeete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />Iyyaariko wido Yordaanoosike galaani bira hedheeke Mo'aabike diida'ni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muusse'e hiyyyee qic: <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />«Isira'eelike arda'n: ‹Kenaanike bogiba'a e'yitino'a Yordaanoosi fooffina wodda, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />Ookkone boga'n hedheeka manna duuchcha shorritine fulche; bocende giissendeemmaxxa isa'neexxa misiluwwanna baqiseme giissememmaka insa'neka magenuwwa duuchcha balleesse; iittani gooruwa hana giissendeemmaxxa insa'neeka magenoonfachchotixxa bakkuwwa duuchcha findigge. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Ookkonee boga qadaada ha'nooke kado'a ha'no'a uwweennaxxee dhaaldine giddo hedhdhe. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Bogakanna hixxik ha'nooke gosa gosatike mini mine'n qoqqoodemme. Heddo laakkossike gosatike mini'a ba'laka, heenoke laakkossikee kinni shiixxoka boga uwwe. Kaddeexxenna kaddoole hixxi mittemittengee ibeek bogi hixxi ibemmashshanni isike kadaan; bogiink qooddinna ha'nooke annuwwixxe gosatike mini minuwwa'nte kadowwaal.<verse eid="NUM 33:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />« ‹Ookkone boga'ni hedha'neeka manna duuchcha fulchitina gophphinee'na'a gatoole kinni gatissinemmaki iiki manni hano'a illetixxe hincinnenna cinaachchiinxe utetishsha kadaani; hexxinaake boga'ninna ha'no'n rakko illaan. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Aninna insa'ne'ni assona'a hedennexxa ha'no'ni assannon.› »<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s1">Kanaanike Bogika Gabalasanjuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyeeqic, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />«Isira'eelika arda hite ajajatoqic: ‹Geego ha'nooke kado'a qoodendinaake Kanaanike boga'n aagginaa wodda, ha'noonna Kenaanike bogiba'a e'yitina wodda konne bogixxi gabaluwwa konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen.<verse eid="NUM 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />« ‹Bita'ixxi ha'nooxxi gabala Eedoomixxe gabala'n hexxeexxe Tsiinixxe Qiilla gammoojjenaa'n heenoba lebbaan; boroti darree'n ha'nooxxi bita'ixxi gabala Maxinetixxe Abbaayyanaa'n kexxeexxi <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />Aqirebimika qettellinne qaxxamurate'e Tsiinqico marte gelta'n bita'i darree'n Qaadesi Barneqico'n me'itaan; ookkoo'ninna kexxeexxi Hatser Adarii'n saxxe'e Atsimoonqico'n gelta'n. <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />Atsimooni'n wirri hiteexxi Gibtseke galaanixxe bagoxxe bakka dhooqanni welti afenda'n Meediteraanixxa Abbaayya'n marete uurritaan.<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />« ‹Ha'noxxi dhidhimiinxi gabala kinni Lumoxxe Abbaayyake kasa kadaan; dhidhimi darre'n hexxeexxi ha'noxxi gabala tennenden.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />« ‹Ha'nooxxi middi darrexxi gabala Lumoxxe Abbaayyanaa'n Hoorixxe Koobaqico'n gabalatika beessisa ugge; <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />Hoorixxe Koobanaa'n Hamaati'a e'yinama qico'ni martee geltaan; ookko'ninna gabalatinna Tsidaadiqico marte geltaan, <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />Zifirooniqico'n me'iteexxi Hatsari'ena marte uurritaan; middi darrexxi ha'nooxxi gabala tenneten.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />« ‹Boroti darrexxe ha'nooxxe gabala'anna iittanni Hatsari'enanaa'n Seefamaqico'n gabalatika beessisa ugge. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Gabalatinna Seefamaa'n kexxeexxi Ayinii'n borroti darre'n hexxeexxi Ribilaxxa adaddeshummaqico'n dirriteexxi Kinereetixxe Abbaayyanaa'n boroti darre'n hexxeexxe gooruwwaqico marte geltaan. <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />Gabalatinna Yordaanoosika galaana abide me'iteexxi marte Maxinetixxe Abbaayya'n uurritaan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 34:12">« ‹Yoona ha'nok bogi qarqake'n iske'n hexxeexxe gabaluwwaninni welti konneten.› »<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Muuse Isira'eelika arda hiyye ajajeqic: «Kunni bogi geego ha'noke kado'a hixik qoodemme; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kunni bogi sallanekanna gamisa gosatike minuwwi'a uwwemaashsha muredheen. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Tinnanna Roobelike gosati minik mini haduwwi, Gaadike gosat minikinna iittanni gamisa Minaaske gosatik mini haduwwi ifi ifika geego adhdhineemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Kunni lami gosatik mininna gamisi gosatik mini Yordaanoosi'n borotidarre'n Iyyaariko wido arsho fuldammaddarre'n ifi ifika geego adhdhine'een» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:1-5">Iya. 14:1-5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NUM 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyee qici, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />«Bogichcho ardakee geegoke kado'a qoodake mannik summi konnechchinni butti'a hedheeken: qeesichchi Ali'aazaarinna Newek belto Iyyaasute. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Ookkone boga qooddoke'n gargaraak gosa gosatike mini minii'n mitte mitte akeekisanjo aadhdhe. <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Ookkone mannik summuwwi: Yihudake gosatike mininaa'n Yofoonika belto Kalebi'i, <verse eid="NUM 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Simoonike gaosatike mininaa'n Amihuudika belto Selami'eeli'i, <verse eid="NUM 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Biiniyaamixxe gosatike mininaa'n Kisoloonika belto Elidadi'i, <verse eid="NUM 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Daanike gosatike minik akeekisanjo Yugiika belto Buqi, <verse eid="NUM 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Yooseefika belto Minaaseeke gosatike minenaa'n sooreesa Sufeedika belto Ani'eeli'i, <verse eid="NUM 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Yooseefika belto Efireemike gosatike minina'n akeekisanjo Shifixxanika belto Qemu'eeli'i, <verse eid="NUM 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Zabilonike gosatike mininaa'n akeekisanjo Fernak belto Elisaafaanii'i, <verse eid="NUM 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Yisakoorike gosatike mininaa'n akeekisanjo Hoozaka belto Felixi'eeli'i, <verse eid="NUM 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Aseerik gosatike mininaa'n akeekisanjo Seeleemika belto Ahihuudii'i, <verse eid="NUM 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Nefitaalemike gosatike mininaa'n akeekisanjo Amihuudika belto Feda'eeli'i.»<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Kunni Kenaanik bogi giddo Isira'eelike manni'a geego qoodaashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajeeke mannan.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s1">Leewwitote'e Uwwemeeka Qachchuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Iyyaariko wido Yordaanoosike galaani bira Mo'aabike diidda'ni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'ni hiyyeeqic, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />«Isira'eelito dhaaldaake qadaadinaa'n Leewwitote'e hexxaaka qachchuwwa insa'ne'a uunaashsha Isira'eelika arda ajaji; qachchuwwi qarqaranna hori bobbaalsatika boganna insa'ne'a uwwee. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Iikki qachchuwwi insa'ne he'naake kadaa wodda, hori bobba'ak bogi kinni insa'neeke lali'a, gedhebi'a, re'uwwa'anna wele horuwwike galduma'a kadaan.<verse eid="NUM 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />«Qachchi qarqara Leewwitotee uutinaak horiinxe bobba'iik bogi, ookkone qachchinke dalla'ii'ni mitte kuma ciqile kadowwaal <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Iitanni qachchi oddo gateena'a dhidhimi darree'ni lame kuma ciqile, bita'i darree'ni lame kuma ciqile, boroti darree'ni lame kuma ciqile, middi darree'ni lame kuma ciqile qachchakenaa'n gadhi'a mike; Insa'ne'e konnee boonchuwwa qachchiinka hore bobba'atixxe bakka asse'naan.<verse eid="NUM 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gollatatike Qachchuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />«Leewwitotee uutinaake qachchuwwana'ni jaani, manjo anga sa'eeki manji baaje ofo'laake gollatatike qachchuwwa kadaan. Higgeenni shoole tommenna lame qachcha insa'ne'a uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Hore bobaalsinaake quchchuwwinnin mitteba shoole tommenna saddeeta qachcha Leewwitote'e uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Isira'eelik ardi dhaaleke boginaa'ni Leewwitotee uutinak qachchuwwi mitti mittenge gosa gosak mini hadi afeeke qadaadixxe qixxe'n kadaani. Hoddo laakkossike gosatike mininaa'n heddo qachchuwwa, heenoke laakkossikenaa'n kinni shiixxoka qachchuwwa aaxxine uwwe.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:1-42">Iya. 21:1-42</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Danot Manjo Anga Sa'eekir Offo'laaka Qachchuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 19:1-13">Lew. 19:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Iya. 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Ookkoo'ni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e hiyyeeqic: <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />«Isira'eelika arda hitattoqic, ‹Kenaanike bogiba'a e'yatee Yordaanoosika galaana fooffinaa wodda, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />danoti manjo anga sa'eeki manji baaje ofo'laaka qachcha kadaashsha golatatika qachchuwwa fi'le. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Kunni qachchuwwi mitti lubbo manjiinxa balleesek manji ardiinxe oddo'ni murtete'e shiqebaa edo reyabaashsha halo fulammakena'ni gollataake qachchuwwa kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Kunne Leewitote uutina'naake quchchuwwinaa'n jaani ha'noke golatatike qachchuwwa kadaan. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Tennexxe'e sase Yordaanoosik galaani kayya ittanni sase Kenaani giddo gollatike qachchuwwa kado'a uwwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Danoti manjo anga sa'eeki huuni manjinna baaje giddo ofo'laak kunni jaani qachchuwwi Isira'eelike ardi'a, alagakeenna insa'e giddo hedhaake wele ardi'a gollatatike qachchuwwa kadaan.<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />« ‹Mitti manji wele manjo reyaashsha sibiljik ganoole isi mundiinke manjon; isinna shiyemaan. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Yookiin mitti manji manjo shiya dande'aake kinjinni manjo reyaashsha ganoole isi mundiinke manjon; isinna shiyemaan. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Yookaani mitti manji manjo shiya dande'aake haqichchinni mitte manjo reyaashsha ganoole isi mundiinke manjon; isinna shiyemaan; <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Shiyememmake manji'a halo fulammak manji ookkone'e anga sa'emmaka manjo shiyowwaal; isinni afemeexxa yanna isoo'o shiyowwaal. <verse eid="NUM 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />Mitti manji ege'na'ni mitte manjo gibati dhiibe ibisoole yookaani reyaasha miselcho iso'ni darboole, <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />yookaani iso gibiyyoti angati ganee'na'a reyoole, ikki manji shiyemowwaal; isi mundiinke manjoni; shiyemeeke'e halo fulammak manjichchinna isinni afemeeba iso'o shiyowwaal.<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />« ‹Yaane kinni naaphummatite kadde'ebaang dedhik mitti manji mitte dhiibe ibisoole yookaan dedhange'n miselcho iso'ni darboole, <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />yookaan shiya dand'aaka kinjo iso'o afebaang mitte manjo'n darbee'na reyoole, naapha isike kadagopheemmaxxenna iso'o miidho'a ege'na'n asseeke kadagophemmaxxe, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />Tuutatinna konne manjichcho'ninna shiyemeeke'e halo fulammakixxe oddo'ni murte uutaak, shiyemmakixxe'ninna halo fulammakixxe oddo'n uwwememmake seeruwwixxe aadannite kaddaan. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Tuutatinna manjo anga sa'ati ku'lemeeka manjichcho halo fulammake manjichchixxe anganaa'n gatisiyyoti baajemmake gollatatike qachchiba'a iso'o illeema hissitowwaal; woyyitte zayitenni hariirememmak qeesooletik sooressi reyaaqico'n ookkonni turowwaal.<verse eid="NUM 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />« ‹Yaane kinni manjo anga sa'ati ku'lemeek manji, baaje ofo'la'neeke gollatatike qachchixxe gabala gadho baaje fulee'naa'a <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />halo fulammakinna qachchiinxe gabala gadho isinni afemoole ookkone'e ku'lemeemmaka shiya dande'aan; mundii manjo kadatinna laqemabaan. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Anga sa'ati ku'lememmakinna qeesoletik sooresi reyaaqico'ni gollatatike qachchi giddo turowwaal. Isi ifike qadaadiba'a higa dande'aak qeesoletik sooresi reyeechchi uduman callan.<verse eid="NUM 35:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />« ‹Yoona tinni seeriinxi aada hexxinaake boga duuchcha'n ha'no'anna ha'nooxxe ila ila'a galdumake kaddaan.<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />« ‹Manjo anga sa'eeki huuni manjinna reyo iso'ni murendaaki dhuga'a kuldoole callani; kaddomale huunni manjinna mitti manji dhuga'a kuleexxe callinni shiyyemabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:6">Lew. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:15">19:15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:7">Lak. 27:7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NUM 35:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />« ‹Manjo anga sa'at shiyema hasissaake manjixxee lubbotika hira aaxxinoqqe'e; isi shiyyemuun; gatiyyo hasissabaan.<verse eid="NUM 35:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />« ‹Golatatike qachcha'n baajeexxi e'yeeke, hoone manjixxeenna lubbotika hira adhdhiyyoti qeesoletik sooressi reyebaa edi darre ifike bogiba'a illeema higeexxi ookko hedhaashsha assitinoqqe'e.<verse eid="NUM 35:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />« ‹Munde boga battoossitammaxxee, munde dundeeke bogixxa cubbo bira dandeessissaak wele manjixxe mundennite kadebaak ookkone mude dunemmake manjichchixxe munde callinnite kaddemmaxxe'e, giddo hexxineeka boga mundeti battoossitinoqqe'e. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Ani Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'no'o Isira'eelike ardi giddo hedha'annaxxe'e, ha'no hexxinaaka boga aninna giddo galaanneka battoossitinoqqe'e hiyyi› » hiyye.<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s1">Selephe'adike Dubarka Qadaada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Gele'adi'i Makiri'i, Minaase'e Yooseefike gosatike mini mini hadik akeekisanjuwwi Muuseba'anna Isira'eelitotike mini haduwwike akeekisanjuwwa kadeeke manniba'a shinqeexxi, <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />hine qic: «Ookkone hixiki Isira'eelike ardi'a qooddota'a Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atee'e gootta no'oka ajajeeshanni dayyo no'oke Selephe'adika qadaada dubaara isikee uutattoshsha ajaje'eeni. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Ta'a insa'ne wele Isira'eelixxe gosa gosatike minike manna'n heerummoole, qadaadi insa'neek no'oke annuwwike qadaadinaa'n adhdhemeexxi insaa'ne heerummemmake mannike gosatike minuwwike qadaada'n lebemaan. Iittate kaddoole kinni hixik no'o'o geyeemmaak qadaadi no'o'a heeno'mo'aaten. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Isira'eelitotik Iyyobelyuxxi woga daggaa wodda Slephe'adeke dubarrik qadaadi insa'neke aro'uwwike gosatike minike qadaada'n lebemaan; iita kaddoole insa'neek qadaadi no'ok annuwwike gosatike minike qadaadinaa'n adhdhdhemaan» hine.<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Ookkonechchi uduma Muusse Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti iso'o kulemmaxxa Isira'eelika arda hiyye ajajee qici: «Yooseefike gosatike minixxi horte haasotteek haaso'i dhugaaten. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Tennexxe'e Selephe'adika dubaarra uuddaaxxenni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti: insa'nee ifike annike gosatike mine kadeeke eeneeke manjo'ninna heruma dandeennaan. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Mitti mitting Isira'eelichchi edike ifike annuwwinaa'n dhaalemaake qadaada'ninni gatowwaal. Isira'eeli'n mitte gosatike mininaa'n mitte gosatike miniba'a sa'aak qadaadi hedhebaan. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Mitti mitting Isira'eelichchi ififike anuwwika qadaada dhaaliyyo hasissaammaxxee, hoone Isira'eetotike gosatike mini giddo qadaada dhaaldaaxxi dubarcho ifike annixxe gosake minike manjo'n heeruma hasissaan. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Mitti mitting Isira'eelitotik gosati mini dhaalemmake qadaada'n gatiyyo hasissaammaxxe qadaadi mitte gosatike mininaa'n mitte gosatike miniba'a sa'abaan.»<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Tennexxe'e Selephe'adik dubarri Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse'e ajajemashshanni asse. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Selpha'adike dubar Mahilahi, Tirtsa, Hogila, Milkanna Nu'a anna ifike dayyuwwixxe oose'n heerumme. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Insa'ene Yooseefika belto Minaaseke gosatike minixxe horte'n heerummeemmaxxee qadaadi insa'nek anna ifikixxe gosatike minike qadaadi giddo gate.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Iyyaariko widdo Yoridaanoosike galaani bira Mo'aabike diida'ni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse darree'ni Isira'eelitote'e uwweeki ajajuwwinna seeruwwi konneten.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>